{
    /*************   1.1.0   *************/
    "NPCName:RedPandaBazaar_Linden": "Linden",
    "NPCName:RedPandaBazaar_Sean": "Sean",

    "RedPandaBazaarBank1.5.14": "Discussion about \"Plan\" is prohibited",

    "PlantResearch.38.33": "Empty flower pot",
    "PlantResearch.39.31": "A well-cared-for fern",
    "PlantResearch.41.29": "It seems that ferns are very important plants to the owner here",
    "PlantResearch.42.32.Mail": "The moss growing in Stardew Valley may contain some kind of growth hormone, which, when combined with bone fragments, can greatly increase soil fertility",
    "PlantResearch.42.28.Mail": "Found an unknown moss-covered seed: Discovered at the foot of a mossy tree during green rain weather. Observation result: ^Planting it next to a mature normal tree will significantly speed up the rate at which the normal tree produces moss",

    "FarmerShop": "Farmer's Shop",
    "RedPandaBazaarBank": "Red Panda Bazaar Bank",
    "PlantResearch": "Linden's Plant Research Institute",

    "ChenXiaoMing.Mail.01": "Come find me in town after 8 PM, I think we'd better talk alone. ^^— Your girlfriend, Chen Xiaoming",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Mail.01.2": "[#]Talk with Chen Xiaoming",
    "Linden.Mail.01": "A letter from the Red Panda Plant Research Institute^Hello, @^I am Linden, the representative of the Fern Island Nature Department.^I recently moved to the Red Panda Bazaar and am very interested in the natural plants of Stardew Valley.^However, I don't have enough stamina to conduct field research myself, so I'm writing to ask for your assistance.^If you'd like to visit my institute, you are very welcome.^It's located in the northwest corner of the Red Panda Bazaar.^— Linden",
    "Linden.Mail.01.2": "[#]Linden's Greeting",
    "Linden.Mail.02": "I want to give you a surprise, please come to my Plant Research Institute tonight, okay? ^I think I'll be waiting for you! ^— Linden",
    "Linden.Mail.02.2": "[#]Linden's Invitation",
    "Linden.Mail.03": "Dear @: ^The fern didn't survive. ^I tried everything I could think of. Humidity, temperature, soil, light. Nothing worked. Its last bit of spores couldn't make it. I used to think this was just data. If it fails, write it down and improve next time. But it's different now. I stared at that pot of soil for seven days. Sometimes I thought it moved a bit. But it didn't. ^... ^I used to say some things are worth waiting for. I still think so now. Even if we didn't get to see it this time, thank you for waiting with me. ^I still have tea. Come drink some when you have time. — Linden",
    "Linden.Mail.03.2": "[#]Linden's Invitation",
    "ShiFuShan.Mail.01": "Greetings from the Red Panda Bazaar^To @, nice to write to you.^I am Shi Fushan, the mayor of the Red Panda Bazaar. I heard the farm you run is very impressive, it even made the news! Your mayor Lewis and I are old friends, and every time he talks about your farm, he has a smile on his face. I've been very curious about a practical young person like you.^Hereby, on behalf of the Red Panda Bazaar, I officially invite you to open a shop here. Looking forward to seeing you at the bazaar in the near future.^------Mayor of Red Panda, Shi Fushan[#]Letter from Mayor Shi",
    "ShiFuShan.Mail.02": "To @, ^Thank you very much for your trust in our Red Panda Bazaar. There will probably be many difficulties after opening, so I have enclosed a check for 1000 G from the Red Panda Bank as a startup subsidy to encourage your hard work at the Red Panda Bazaar. ^------Mayor of Red Panda, Shi Fushan%item money 1000 1001 %%[#]Mayor Shi's Check",
    "ShiFuShan.Mail.03": "Dear @, ^Tomorrow we will hold a market day at the Red Panda Bazaar. Everyone will bring out their best goods for sale, including many things you can't normally buy. If you're interested, you shouldn't miss the annual market day! ^------Mayor of Red Panda, Shi Fushan[#]Letter from Mayor Shi",
    "ShiFuShan.Mail.04": "Dear @, ^I loved drinking when I was young, and to this day I have quite a bit of wine saved in my cellar. But since becoming mayor, I often need to stay sober to handle official business, so I'm giving all this wine to you. ^------Shi Fushan[#]Letter from Mayor Shi",
    "ShiFuShan.Mail.05": "Dear @, ^It's very cold in winter. I've enclosed some tea leaves with this letter. Remember to make a cup of hot tea at home and don't catch a cold. ^------Shi Fushan[#]Letter from Mayor Shi",
    "ShiFuShan.Mail.Heart4": "Dear @, ^Enclosed is a check for 10,000 G. I can't help much with your business difficulties, but please accept this token of appreciation. ^Don't feel bad about it, you've done enough for the bazaar. ^Take it, don't overthink it. ^------Shi Fushan[#]Letter from Mayor Shi",

    //******Shi Fushan Events******//
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.1.1.ShiFuShan": "Hello, I am Shi Fushan, the mayor of the Red Panda Bazaar. Are you a tourist here to visit?$0",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.1.2.ShiFuShan": "Unfortunately, there used to be many shops here, but most of them are closed now. Only four shops are still open in the entire bazaar, making it seem a bit deserted.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.1.3.ShiFuShan": "However, some activities have been preserved.$4",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.1.4.ShiFuShan": "JojaMart and local shops have their own raffle tickets, and there are many practical items among the prizes.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.1.5.ShiFuShan": "If you happen to have raffle tickets, you might want to try your luck.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.1.6.ShiFuShan": "There will be more shops here in the future.$4",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.1.7.ShiFuShan": "If you're interested in opening a shop here, you can come talk to me.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.1.8.ShiFuShan": "The best shops in the Red Panda Bazaar right now are Chen Xiaoming's and Li Qingfeng's. If you are interested, you can visit them.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.1.9.ShiFuShan": "Sorry, I still have some official business to deal with, so I won't keep you company.$0",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.1.10.Farmer": "Okay, I'll look around.#Thanks, I'll think about it.#",

    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.2.1.ShiFuShan": "(Shi Fushan is sitting at his desk flipping through documents and looks up at you)$0",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.2.2.ShiFuShan": "You are? Oh, you must be the farmer from Pelican Town.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.2.3.ShiFuShan": "You must have seen my letter.$0",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.2.4.ShiFuShan": "That's right, I invited you to open a shop at our Red Panda Bazaar, and I believe you must have this intention to come find me. I was a bit worried you wouldn't find my address, maybe I live too far out for a mayor.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.2.5.ShiFuShan": "Since you plan to open a shop here, there are a few things I need to make clear to you.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.2.6.ShiFuShan": "First, the shop rent is 5,000 G per season, and a certain amount of tax will be collected when the shop settles its accounts every day.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.2.7.ShiFuShan": "(Thoughtful) As for what the taxes are used for, let me explain briefly.$4",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.2.8.ShiFuShan": "The Red Panda Bazaar is still in its development stage, and the addition and maintenance of various infrastructure must be supported by taxes.$3#$b#Also, merchants need to have basic guarantees so they don't suffer severe losses, so subsidies are issued.$3#$b#Community festivals must also be held to a certain standard, they can't be too shabby.$3#$b#Externally, we will help with promotion to bring in potential customers.$4",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.2.9.ShiFuShan": "Only when the Red Panda Bazaar grows strong can everyone make a lot of money, which isn't bad, right?$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.2.10.ShiFuShan": "I've left the documents on the desk, just go over and sign them if you've made up your mind.$0",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.2.11.ShiFuShan": "We're all on the same team now. If your shop encounters difficulties, come to me. I won't promise a perfect result, but I will do my best.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.2.12.ShiFuShan": "(Shi Fushan stops you)$0",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.2.13.ShiFuShan": "Wait a minute.$0",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.2.14.ShiFuShan": "I sincerely hope you don't encounter any financial difficulties.$2",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.2.15.ShiFuShan": "If you do run into financial trouble, go find Sean. Isn't there a JojaMart at the intersection where you entered the Red Panda Bazaar? There's a bank next to it, and Sean is the manager there.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.2.16.ShiFuShan": "Alright, go on back. You probably have nothing more to talk about with an old man like me.$3",

    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.3.1.ShiFuShan": "Seeing you run over here so often, are you interested in the bazaar, or curious about me, an old man?$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.3.2.Farmer": "Actually, I care more about why you always keep a straight face?#Doesn't it tire you out to keep a straight face all day?#I'm curious how you've had the same expression for so long?#",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.3.3.ShiFuShan": "...To think someone actually cares about that.$2",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.3.4.ShiFuShan": "I don't do it on purpose, it's just a habit.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.3.5.ShiFuShan": "The economy of the Red Panda Bazaar has always been sluggish, so I just can't bring myself to smile.$2",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.3.6.Farmer": "Will the Red Panda Bazaar get better?",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.3.7.ShiFuShan": "It will.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.3.8.ShiFuShan": "A while ago I went to the Governor's banquet. The Governor said he would support the development of Red Panda Town, including the bazaar, of course.$0",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.3.9.ShiFuShan": "However, they said an environmental assessment needs to be done, and a commissioner will be sent to inspect.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.3.10.Farmer": "Does the town have nothing else besides the bazaar?",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.3.11.ShiFuShan": "You noticed it too.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.3.12.ShiFuShan": "Before, a wealthy businessman set his sights on this land and wanted to develop tourism. The Red Panda Bazaar was built then.$0",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.3.13.ShiFuShan": "Unfortunately, he ignored some basic problems, and the popularity slowly dissipated. The businessman ran away, and the farmers left because they lost their land.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.3.14.ShiFuShan": "The few scattered merchants who stayed are probably just reluctant to let their investments go to waste.$2",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.3.15.ShiFuShan": "But don't worry, since I took over this mess, the bazaar has been getting better.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.3.16.ShiFuShan": "Now we are just waiting for that environmental commissioner to arrive.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.3.17.ShiFuShan": "I wonder if it will be that young person with an extraordinary aura.$0",

    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.2.1.ShiFuShan": "Hmm? Why are you here?$0",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.2.2.ShiFuShan": "Have a seat anywhere, let me finish reading what's in my hands first.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.2.3.ShiFuShan": "...$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.2.4.ShiFuShan": "Sigh.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.2.5.Farmer": "What's wrong?",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.2.6.ShiFuShan": "The documents are piled higher than a person. I have to write them every season, and I can never finish.$2",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.2.7.ShiFuShan": "And Sean.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.2.8.Farmer": "What's wrong with Sean?",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.2.9.ShiFuShan": "Came to talk to me about investments again. A young man's drive is a good thing, but he doesn't have to come every day.$2",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.2.10.ShiFuShan": "And Linden.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.2.11.ShiFuShan": "That inspector, not only does he write reports slowly, but he always drags it out until the very last moment to submit them.$5",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.2.12.ShiFuShan": "...",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.2.13.ShiFuShan": "Why am I telling you all this.$2",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.2.14.ShiFuShan": "Getting older, becoming a chatterbox.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBzaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.2.15.ShiFuShan": "Alright, I'm very busy right now, please come back another time. I still have to finish processing these.$2",

    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.4.1.ShiFuShan": "I didn't expect to have so much to talk about with you.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.4.2.ShiFuShan": "Coming to visit this old man again, what's the matter?$0",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.4.3.ShiFuShan": "You didn't run into some business problems, did you?$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.4.4.ShiFuShan": "Tell me about it, maybe I can smooth it out for you.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.4.5.Farmer": "I did run into a little business problem.#1#Actually, I came to listen to a story.#2",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.4.6.ShiFuShan": "Since it's a business problem...$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.4.7.ShiFuShan": "How about this, I'll apply for a check for you later, it might appear in your mailbox tomorrow.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.4.8.ShiFuShan": "Take it, don't overthink it.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.4.9.ShiFuShan": "There shouldn't be anything else, right?$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.4.10.ShiFuShan": "Sigh, I thought you wouldn't be interested anymore.$0",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.4.11.ShiFuShan": "The Red Panda Bazaar is still developing, who knows what the future holds. Let me talk about myself.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.4.12.ShiFuShan": "I was a merchant when I was young, and my thirst for money drove me away from the small town. I've visited all over the Fern Islands, met many interesting people, and seen many tricks.$2",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.4.13.ShiFuShan": "Later, I gradually grew tired of these things, but when I returned to my hometown, I found it was just an empty shell.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.4.14.ShiFuShan": "After that, I became the mayor and started managing all this. I don't know if the old folks in the neighboring towns feel the same way.$2",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.4.15.ShiFuShan": "I'm getting off track. Speaking of which, there are hardly any young people in town, didn't that disappoint you?$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.4.16.Farmer": "No, I'm here to make money, not in the mood for romance.#No, being with you old folks feels very welcoming.#You're so right, I've walked around for so long, and there are too few people I can talk to.#",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.4.17.ShiFuShan": "......",

    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.6.1.ShiFuShan": "Good day, @.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.6.2.Lewis": "Isn't this @?$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.6.3.Lewis": "Shi Fushan and I were just talking about you.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.6.4.Lewis": "Shi Fushan, you old coot, you've kidnapped my farmer. Lately, his shipping bin is practically crawling with spiders.$2",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.6.5.ShiFuShan": "Everyone can use their own hands to make money, what's wrong with that? Haven't I told you this a long time ago?$0",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.6.6.Lewis": "Haha! Let's not talk about that. What brings you here?$0",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.6.7.Lewis": "As you can see, Shi Fushan and I are chatting. You also think Shi Fushan is an old sourpuss, right?$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.6.8.ShiFuShan": "I told you it's a habit, stop making fun of me.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.6.9.Farmer": "You guys look like you have a good relationship.#Do I have to reach your age to understand what you're saying?#What an interesting conversation, can I join?#3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.6.10.Lewis": "We're old friends, sort of. I often invite Shi Fushan to visit Pelican Town, but he always uses his heavy workload as an excuse.$0",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.6.11.Lewis": "So I often come over to see what this old guy is so busy with.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.6.12.ShiFuShan": "When the Red Panda Bazaar was just an empty shell, I was truly busy from start to finish. I had to handle matters big and small, and couldn't get away at all.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.6.13.Lewis": "How come you're teasing us too?$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.6.14.ShiFuShan": "I thought I had long lost touch with the youth. People in town aren't willing to talk to me much.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.6.15.Lewis": "Haven't you realized that your expression is too serious?$5",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.6.16.Lewis": "We were just talking about your recent achievements. When you first moved from Zuzu City, I always worried you wouldn't get used to life in Pelican Town.$2",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.6.17.Lewis": "Now I see I underestimated you. Someone like you could achieve success anywhere.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.6.18.ShiFuShan": "The Red Panda Bazaar wouldn't have reached this point without you. My town is becoming more and more inseparable from you.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.6.19.Lewis": "I never said I was giving @ to you.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.6.20.Lewis": "But, you can go wherever you want in the end. I just hope you can do well in everything you want to do.$5",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.6.21.ShiFuShan": "It looks like Lewis treats you like his own grandchild.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.6.22.Farmer": "I have a grandfather, he's the one who let me inherit the farm.#1#I don't know, but his words are right.#2#Lewis is just afraid I'll leave.#3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.6.23.ShiFuShan": "Didn't expect you to value family so much. Your grandfather must be very proud to have you as a grandchild.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.6.24.ShiFuShan": "You just agree with his words, right? I highly agree with what he said too.$2",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.6.25.ShiFuShan": "I don't want to see you go either. If you leave, the Red Panda Bazaar will be deserted again.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.6.26.ShiFuShan": "In the future, if there's anything new at the Red Panda Bazaar, just come to me directly, and I'll patiently explain it to you.$4",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.6.27.ShiFuShan": "I'll talk to Lewis another day.$0",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.6.28.ShiFuShan": "Well then, goodbye. I still have official business to handle and must head back as soon as possible.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.ShiFuShan.Heart.6.29.Farmer": "Goodbye",
    //******Linden Events******//
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.1.1.Linden": "Is this bazaar the only thing in Red Panda Town?$2",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.1.2.Linden": "...Quite a weird development path.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.1.3.ShiFuShan": "These are all problems left over from history. Red Panda Town wants to get out of this predicament now.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.1.4.Linden": "I've heard that where JOJA is, development is fast, but environmental issues are ignored.$5",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.1.5.ShiFuShan": "I can't drive JOJA out either. It's because of JOJA that the town's economy has been able to stay afloat.$2",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.1.6.Linden": "That's not what you said in the document to the Governor.$5",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.1.7.ShiFuShan": "If I didn't say that, the Governor wouldn't have sent you here. And this town would see no hope.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.1.8.Linden": "You should really be glad that the commissioner the Governor dispatched is me. You took a huge risk.$5",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.1.9.Linden": "When I heard about this in the department, I took it on voluntarily.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.1.10.Linden": "You guessed I would take over voluntarily, right?$0",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.1.11.ShiFuShan": "...$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.1.12.Linden": "Staying silent?$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.1.13.Linden": "Remember, you owe me a favor.$5",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.1.14.Linden": "Once I finish writing the report, I'll go back to my post this afternoon.$0",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.1.15.Farmer": "What are you guys talking about?",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.1.16.ShiFuShan": "...You heard us?$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.1.17.Farmer": "I heard a little bit.#1#Didn't hear clearly, but it seems he mentioned the Governor.#2#Only heard the last few sentences.#3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.1.18.ShiFuShan": "...Makes sense.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.1.19.ShiFuShan": "That's right, he really was sent by the Governor.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.1.20.ShiFuShan": "That's good. It's nothing important.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.1.21.ShiFuShan": "About the document to the Governor... I told a little lie.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.1.22.ShiFuShan": "But it was all for the town's development.$4",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.1.23.ShiFuShan": "I hope you won't go around telling people.$2",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.1.24.Farmer": "I won't tell.#1#Why did you lie?#2#Won't Linden expose you?#3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.1.25.ShiFuShan": "Thanks.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.1.26.ShiFuShan": "It's a long story. Simply put, if I told the truth, the Governor wouldn't send anyone to help us.$2",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.1.27.ShiFuShan": "He won't. He saw through it, but he still helped me.$4",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.1.28.ShiFuShan": "Sorry, I have to go handle some official business.$0",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.1.29.ShiFuShan": "Let's talk another day.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.1.30.Farmer": "(To yourself) Red Panda Bazaar... is more complicated than it looks.",

    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.2.1.Linden": "We meet again.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.2.2.Linden": "I saw you earlier when I was talking with the Mayor. Are you a resident of this town?$4",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.2.3.Farmer": "I'm a farmer from Pelican Town.",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.2.4.Linden": "Pelican Town? I've read about it in the newspaper. The one in Stardew Valley?$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.2.5.Farmer": "Yes, that's the one.",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.2.6.Linden": "That's quite far. You manage the whole farm by yourself?$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.2.7.Farmer": "Yes.",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.2.8.Linden": "That's not easy.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.2.9.Linden": "...Wait a minute. Aren't you curious why I'm still here?$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.2.10.Farmer": "Didn't you go back to your post?",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.2.11.Linden": "I was supposed to.$2",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.2.12.Linden": "I told the Governor the truth about the situation here. The Governor asked me to come back and act as an inspector.$0",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.2.13.Linden": "Now I am the natural environment inspector for the Red Panda Bazaar. A long-term one.$4",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.2.14.Farmer": "So you're not leaving?",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.2.15.Linden": "Not leaving.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.2.16.Farmer": "Then what about your previous job?",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.2.17.Linden": "I didn't expect you to care about my job.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.2.18.Linden": "I do have my own research work to do. Regarding plants.$4",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.2.19.Linden": "It's just that the Mayor approved a greenhouse for me to serve as my exclusive research institute, right in the northwest corner of the bazaar.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.2.20.Linden": "If you are interested in plants, or need any advice for the crops you grow on your farm, you can come find me.$4",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.2.21.Farmer": "Then I'll come bother you often from now on.",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.2.22.Linden": "...Mhm.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.2.23.Linden": "But let's be clear upfront, I'm not very good at making conversation. I might not be a great host.$2",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.2.24.Farmer": "That's fine.",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.2.25.Linden": "Then that's it. I have things to do, so I'll be going now.$0",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.2.26.Linden": "By the way, my name is Linden. A botanist from the Fern Islands Nature Research Department.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.2.27.Linden": "...Forgot to mention that earlier.$4",

    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.2.1.Linden": "Hmm...$2#$b#Can I have a golden-flavored popsicle?$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.2.2.LiQingFeng": "It's right in the freezer, you can grab it yourself~$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.2.3.Linden": "Sorry, then I'll get it myself.$4",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.2.4.Linden": "......Actually, I'll take the fern-flavored one.$2",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.2.5.LiQingFeng": "If you don't hurry up, all the cold air will escape, and my popsicles will all melt.$0",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.2.6.Linden": "Sigh, then I'll take both flavors.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.2.7.LiQingFeng": "Really? Since you've taken them out, don't put them back in.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.2.8.LiQingFeng": "I remember last time you couldn't finish two popsicles by yourself, the other one had already melted by the time you recovered.",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.2.9.Linden": "Couldn't you have reminded me about that?$2#$b#And now you won't even let me put it back.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.2.10.Linden": "What should I do with this other one?$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.2.11.Linden": "Oh, it's @. Are you interested in trying a specialty of the Red Panda Bazaar?$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.2.12.Linden": "I happen to have an extra popsicle in my hand. Which one do you want?$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.2.13.Farmer": "#Golden flavor#Fern flavor",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.2.14.Linden": "Good thing you're here, otherwise I wouldn't know what to do with the leftover popsicle.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.2.15.Linden": "I actually quite like eating sweets.$1#$b#But for the sake of my dental health and my wallet, I probably won't be coming here for a while.$0",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.2.16.LiQingFeng": "Eh?$3#$b#Then what about the new batch of popsicles I just got in.$2#$b#I thought you were going to let me earn a few more bucks.$2",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.2.17.Linden": "Then I'm really sorry, I'm going to lock myself in the research institute from now on, heh heh......$1",

    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.4.1.Linden": "Ah, @, what brings you here?$4",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.4.2.Linden": "Sorry, the room is a bit messy.$3#$b#I was processing some paperwork today and ran into a bit of an issue.",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.4.3.Linden": "Can you pretend you didn't see this?$4",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.4.4.Farmer": "Of course, I must have hallucinated from farming too much, I didn't see anything.",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.4.5.Farmer": "Such a funny thing, shouldn't I share it with everyone?",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.4.6.Linden": "Thanks.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.4.7.Linden": "You...$5#$b#Nevermind, pretend I didn't say anything.",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.4.8.Linden": "Can you give me a hand?$2#$b#Organizing these documents alone takes too long.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.4.9.Farmer": "Of course",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.4.10.Linden": "Thanks.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.4.11.Linden": "These are the documents Mayor Shi brought over, records from when the Red Panda Bazaar project was initiated.$0#$b#It involves natural resource utilization and land development, I need to check it thoroughly.$4",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.4.12.Linden": "You probably remember that I am the inspector assigned by the Governor.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.4.13.Linden": "But to be honest, I prefer doing plant research.$2#$b#Work is work, hobbies are hobbies.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.4.14.Linden": "Use the focus of work to cultivate hobbies, and use the purity of hobbies to feed back into work.$4",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.4.15.Farmer": "You are very right, but most people are already trying their hardest just to get their own jobs done.",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.4.16.Farmer": "Exactly, a hobby is a gift you leave for yourself.",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.4.17.Linden": "That's true too.$4",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.4.18.Linden": "I still have to keep battling these documents, so I won't entertain you any longer.$1#$b#I'll show you something another day.$1",

    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.6.1.Linden": "You saw the letter I left, right?$2",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.6.2.Linden": "Sorry, I said before that I wanted to show you something.$2#$b#Now it seems I'm going to disappoint you.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.6.3.Linden": "Have a cup of tea first.$4",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.6.4.Linden": "Green tea. Theanine can keep you awake without making you hyper, it's very suitable for people who need to concentrate on work.$2",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.6.5.Linden": "You should try some too.$4",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.6.6.Farmer": "It seems to have a sweet taste",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.6.7.Farmer": "It seems a little bitter",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.6.8.Linden": "You really get it.$1#$b#I mostly stay in the institute alone on weekdays, so I can only really talk when I'm with you.$4",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.6.9.Linden": "Bitterness is the most direct feeling.$2#$b#Just like farm work, tired is tired, there's nothing to hide.$4#$b#Sorry, I mostly stay alone in the institute on weekdays, so I can only really talk when I'm with you.$4",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.6.10.Farmer": "What were you just doing, can I help you?",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.6.11.Linden": "This is a fern I found by the drainage outlet on the outskirts of town.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.6.12.Linden": "There is mild pollution left over from JOJA's early years over there.$5#$b#It's a miracle that it survived.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.6.13.Linden": "I originally wanted to make it into a specimen, as a record.$0#$b#A record that on this over-developed land, there was once stubbornly growing life.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.6.14.Linden": "It's not a pest problem, nor is it an issue with my care.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.6.15.Linden": "It adapted to the polluted soil. Moving it to the clean greenhouse actually accelerated its decay.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.6.16.Linden": "It's quite ironic. Pollution is its baseline, while cleanliness became a burden.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.6.17.Linden": "Sometimes I wonder... are all these things I've learned completely useless.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.6.18.Farmer": "#Let's create a suitable micro-environment for it together#It's okay, it's just a plant specimen",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.6.19.Linden": "...Together?$2",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.6.20.Linden": "I tried three times and failed every time. I had originally given up.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.6.21.Linden": "But you're different. You understand the land.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.6.22.Linden": "These are its last spores.$2",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.6.23.Linden": "Try again?$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.6.24.Farmer": "Yeah, let's try it together.",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.6.2.1.Linden": "You're right, it's just a specimen.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.6.2.2.Linden": "Viewing failure rationally is a basic quality of scientific research.$4",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.6.2.3.Linden": "But...$5#$b#Nevermind, let's not talk about this.$2",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.6.2.4.Linden": "The tea isn't cold yet, finish drinking before you leave.$1",

    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.1.Linden": "It's you... coming over so late.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.2.Linden": "Sit anywhere, I don't have the energy to clean up tonight.$4",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.3.Farmer": "Are you still investigating the town's land issues?",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.4.Farmer": "You look very tired, there's no need to push yourself so hard.",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.5.Linden": "Mhm. Routine supervision during the day, and I can only secretly organize these at night.$2",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.6.Linden": "There's a problem with the document Mayor Shi gave to the Governor.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.7.Linden": "I saw through it, but I still helped him hide it and voluntarily took over this errand.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.8.Linden": "No one forced me. I chose it myself.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.9.Linden": "Everyone in the department only looks at political achievements and data.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.10.Linden": "If I reported truthfully, the Governor would directly shut down the bazaar and hold the Mayor accountable.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.11.Linden": "The town's economy would be finished, and the residents would all have to move away.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.12.Linden": "I understood Mayor Shi's helplessness, so I took a gamble.$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.13.Linden": "I owe him my honesty, and I also owe this town a chance at salvation.$2",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.14.Linden": "Others just think I'm a rigid supervisor.$3#$b#Only I know that I came here to guide, not to assign blame.$4",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.15.Farmer": "You are very gentle, just not good at expressing it.",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.16.Farmer": "Beyond the rules, there should naturally be some human warmth.",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.17.Linden": "...When you say that, I don't know how to respond.$2#$b#Anyway, I don't want to watch a town trying so hard to survive get crushed.$4",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.18.Linden": "Exactly. That's also the reason why I gave up my job at the headquarters and came here.$4",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.19.Linden": "Compared to cold evaluations, living plants and a living town are the most important things.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.20.Linden": "Actually, I'm very glad I took over this assignment.$4",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.21.Linden": "I used to think researching plants was enough. Now... it's different.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.22.Linden": "Nevermind, let's not talk about it anymore.$2#$b#The tea is gone, I'll go get a refill.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.23.Linden": "...You don't have to leave.$2#$b#Just sit.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.24.Linden": "Once I finish organizing the plan, I'll take you to the greenhouse to take a look.$4",

    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.2.1.Linden": "You're here. This is the surprise I mentioned in the letter.$4",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.2.2.Linden": "Our spores... are alive.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.2.3.Linden": "I've researched plants for so many years, I've seen countless specimens that are more precious and lush than this one.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.2.4.Linden": "But never has a plant moved me like this one.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.2.5.Linden": "Ferns don't bloom or bear fruit, they have no spectacular blossoming, only a long dormancy and perseverance.$4",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.2.6.Linden": "It eked out a living in polluted soil, decayed in a clean environment, and finally, relying on the patience of both of us, struggled out with new vitality.$4",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.2.7.Linden": "I study the life of plants, watching them sprout, grow leaves, age, and fall silent... but since meeting you, I finally understand why some lives are willing to lay dormant for a whole year, just to wait for one rebirth—because it's worth the wait.$4",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.2.8.Linden": "In the past, when doing research, I only believed in data, rules, and absolute right or wrong.$4",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.2.9.Linden": "You made me understand that the most moving thing about life is never its perfect growth, but the wait of not giving up, and the gentleness of walking side by side.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.2.10.Linden": "Thank you. Not only did you save this fern, but you also saved that version of me that was constantly in self-denial.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.2.11.Linden": "To me, you haven't been just an ordinary collaborative farmer for a long time.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Linden.Heart.8.2.12.Linden": "You are my most precious rebirth and surprise on this land.$1",

    "Event.Bank.1.1.Sean": "Hello.$1#$b#Do you need to handle any business?$2",
    "Event.Bank.1.2.Farmer": "Mayor Shi told me to come find you.",
    "Event.Bank.1.3.Sean": "He told you to come find me?$1",
    "Event.Bank.1.4.Sean": "...$2",
    "Event.Bank.1.5.Sean": "He sure knows how to drum up business for me.$1#$b#You must have opened a shop, right?$0#$b#How's business?$2",
    "Event.Bank.1.6.Sean": "If you need any cash flow, I can take a look for you.$1#$b#Deposits, loans, financial advice, I can do it all.$1",
    "Event.Bank.1.7.Farmer": "Do you manage this bank all by yourself?",
    "Event.Bank.1.8.Sean": "Mhm.$2#$b#It's a small place, one person is enough.$2",
    "Event.Bank.1.9.Farmer": "Why choose here?",
    "Event.Bank.1.10.Sean": "...$2#$b#Don't you think a small town needs a bank more than a big city does?$1",
    "Event.Bank.1.11.Sean": "Big cities have banks everywhere. They don't lack me.$2#$b#But here, every transaction I handle can help someone.$1",
    "Event.Bank.1.12.Sean": "...Sorry, I talked too much.$2",
    "Event.Bank.1.13.Sean": "Are you going to handle any business? If not, I need to get back to reading these documents.$0",
    "Event.Bank.1.14.Farmer": "Then I'll be going now.",
    "Event.Bank.1.15.Sean": "Mhm.$0#$b#Say hello... to Mayor Shi for me.$1",
    "Event.Bank.1.16.Farmer": "Okay.",
    "Event.Bank.1.17.Sean": "...Thanks.$1",
    //******Linden Daily Dialogue******//
    "Linden.Introduction": "...Hello, I am Linden, the new natural environment inspector.#$b#The greenhouse in the northwest corner of the town is my research institute, you can find me there if you need anything.$2",
    "Linden.danceRejection": "Dance? I'm not very good at it... I'll pass.$2",
    "Linden.divorced": "I don't really want to have much to do with you anymore.#$b#Let's just leave it at that.$5",
    "Linden.breakUp": "...I understand. Let's just end it here.$5",
    "Linden.DumpsterDiveComment": "There probably aren't any plant specimens you're looking for in the trash can, right?$3",
    "Linden.AcceptBouquet": "Is this... for me?$3#$b#I... I'm very happy. Thank you.$1",
    "Linden.HitBySlingshot": "...Please don't do that.$5",
    "Linden.MovieInvitation": "Watch a movie? Yes, let's go together!$1",
    "Linden.Spouse.MonstersInHouse": "How could there be this kind of thing in the house?$3#$b#You step back, I'll handle it.$4",
    "Linden.SpouseStardrop": "This is... something I cultivated in the institute, for you.#$b#I hope you like it.$1",
    "Linden.RejectBouquet.Divorced": "We are already over, please take it back.$5",
    "Linden.RejectBouquet.NpcAlreadyMarried": "Don't you already have a partner? This is inappropriate, and I wouldn't like someone who is unfaithful to their significant other.$5",
    "Linden.RejectBouquet.VeryLowHearts": "We aren't close enough for this yet... Sorry.$2",
    "Linden.RejectBouquet.LowHearts": "I think we still need more time to get to know each other, I'm sorry.$3",
    "Linden.RejectGift.Divorced": "No need, please take it back.$5",
    "Linden.RejectMermaidPendant.PlayerWithSomeoneElse": "Don't you already have a significant other? What is the meaning of this?$5",
    "Linden.RejectMermaidPendant.Divorced": "It's impossible for us now, please don't do this.$5",
    "Linden.RejectMermaidPendant.NpcWithSomeoneElse": "Sorry... I already have someone I care about.$3",
    "Linden.RejectMermaidPendant.Under8Hearts": "We aren't in that kind of relationship yet... Sorry.$2",
    "Linden.RejectMermaidPendant.Under10Hearts": "Wait a little longer... I'm afraid I still need some time.$3",
    "Linden.RejectMermaidPendant.Under10Hearts.AskedAgain": "I've said it already... please give me some more time.$3",
    "Linden.RejectMermaidPendant.NeedHouseUpgrade": "The house is small? It's fine, I'd be happy to squeeze in with you$1#$b#But it would be better if it were a bit bigger, right?$2",
    "Linden.RejectMovieTicket.AlreadyInvitedBySomeoneElse": "Sorry... someone has already asked me out.$3",
    "Linden.RejectMovieTicket.AlreadyWatchedThisWeek": "I already went once this week... let's go next week.$2",
    "Linden.RejectMovieTicket.Divorced": "Never mind... I still have some paperwork to deal with as soon as possible.$5",
    "Linden.FlowerDance.Accept_Spouse": "Of course I'd love to! It's my honor to dance with you, and even though I'm not good at it, I could never refuse you.$1",
    "Linden.FlowerDance.Accept": "You want to dance with me? Um, alright.$1#$b#I'll be extra careful, sorry, I'm really bad at dancing.$4",
    "Linden.cc.Complete": "You repaired the Community Center? That's amazing.$4#$b#I'd really like to go take a look when I have the chance.$1",
    "Linden.cc.Bus": "Is the bus running again? That's great.#$b#It will be much more convenient to travel from now on.$1",
    "Linden.joja.Begin": "I heard Joja is going to turn your Community Center into a warehouse...$3#$b#I thought your mayor would find a way to repair it.$3",
    "Linden.movieTheater": "Pelican Town has a movie theater now? Hmm, I'd like to go see it if I have the chance.#$b#Watching movies at home... always lacks a certain atmosphere.$2",
    "Linden.GreenRain": "This rain... has a very strange color.$3#$b#I'll go take samples once the rain stops to see if there are any anomalies.$4",
    "Linden.GreenRainFinished": "The results from yesterday's green rain samples are out, nothing abnormal.#$b#Good thing it didn't cause any harm.$4",
    "Linden.GreenRain.2": "Is it back again? This green rain...$3#$b#The last sampling results were too normal, let's continue the research this time, hopefully we'll have some new discoveries.$5",
    "Linden.Resort": "A resort? I'm just here to sample the nearby plants.$2#$b#But the environment is indeed quite nice.",
    "Linden.Mon.0h": "A new week. Another email from my mentor came, urging me to submit a progress report.$3",
    "Linden.Tue.0h": "Is something the matter? ...My eyes were about to go blind from reading literature earlier.$2",
    "Linden.Wed.0h": "I'm not too used to talking a lot with others.$2#$b#But if you want to ask about plants, you can ask me.$4",
    "Linden.Thu.0h": "I have official business today, need to take a stroll around the town.$3#$b#Hope I don't have to walk too far.",
    "Linden.Fri.0h": "The week is almost over. My paper isn't finished yet, and the samples aren't fully analyzed.$3",
    "Linden.Sat.0h": "I usually stay in the institute on weekends, organize the data for the week, and then go find Mayor Shi Fushan.",
    "Linden.Sun.0h": "Taking a day off today? Makes no difference to me, I still have to go report to Mayor Shi Fushan later.$2",
    "Linden.Mon.2h": "Mondays are always the busiest. Is it like that on your farm too?",
    "Linden.Tue.2h": "The weather is nice today. Are you out for a walk too?$1",
    "Linden.Wed.2h": "The plants in the institute haven't been in a good state lately, I'm trying to figure out how to adjust the humidity.$3",
    "Linden.Thu.2h": "Research is quite mentally draining, maybe that's why I like eating sweets.$4#$b#The stuff in Qingfeng's shop is decent.",
    "Linden.Fri.2h": "Another week is about to pass, time flies so fast.$2#$b#It's just that my paper hasn't made any progress.$3",
    "Linden.Sat.2h": "On weekends, I usually organize my research records, and then go report to Mayor Shi Fushan.",
    "Linden.Sun.2h": "Since it's the weekend, I should really treat myself. If I have time, I'll go to Li Qingfeng's shop to see what's good to eat.$1",
    "Linden.Mon.4h": "Monday again. How was your weekend?$1#$b#Me? I spent two days at Mayor Shi Fushan's place.$2",
    "Linden.Tue.4h": "Documents are piled up on the desk again, I really can't help it.$3",
    "Linden.Wed.4h": "Mayor Shi Fushan paid me today, now I can splurge my research funds for a while.$1",
    "Linden.Thu.4h": "Sean is the manager of the Red Panda Bank, he's always pestering people to deposit money with him, it's quite annoying.$3",
    "Linden.Fri.4h": "Do you want to come hang out at the institute this weekend? I'll treat you to a cup of green tea.$4",
    "Linden.Sat.4h": "You still run around everywhere on your day off? Aren't you tired? I really envy your stamina.$2",
    "Linden.Sun.4h": "My research funds are running out again, gotta go find Sean to withdraw some.$3",
    "Linden.Mon.6h": "Why is it that every time I run into Chen Xiaoming, she never has anything nice to say?$5#$b#Never mind, let's not talk about her, it ruins the mood.$2",
    "Linden.Tue.6h": "Every time I see you, my mood gets a little better.$1",
    "Linden.Wed.6h": "Want to take a walk with me? But you usually seem very busy.$1#$b#Just around town, we won't go far.",
    "Linden.Thu.6h": "How are you? Nice to meet you. ...Does that sound a bit weird?$2",
    "Linden.Fri.6h": "You probably don't even have free time on the weekends, right? It seems you're a workaholic just like me, I knew there was a reason we get along so well.$1",
    "Linden.Sat.6h": "You don't have to go out of your way to find me... but I'm very glad to see you drop by to say hello.$1",
    "Linden.Sun.6h": "I really want to drop my work and go for a walk with you, but I can't.$1#$b#I still have to go report to Shi Fushan this weekend.$2",
    "Linden.Mon.8h": "A new week, with you here, it feels less unbearable.$1",
    "Linden.Tue.8h": "Seeing you today gives me the motivation to keep writing my paper.$1",
    "Linden.Wed.8h": "Let's find a time to drink tea together, I find that I always have endless things to talk about when I'm with you.$4",
    "Linden.Thu.8h": "I was just thinking about you, do you want to stay in the institute with me today?$1",
    "Linden.Fri.8h": "I want to spend the weekend with you, is that okay?$1",
    "Linden.Sat.8h": "If I wasn't going to the institute, I'd just want to stay with you today.$1",
    "Linden.Sun.8h": "Chatting with you is the thing I look forward to most all week.$1",
    "Linden.Mon.10h": "A new week has begun, it's just a pity that I have to face my mentor's urging for drafts again.$2#$b#Will you come see me later? Seeing you gives me motivation.",
    "Linden.Tue.10h": "No matter what I do today, I have to think of you to keep going.$2#$b#I'm even spacing out when analyzing samples.",
    "Linden.Wed.10h": "Do you have a favorite plant? ...I feel like I've asked that many times.$1#$b#I like ferns the most, because they aren't showy, but they live very tenaciously.",
    "Linden.Thu.10h": "My dear, do you have anything you'd like to share with me today?$1",
    "Linden.Fri.10h": "Do you want to go to the institute with me this weekend to see the new plants I've cultivated? I'll make you a cup of tea, and spend the whole afternoon with you.$1",
    "Linden.Sat.10h": "Still have to run around for work and my paper, but whenever I think of you I can't let myself get discouraged. You're so amazing, I need to do my best too.$2",
    "Linden.Sun.10h": "Every day I spend with you, I will record it just like I record the plants in the institute. Looking back on them when we are old, how nostalgic it will be.$1",
    "Linden.summer.Mon.0h": "Summer is too hot, and it's even stuffier in the greenhouse.$3#$b#I don't want to move today.",
    "Linden.summer.Tue.0h": "Is something the matter? ...If not, I want to go back and blow the fan.$2",
    "Linden.summer.Wed.0h": "Can you still stand staying on the farm in this heat?$3",
    "Linden.summer.Thu.0h": "How are things today? Never mind, I'm too hot to talk, see you later.$2",
    "Linden.summer.Fri.0h": "Another week is ending. Time passes very slowly in the summer, and my research hasn't made any progress.$3",
    "Linden.summer.Sat.0h": "I'll definitely just stay in the institute this weekend, it's too hot outside.",
    "Linden.summer.Sun.0h": "Taking a day off today? Makes no difference to me, I still have to go find Shi Fushan in the afternoon.$2",
    "Linden.summer.Mon.2h": "Monday combined with summer, it's the hardest day to get through.$3",
    "Linden.summer.Tue.2h": "Don't mention the popsicles, I felt a little embarrassed by what Qingfeng said last time.$2",
    "Linden.summer.Wed.2h": "Under high temperatures, many plants enter a semi-dormant state, so the research progress has also slowed down.$3",
    "Linden.summer.Thu.2h": "Do you want a glass of iced green tea? I've been trying to drink it like this lately.$4",
    "Linden.summer.Fri.2h": "Summer is the best time to stay in the greenhouse and observe heat-tolerant plants.$1",
    "Linden.summer.Sat.2h": "On weekends, I usually organize my data, and then go report to Mayor Shi Fushan.",
    "Linden.summer.Sun.2h": "Getting something iced at Qingfeng's shop should be nice in this hot weather.$1",
    "Linden.summer.Mon.4h": "Monday again, when exactly is this summer going to end.$3",
    "Linden.summer.Tue.4h": "Hello there? Just saying hi, no other meaning.$4",
    "Linden.summer.Wed.4h": "My mentor said I have to submit this paper before the end of summer, the pressure is huge.$3",
    "Linden.summer.Thu.4h": "My manuscript fee arrived, I won't have to worry about research funds for a while.$1",
    "Linden.summer.Fri.4h": "Mayor Shi Fushan sent back last week's report, saying I need to add more data.$5",
    "Linden.summer.Sat.4h": "My mentor is urging me again, I really don't know what he's in such a rush for.$3",
    "Linden.summer.Sun.4h": "I stayed up late writing my paper until dawn last night, only slept for three hours today.$3#$b#Thank goodness I have green tea to keep me awake.",
    "Linden.summer.Mon.6h": "Doing academic research should have some planning, but summer always disrupts my rhythm.$2",
    "Linden.summer.Tue.6h": "My mentor said there's a chance my paper will be included in a journal.$1#$b#At least all that hard work wasn't for nothing.",
    "Linden.summer.Wed.6h": "Sean said the term deposit can't be withdrawn right now.$5#$b#Good thing Shi Fushan paid my salary early.$1",
    "Linden.summer.Thu.6h": "Why isn't there a teahouse or something in town, I just want to drink tea in the summer.$1",
    "Linden.summer.Fri.6h": "When it cools down a bit in the evening, I'll go for a walk around the town.$1#$b#Not far, just a short distance.",
    "Linden.summer.Sat.6h": "Even though I want to say you don't need to go out of your way to find me, I'm still very happy you came.$1",
    "Linden.summer.Sun.6h": "It's time to find Shi Fushan for a reporting meeting again, can't escape it every season.$3",
    "Linden.summer.Mon.8h": "With you here in the summer, it feels less unbearable.$1",
    "Linden.summer.Tue.8h": "Seeing you today gives me the motivation to continue my research.$1",
    "Linden.summer.Wed.8h": "The iced green tea is ready, I saved it specially for you.$4",
    "Linden.summer.Thu.8h": "I missed you. Is it weird to say this kind of thing in this weather?$2",
    "Linden.summer.Fri.8h": "I want to hang out with you this weekend, is that okay?$1",
    "Linden.summer.Sat.8h": "No need to go to the institute, I just want to stay with you today.$1",
    "Linden.summer.Sun.8h": "Chatting with you is the thing I look forward to most every week.$1",
    "Linden.summer.Mon.10h": "A new week. My mentor is urging for drafts, Shi Fushan is urging for reports, and Sean is urging me to deposit money.$5#$b#Good thing you're here.$1",
    "Linden.summer.Tue.10h": "No matter what I do today, I have to think of you to keep going.$2#$b#I'm even spacing out when reading literature.",
    "Linden.summer.Wed.10h": "Although many plants go dormant in the summer, some actually grow better.$1#$b#Just like you, the hotter it gets, the more energetic you are.$2",
    "Linden.summer.Thu.10h": "My dear, do you have anything you'd like to share with me today?$1",
    "Linden.summer.Fri.10h": "Come to the institute this weekend, I'll brew some new iced tea and I want you to be the first to taste it.$1",
    "Linden.summer.Sat.10h": "Still have to run around for work and my paper, but whenever I think of you I can't let myself get discouraged.$2",
    "Linden.summer.Sun.10h": "Every day I spend with you, I will record it just like I record my paper's data, accurate to every single detail.$1",
    "Linden.fall.Mon.0h": "It's autumn, the documents are starting to pile up again. It's always like this at the end of the year.$3",
    "Linden.fall.Tue.0h": "The wind is a bit chilly, but it's fine inside the institute.$2",
    "Linden.fall.Wed.0h": "Pumpkin pie? No, I'm talking about that red panda.$1#$b#Shi Fushan gave it a weird name.",
    "Linden.fall.Thu.0h": "I have official business today, need to take a stroll around the town.$3#$b#A lot of leaves have fallen, so the paths are much easier to walk on.",
    "Linden.fall.Fri.0h": "Week after week, autumn is actually passing quite quickly.$2",
    "Linden.fall.Sat.0h": "Weekends are suitable for staying in the institute, the wind is too strong outside.$1",
    "Linden.fall.Sun.0h": "Day off? Makes no difference to me, I still have to go report to Shi Fushan in the afternoon.$2",
    "Linden.fall.Mon.2h": "Monday. Shi Fushan gave me another pile of documents.$3",
    "Linden.fall.Tue.2h": "The autumn sunlight is nice, suitable for observing plants in the greenhouse.$1",
    "Linden.fall.Wed.2h": "Qingfeng asked me why I don't drink coffee.$2#$b#Caffeine stimulates the sympathetic nervous system, causing an increased heart rate and shaking hands. It's not suitable for someone like me who needs to do delicate operations.$3#$b#But everyone around here drinks it, as long as it keeps them awake. Everyone has their own choices.$1",
    "Linden.fall.Thu.2h": "Shi Fushan asked me if I've written the year-end report yet.$3#$b#It's only just early autumn.$5",
    "Linden.fall.Fri.2h": "Sean is urging me to deposit money again.$2#$b#I don't even have enough research funds, where would I get spare money.$3",
    "Linden.fall.Sat.2h": "My mentor sent an email saying the paper needs major revisions.$5#$b#I knew it.",
    "Linden.fall.Sun.2h": "Not working today, just making a cup of hot tea to take a break.$1",
    "Linden.fall.Mon.4h": "Monday again, why is this autumn so long.$3",
    "Linden.fall.Tue.4h": "Hello there? Just wanted to say hi, no other meaning.$4",
    "Linden.fall.Wed.4h": "That row of trees on the edge of the bazaar turned red, I took a glance when passing by.$1#$b#The color isn't bad.$1",
    "Linden.fall.Thu.4h": "My manuscript fee arrived, my research funds can last a while longer.$1#$b#Writing papers isn't so annoying anymore.",
    "Linden.fall.Fri.4h": "The Red Panda Bazaar has more tourists in autumn than in summer.$2#$b#I'm not quite used to it.$3",
    "Linden.fall.Sat.4h": "Shi Fushan said there's going to be some kind of event at the end of the year.$3#$b#I hope it won't be too noisy.$2",
    "Linden.fall.Sun.4h": "Organized literature until dawn last night.$3#$b#Slept for five hours, that's enough.",
    "Linden.fall.Mon.6h": "Autumn plans can't keep up with changes, sample analysis is slower than expected.$2",
    "Linden.fall.Tue.6h": "My mentor said my paper got cited.$1#$b#Didn't expect anyone to actually read it.$1",
    "Linden.fall.Wed.6h": "Sean said the term is up and I can withdraw money.$1#$b#Finally don't have to live on just bread.",
    "Linden.fall.Thu.6h": "Autumn evenings are the best for a walk, not too hot and not too cold.$1#$b#Do you want to come along? Just walking around the bazaar.",
    "Linden.fall.Fri.6h": "Qingfeng said there's a new osmanthus-flavored tea out.$2#$b#I think I'll stick to my green tea.$1",
    "Linden.fall.Sat.6h": "Even though I want to say you don't need to go out of your way to find me, I'm still very happy you came.$1",
    "Linden.fall.Sun.6h": "Time to find Shi Fushan for a reporting meeting again.$3#$b#Sure enough, can't escape it every season.$2",
    "Linden.fall.Mon.8h": "Monday. But autumn workdays are much easier to get through than summer ones, at least I'm not sweating profusely.$1",
    "Linden.fall.Tue.8h": "I stayed in the greenhouse all morning and organized a lot of data.$1#$b#It would've been great if you were there, you could have helped me look through the logbook.$1",
    "Linden.fall.Wed.8h": "The hot tea is ready, saved specially for you.[(O)614]$4#$b#Coffee? I don't really like drinking it, but if you want some I can bring it for you.$2",
    "Linden.fall.Thu.8h": "It's getting dark earlier lately, be careful on your way back.$2",
    "Linden.fall.Fri.8h": "I want to take a walk around the bazaar with you this weekend, haven't had a proper stroll since autumn started.$1",
    "Linden.fall.Sat.8h": "No need to go to the institute, I just want to stay with you today. Anywhere is fine.$1",
    "Linden.fall.Sun.8h": "The most relaxing time of my week is sitting down and chatting with you.$1",
    "Linden.fall.Mon.10h": "A new week. My mentor is urging for drafts, Shi Fushan is urging for reports, and Sean is urging me to deposit money.$5#$b#But knowing I can see you on the weekend keeps me going.$1",
    "Linden.fall.Tue.10h": "Organized an entire year's worth of research data today and realized that a lot of the progress only happened after you arrived.$2#$b#I don't know whether to thank you or myself.$1",
    "Linden.fall.Wed.10h": "Back when I was with my mentor, the whole lab drank coffee.$2#$b#I was the only one who drank tea.$1#$b#Green tea has theanine, which keeps you awake without making you hyper, it's more suitable for someone like me who needs to focus for long periods of time.$2#$b#Coffee is too strong, my heart races after drinking it and I can't get anything done.$1",
    "Linden.fall.Thu.10h": "I stood in the greenhouse for a bit today and suddenly thought... if you weren't here, I probably wouldn't even talk about these plants with anyone.$2",
    "Linden.fall.Fri.10h": "Come to the institute this weekend, I'll make tea for you.$1#$b#The leaves on the road have changed color, it's quite pretty. We can walk slowly.$1",
    "Linden.fall.Sat.10h": "Another year is about to pass.$2#$b#I used to feel like it didn't matter how the days went by, but it's different now.$1",
    "Linden.fall.Sun.10h": "Did you know, I leave the window open when I write my papers, because you'll come over.$2#$b#As soon as I hear the footsteps, I know it's you.$1",
    "Linden.winter.Mon.0h": "It's gotten cold. The heating in the institute isn't very good, I need to talk to Shi Fushan about it.$3",
    "Linden.winter.Tue.0h": "The wind is strong outside. I'll just stay in the greenhouse today, I don't want to go anywhere anyway.$2",
    "Linden.winter.Wed.0h": "There's no farm work in the winter, right? You can rest more. I still have to write my year-end report.$3",
    "Linden.winter.Thu.0h": "It's the end of the year. Shi Fushan is urging for the annual summary, and my mentor is urging for the year-end report.$5#$b#Caught in the middle.",
    "Linden.winter.Fri.0h": "Another week has frozen by. My paper isn't fully revised, and my report isn't finished yet.$3",
    "Linden.winter.Sat.0h": "Saturday. Brew a cup of tea, huddle in the institute, and revise my paper.$1",
    "Linden.winter.Sun.0h": "Sunday. Still have to find Shi Fushan in the afternoon, year-end reporting is more annoying than usual.$2",
    "Linden.winter.Mon.2h": "It stopped snowing. The roads are slippery, I don't want to walk far.$2#$b#The institute is enough for me to stay in.",
    "Linden.winter.Tue.2h": "Come in and sit. It's cold outside.$1#$b#But it's not that much warmer in the institute either.$2",
    "Linden.winter.Wed.2h": "The plants in the greenhouse are actually more cold-resistant than people.$1#$b#If only I had half their resilience.$2",
    "Linden.winter.Thu.2h": "Hot tea. Do you want some?$4#$b#Just brewed, still hot.",
    "Linden.winter.Fri.2h": "Another week is gone. Winter passes slowly, but there are so many things to do at the end of the year that it feels fast.$3",
    "Linden.winter.Sat.2h": "Weekend. Still at the institute.$2#$b#Don't want to go anywhere else anyway.",
    "Linden.winter.Sun.2h": "Drink tea. Zone out. That's enough.$1#$b#Still have to go find Shi Fushan in the afternoon, going to rest for a bit first.",
    "Linden.winter.Mon.4h": "Monday. Where did you go over the weekend?$1#$b#Me? I was at the institute writing reports until dawn.$3",
    "Linden.winter.Tue.4h": "The hot tea is ready, saved it for you.[(O)614]$4#$b#Sean told me to drink less tea and save more money, I can't be bothered to listen to him.$5",
    "Linden.winter.Wed.4h": "The snow has piled up quite thick outside, be careful walking.$3#$b#I almost slipped last time, thankfully I grabbed onto the wall.",
    "Linden.winter.Thu.4h": "I don't want to work.$5#$b#But my mentor said I must hand in the first draft before the new year.$3",
    "Linden.winter.Fri.4h": "Coming to the institute this weekend? It's warm here.$1#$b#I can show you the data I've organized recently.",
    "Linden.winter.Sat.4h": "You're here again. Cold outside, right?$1#$b#I'll go pour you a cup of tea.",
    "Linden.winter.Sun.4h": "Much warmer after chatting with you.$1#$b#Works better than the heating in the institute.",
    "Linden.winter.Mon.6h": "What are you planning to do this week? Me? Finish writing the year-end report.$1#$b#Shi Fushan won't let me off the hook if I don't finish it.",
    "Linden.winter.Tue.6h": "Whenever you're here, winter isn't so hard to endure.$1#$b#Sean said my complexion looks a bit better lately, probably your doing.",
    "Linden.winter.Wed.6h": "Not drinking tea anymore. Stay with me and watch the snow for a while.$1#$b#Right by the window, no need to go outside.",
    "Linden.winter.Thu.6h": "You do your thing. I'll just stay here for a bit.$1#$b#Having someone beside you gives you energy to work.",
    "Linden.winter.Fri.6h": "Let's go for a walk in the evening, just around the edge of town.$1#$b#Not far, we'll come back when we're tired. Do you want to come?",
    "Linden.winter.Sat.6h": "No need to come out of your way. But I'm quite happy you did.$1#$b#Qingfeng said I talk a lot more lately, probably because of you.",
    "Linden.winter.Sun.6h": "Winter isn't as cold anymore.$1#$b#After meeting you, it feels like everything is a little easier to get through.",
    "Linden.winter.Mon.8h": "Monday. It's less annoying with you here.$1#$b#Still have to write the report, but at least there's someone to talk to.",
    "Linden.winter.Tue.8h": "Seeing you today, I can even write my year-end report a bit faster.$1#$b#Maybe efficiency goes up when you're in a good mood.",
    "Linden.winter.Wed.8h": "The hot tea is ready, saved specially for you.$4#$b#I don't brew much tea when you're not around, drinking alone is no fun.",
    "Linden.winter.Thu.8h": "I missed you.$2#$b#It's easy to overthink things when you're alone in the winter, but it's fine once you're here.",
    "Linden.winter.Fri.8h": "I want to spend the weekend with you, is that okay?$1#$b#We don't necessarily have to go anywhere, staying in the institute is fine too.",
    "Linden.winter.Sat.8h": "Not going to the institute anymore. Just want to stay with you today.$1#$b#Anywhere is fine, as long as you're there.",
    "Linden.winter.Sun.8h": "The thing I look forward to most every week is chatting with you.$1#$b#Everything else can wait.",
    "Linden.winter.Mon.10h": "A new week. Shi Fushan wants the annual summary, my mentor wants the year-end report, and Sean wants to settle accounts.$5#$b#All three of them taking turns urging me, good thing you're here.$1",
    "Linden.winter.Tue.10h": "I stayed in the greenhouse all day today.$2#$b#Actually there wasn't much to do, it's just... I used to be used to being alone, but now I miss you.$1",
    "Linden.winter.Wed.10h": "Winter plants are all waiting for spring.$2#$b#I used to wait like that too. It's different now, with you in the winter, it's not so hard to endure.$1",
    "Linden.winter.Thu.10h": "My dear.$1#$b#Nothing special today. Just wanted to talk to you, about absolutely anything.$1",
    "Linden.winter.Fri.10h": "Come to the institute this weekend.$1#$b#There are a few new sprouts in the greenhouse, I want to show you first.",
    "Linden.winter.Sat.10h": "You're asking if I want to go somewhere else?$2#$b#I used to just huddle in the institute during winter, but now I want to go outside for a walk. It's probably because of you.$1",
    "Linden.winter.Sun.10h": "This past year... thank you.$2#$b#I'm not just being polite. Before I met you, winter was something I just had to survive. It's different now.$1",
    "Linden.spring.12": "The Egg Festival? I didn't really participate in it much when I was a kid.$2#$b#At my age, it's even more impossible to go scrambling for eggs with the kids.$3#$b#Pierre will be selling strawberry seeds, you can prepare some money if you need them.$1",
    "Linden.spring.13": "Today is the Egg Festival.$2#$b#I'll probably go take a look.#$b#Aren't you going to participate?$1",
    "Linden.spring.16": "How do you have free time to come over today?$1#$b#My birthday? Winter 21st, it's still a long way off.$2#$b#No need to prepare anything, just wanted you to know.$1",
    "Linden.spring.23": "Tomorrow is the Flower Dance.$2#$b#Dancing? I'm not very good at it.$3#$b#I'll just watch from the sidelines.",
    "Linden.spring.24": "The Flower Dance.$2#$b#I don't know how to dance, and I don't want to learn.$3#$b#Is there anyone you want to invite?$1",
    "Linden.summer.10": "Tomorrow is the Luau.$2#$b#I don't really like this kind of bustling occasion.$3#$b#But Lewis said we can add ingredients to the soup, I've prepared some wild vegetables.$1",
    "Linden.summer.11": "There are quite a few people on the beach.$2#$b#Me? I'll go stay for a while.$1#$b#Always staying in the institute means I need some fresh air too.",
    "Linden.summer.28": "Tomorrow is the Dance of the Moonlight Jellies.$3#$b#I saw illustrations of them in books when I was young.$2#$b#It should be nice to see them with my own eyes.$1",
    "Linden.fall.15": "Tomorrow is the Stardew Valley Fair.$2#$b#Your farm should have something to display, right?$1",
    "Linden.fall.16": "There are a lot of people at the fair.$2#$b#Feeling a bit uneasy.$3#$b#But the free food isn't bad.$1",
    "Linden.fall.27": "Tomorrow is Spirit's Eve.$2#$b#I've walked through that maze once before.$3#$b#My sense of direction is okay, but there's no need to go a second time.",
    "Linden.winter.7": "Tomorrow is the Festival of Ice.$2#$b#Ice fishing? I'm not very good at it.$3#$b#I might not go.",
    "Linden.winter.14": "Night Market tomorrow? It's too cold on winter nights.$3#$b#I don't really want to go out.$2",
    "Linden.winter.17": "It would indeed be a pity not to attend the Night Market.$3#$b#Let's go this year.$1#$b#Go early and come back early.",
    "Linden.winter.24": "Tomorrow is the Feast of the Winter Star.$2#$b#I drew someone's name, I need to prepare a gift.$3#$b#I hope I don't mess it up.",
    "Linden.winter.25": "Feast of the Winter Star.$1#$b#What did you receive?$2#$b#Me? A plant specimen, it's quite nice.$1",

    "Linden.SpringFair.festivals": "The atmosphere of this fair is quite lively, this is probably the liveliest day of the year at the Red Panda Bazaar.$1",
    "Linden.SpringFair.2.festivals": "The atmosphere of this fair is quite lively, this is probably the liveliest day of the year at the Red Panda Bazaar.$1",
    "Linden.spring13.festivals": "Young people are so full of energy.$2#$b#Almost forgot that I count as a young person too.$4",
    "Linden.spring13.2.festivals": "Young people are so full of energy.$2#$b#Almost forgot that I count as a young person too.$4",
    "Linden.spring24.festivals": "Should I have not joined this gathering? Mayor Shi Fushan told me to come, so I did.$2#$b#Since you are here, you must know how to dance, right? I don't know how at all, this is so awkward.$4",
    "Linden.spring24.2.festivals": "Should I have not joined this gathering? Mayor Shi Fushan told me to come, so I did.$2#$b#Since you are here, you must know how to dance, right? I don't know how at all, this is so awkward.$4",
    "Linden.summer11.festivals": "This event is really interesting!$1#$b#I just saw everyone adding all sorts of ingredients into it, all local to Stardew Valley.$2#$b#This soup... could it actually be delicious?$4",
    "Linden.summer11.2.festivals": "This event is really interesting!$1#$b#I just saw everyone adding all sorts of ingredients into it, all local to Stardew Valley.$2#$b#This soup... could it actually be delicious?$4",
    "Linden.fall27.festivals": "I can't believe I came here!$5#$b#If Li Qingfeng and Chen Xiaoming hadn't dragged me here, I would rather stay inside the institute and not come out.$3",
    "Linden.fall27.2.festivals": "I can't believe I came here!$5#$b#If Li Qingfeng and Chen Xiaoming hadn't dragged me here, I would rather stay inside the institute and not come out.$3",
    "Linden.winter.25.festivals": "I'm just saying if, if someone could give me a four-leaf clover, I would be happy for a whole year!$1",
    "Linden.winter.25.2.festivals": "I'm just saying if, if someone could give me a four-leaf clover, I would be happy for a whole year!$1",

    "Linden.Gift.Parsnip": "Parsnip. It has a short growth cycle, very suitable for beginners to plant.$2",
    "Linden.Gift.GreenBean": "Green Bean. A trellised crop, can be harvested continuously after maturity, but the trellis is a bit in the way.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Cauliflower": "Cauliflower. Under the environment of Stardew Valley, there is a chance it will grow into a giant crop. I haven't seen one yet, I really want to take a look.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Potato": "Potato. Occasionally yields extra output when harvested. This thing has a high yield, anywhere that can grow potatoes won't suffer from famine.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Tulip": "Tulip. An ornamental flower. But giving it as a gift, anyone would be happy for a moment.$2",
    "Linden.Gift.Kale": "Kale. High in nutritional value.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Jazz": "Blue Jazz. Can attract butterflies. This is very suitable for creating some atmospheric little scenes.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Garlic": "Garlic. One of the essential seasonings in the kitchen. In folklore, this works wonders against vampires.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Rhubarb": "Rhubarb. The seeds are quite rare. Where did you get them?$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Strawberry": "Strawberry. This is very sweet, and it's delicious when made into dried strawberries.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.CoffeeBean": "Coffee Bean. Can be processed into coffee. The refreshing effect isn't bad, but I prefer drinking green tea.$2",
    "Linden.Gift.Rice": "Unmilled Rice. There is scientific evidence that planting it near water makes it grow faster.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Blueberry": "Blueberry. This tastes very good too.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Corn": "Corn. A crop for summer and fall. Another high-yield crop, supposedly it's also a crop that can solve famine problems, it's just that who would like gnawing on corn every day.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Hops": "Hops. Can be harvested every day, the pale ale brewed from it is very popular at the saloon.$2",
    "Linden.Gift.Pepper": "Hot Pepper. Can be harvested continuously after maturity. Some people probably can't handle this level of spiciness. And it's actually classified as a fruit! No one would've thought.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Melon": "Melon. Another crop that has a chance to grow into a giant crop. I'd really like to see it in the field.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Poppy": "Poppy. An ornamental flower. Just don't try to plant it, you should listen to me on this one.$2",
    "Linden.Gift.Radish": "Radish. Fast growth rate. If you feed it to your horse, it will be very happy.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.RedCabbage": "Red Cabbage. As for the taste, it's no different from ordinary cabbage.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Starfruit": "Starfruit. Why is this the most economically valuable thing in Stardew Valley?$1",
    "Linden.Gift.SummerSpangle": "Summer Spangle. Just an ornamental flower.$2",
    "Linden.Gift.Sunflower": "Sunflower. Has a chance to drop seeds when harvested. People generally eat its seed portion, the taste is very fragrant.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Tomato": "Tomato. Can be harvested continuously after maturity.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Wheat": "Wheat. A summer and fall crop, with a short growth cycle.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Amaranth": "Amaranth. The plant is relatively tall.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Artichoke": "Artichoke. This is the king of vegetables!$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Beet": "Beet. Very suitable for extracting sugar.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Broccoli": "Broccoli. The ultimate choice for a fat-loss meal.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.BokChoy": "Bok Choy. Relatively fast growth rate. My family often tells me to eat this, saying it's very healthy.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Cranberry": "Cranberry. Yields multiple fruits in a single harvest, and can be harvested continuously after maturity.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Eggplant": "Eggplant. Can be harvested continuously after maturity. I usually don't like eating it, though.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.FairyRose": "Fairy Rose. The honey collected by bees from this has a very good economic value.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Grape": "Grape. A trellised crop, can be harvested continuously after maturity. If it's wild, it's smaller than the cultivated variety. However, the wine brewed from it usually increases in value the older it gets.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Pumpkin": "Pumpkin. Another crop that has a chance to grow into a giant crop. I'd really like to see it in the field.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Yam": "Yam. A crop that serves as both medicine and food, often called the 'treasure of the mountains'.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.AncientFruit": "Ancient Fruit. Very high economic value, I often see it at some high-end banquets, though I generally don't get to drink it.$4",
    "Linden.Gift.Cactus": "Cactus Fruit. Suitable for planting in the desert or a greenhouse.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Tea": "Tea Leaves. Can be processed into green tea. I like this very much, come to my institute another day and I'll brew you a cup of hot tea.$4",
    "Linden.Gift.Fiber": "Fiber. Although I am a botanist, please don't just hand me a piece of grass and ask me about it.$2",
    "Linden.Gift.QiBean": "A very peculiar bean, what is it called? I've never seen it before.$3",
    "Linden.Gift.WildHorseradish": "Wild Horseradish. The root is pungent and can be ground into a paste.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Daffodil": "Daffodil. Blooms in the spring. Ordinary women generally like this.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Leek": "Leek. A peculiar plant, it actually combines chives and green onions, it has a lot of research value.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Dandelion": "Dandelion. The leaves are edible, and the flowers can be brewed into wine. Haven't you heard?$1",
    "Linden.Gift.SpringOnion": "Spring Onion. Grows in the Cindersap Forest in spring.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Morel": "Morel. A highly valuable fungus. I wouldn't recommend giving it away, it would be better to just sell it.$4",
    "Linden.Gift.CommonMushroom": "Common Mushroom. A very common fungus.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Salmonberry": "Salmonberry. Foraged during the spring berry season. You can find a whole bunch of them by the roadside, basically no one likes this.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.SpiceBerry": "Spice Berry. Can only be foraged in the summer. It tastes pretty good eaten directly too.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.SweetPea": "Sweet Pea. Blooms in summer.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.RedMushroom": "Red Mushroom. Poisonous, it's best not to eat it. Generally, mushrooms that look this brightly colored are highly toxic.$3",
    "Linden.Gift.FiddleheadFern": "Fiddlehead Fern. The young shoots are edible. I have some in my institute.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.WildPlum": "Wild Plum. Foraged in the fall, it has a sweet and sour taste.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Hazelnut": "Hazelnut. Foraged in the fall, can be roasted. It's an okay snack.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Blackberry": "Blackberry. Can be foraged in the fall. No need to taste it, berries are usually sweet.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Chanterelle": "Chanterelle. An autumn mushroom with a slightly spicy taste.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.WinterRoot": "Winter Root. Can only be found in the winter by digging in the dirt with a hoe. It takes too much stamina, I usually don't do that.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.CrystalFruit": "Crystal Fruit. A fruit that can only be found in the winter, looks just like an icicle, probably unique to Stardew Valley.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.SnowYam": "Snow Yam. Can only be found in the winter by digging in the dirt with a hoe. It takes too much stamina, I usually don't do that.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Crocus": "Crocus. Blooms in winter. Usually has medicinal value, and can generally be seen on some dining tables as well.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Holly": "Holly. An ornamental plant, it's best not to eat it.$2",
    "Linden.Gift.CaveCarrot": "Cave Carrot. Foraged in the mines, it has a hard texture.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.PurpleMushroom": "Purple Mushroom. A rare fungus, did you bring this for me to research? Thank you very much!$4",
    "Linden.Gift.Moss": "Moss. Grows on old trees, this is related to whether the air quality is good or bad.$1",
    "Linden.Gift.Sap": "Sap. Can be processed into fertilizer. But it's not suitable as a gift, right? I still feel like you grabbed the wrong thing.$2",
    "Linden.Gift.PumpkinSoup": "Pumpkin Soup. It has a very mild texture, warms your stomach after drinking it.$4",
    "Linden.Gift.VegetableMedley": "Vegetable Medley. Nutritionally balanced, and the original flavors of the ingredients are preserved very well.$4",
    "Linden.Gift.SweetGemBerry": "Sweet Gem Berry. If I put this in my kitchen, I could eat a whole meal just from the smell alone!$4",
    "Linden.Gift.PrismaticShard": "Prismatic Shard. Radiation can affect plant growth. But... thanks.$2",
    "Linden.Gift.RabbitsFoot": "...$3",
    "Linden.Gift.Pearl": "A pearl? No need to give me this, give it to someone who suits it better.$2",
    "Linden.Gift.StardropTea": "Stardrop Tea!$4#$b#Mmm~ It's delicious! Thanks.$1",

    "Linden.GiftTastes.Love": "This... I really like it. Thank you.$4",
    "Linden.GiftTastes.Like": "Not bad. Thank you.$1",
    "Linden.GiftTastes.Neutral": "Oh. Okay.$2",
    "Linden.GiftTastes.Dislike": "Uh... thanks.$2",
    "Linden.GiftTastes.Hate": "...Why would you use this to prank me?$5",

    "Linden.GiftReaction.Birthday.Love": "This... I really like it. Thank you.$4#$b#You say it's a birthday gift? If you hadn't mentioned it I would have forgotten today is my birthday, thank you so much for the gift!$1",
    "Linden.GiftReaction.Birthday.Like": "Not bad. Thank you.$1#$b#Is today my birthday? Thank you for everything as always.$4",
    "Linden.GiftReaction.Birthday.Neutral": "Oh. Okay.$2#$b#Is today my birthday? But it feels just like any other day.",
    "Linden.GiftReaction.Birthday.Dislike": "Uh... thanks.$2#$b#I might have felt a little better if you hadn't told me today was my birthday.",
    //******Sean Daily Dialogue******//
    "Sean.Mon.0h": "Do you need to handle any business? Deposit or withdraw money?$0",
    "Sean.Tue.0h": "Some people think bank work is boring. I think it's alright. Numbers don't lie.$2",
    "Sean.Wed.0h": "Shi Fushan invested in this bank. Otherwise, I wouldn't have been able to open it by myself.$2",
    "Sean.Thu.0h": "The weather is nice today. Perfect for sitting behind the counter and spacing out.$2",
    "Sean.Fri.0h": "Business is slow at the Red Panda Bazaar, sometimes I can slack off the whole day.$1",
    "Sean.Sat.0h": "Some people think I'm hard to approach. I just don't know what to say.$3",
    "Sean.Sun.0h": "Sometimes no one comes in all day. I just read books and space out.$2",

    "Elliott.SpringFair.2.festivals": "I thought Lewis was going to pull some weird stunt again$1#$e#Have you gone to see the cafe opened by that pretty girl with pink hair?",
    /*************   1.0.7   *************/
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.2.1.Chandler": "You sure this stuff actually works? Doesn't look like what I had in mind.$4",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.2.2.Marlin": "No?#$b#It's the best bottle I've got.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.2.3.Marlin": "I've got another brand...#$b#Wouldn't recommend it myself, but I can show you if you want?$2",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.2.4.Chandler": "If it's your top-shelf stuff, I'll stick with this one.",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.2.5.Chandler": "By the way, that story of yours... was it true? The day you met 'The Tyrant'.",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.2.6.Marlin": "Every word! I was stone-cold sober, I tell you! Back in my sailing days.$1#$b#My Captain said to me, 'Lad!...'$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.2.7.Chandler": "Let me stop you right there. Spare me the 'how I became a sailor' part, I've lost count of how many times I've heard it.$3#$b#Let's skip to The Tyrant.",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.2.8.Marlin": "Oh, right.$1#$b#That pike... the raw strength of it was unreal. Not like any ordinary fish.",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.2.9.Marlin": "The beast took my whole rod with him. The apex predator of that entire lake, I'd wager.$2#$b#The locals said an old soldier lived out there too, but I never saw him.",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.2.10.Chandler": "So... you didn't catch it? You *lost* a rod to it?#$b#Was it really that formidable? Makes me wanna have a go at it myself.",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.2.11.Marlin": "Absolutely. That fish had to be ten years old, at least. This was years ago, not long after we'd docked.#$b#Place was a long way from here. Doubt the old fellow's even still swimming.$2",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.2.12.Chandler": "Never mind, then. I'll go see if this bottle of yours is as 'effective' as you claim.",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.2.13.Chandler": "If it doesn't work, you'll give me a new one, right?$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.2.14.Marlin": "You have my word! But I promise you, this one's the real deal!$1",

    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.4.1.Marlin": "Now this is a perfect day!$1#$b#All that's missing is a bottle of fine navy rum.",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.4.2.Marlin": "Well, ahoy, farmer!#$b#Just look at that sky. Perfect.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.4.3.Farmer": "It really is.",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.4.4.Farmer": "Lovely weather, but not great for the crops.",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.4.5.Farmer": "Sorry, what was that?",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.4.6.Marlin": "Makes me want to get my old rod out.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.4.7.Marlin": "Suppose you're right. Can't be easy on a farmer.",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.4.8.Marlin": "The weather! I said it'd be perfect with a bottle of navy rum.",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.4.9.Marlin": "Our town's a bit short on rustic charm, and the fish can't compare to Pelican Town's.#$b#I do get nostalgic for the little time I spent there.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.4.10.Farmer": "You lived in Pelican Town?",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.4.11.Farmer": "How come I've never heard of you there?",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.4.12.Farmer": "Pelican Town might not have been for you.",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.4.13.Marlin": "Just for a night.$1#$b#I was still a sailor. Our ship had just made port.",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.4.14.Marlin": "That makes sense. I was only there one evening.",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.4.15.Marlin": "Who's to say? I've put down roots here now.",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.4.16.Marlin": "Even for just one night, the place stole my heart.$1#$b#Then the Captain yelled, 'All hands, we're setting sail, lad!'",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.4.17.Marlin": "If I get the chance, I'd love to see that saloon again.$1",

    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.6.1.Marlin": "Bait's runnin' low...#$b#When did I last restock?",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.6.2.Marlin": "Weeks ago?#$b#No wonder it's almost gone.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.6.3.ShiFuShan": "How's business, Marlin?$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.6.4.Marlin": "Mayor!$1#$b#Didn't see you there.",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.6.5.ShiFuShan": "Weeks ago?$3",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.6.6.Marlin": "Huh?$3#$b#Oh, I see. You're a funny man.$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.6.7.Marlin": "No fresh catch today, I'm afraid. Looking for something else?$2",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.6.8.ShiFuShan": "Not here for fish today.#$b#Tell me, have you ever heard of... 'jellies'?",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.6.9.Marlin": "Jellies? I've hooked the stuff before.$2#$b#Never saw a reason to sell it.",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.6.10.Marlin": "Why do you ask? What's it for?",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.6.11.ShiFuShan": "Nothing in particular. Just curious.#$b#Would you ever consider stocking it?$1",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.6.12.Marlin": "I... suppose? It's not exactly easy to come by.$2#$b#If I reel in any extra, I'll be sure to set it aside.",
    "Event.RedPandaBazaar.Marlin.Heart.6.13.ShiFuShan": "Good.#$b#Now, let's see about that bait.$1",

    "30982001.1.ShiFuShan": "How many times do I have to say it? Tidy your shelves. Tourists don't like rummaging through a mess.$3",
    "30982001.2.ChenXiaoMing": "You dragged me out here for *this*?$7#$b#What's gotten into you? Did the Red Panda tell you to be so fussy?$17",
    "30982001.3.ShiFuShan": "And how else would I get through to you? You never listen unless I come find you.",
    "30982001.4.ChenXiaoMing": "If that's all, I'm leaving. I don't like standing in the sun.$17",
    "30982001.5.ShiFuShan": "A visitor? My apologies, I'm a bit tied up at the moment.#$b#But there's a general store and café right over there. Feel free to look around.$1",
    "30982001.6.ShiFuShan": "Take care.",

    "Marlin.SpringFair.festivals.1": "Just got my hands on some new fishing tackle.",
    "Marlin.SpringFair.festivals.2": "You have much interest in fishing?",
    "Farmer.Marlin.SpringFair.festivals.3": "Sure do, I love it.",
    "Marlin.SpringFair.festivals.4": "In that case, you'll be needing this! *The farmer received a new fishing rod.*$1",
    "Farmer.Marlin.SpringFair.festivals.5": "Sorry, it's not really my thing.",
    "Marlin.SpringFair.festivals.6": "Ah, well. Your loss, then.$2",
    /*************   1.0.6   *************/
    "90328006.1": "What the...? Why is the fridge full of all this weird stuff?$3#$b#Oh, right. I keep forgetting I'm not the one who deals with the groceries.$7",
    "90328006.2": "You scared me!$3",
    "90328006.3": "So... wanna go out tonight? I still haven't seen much of the town.$22",
    "90328006.4": "How about the saloon? I hear that's where everyone hangs out.",
    "90328006.5": "Sure, why not.",
    "90328006.6": "Finally decided to get yourself drunk, huh?",
    "90328006.7": "Let me think about it...$19",
    "90328006.8": "What's that supposed to mean?$7",
    "90328006.9": "So...? It's settled. Meet me at the saloon after 7PM. Don't you dare forget.",
    "90328007.1": "You're buying, right?$19#$b#...Aren't you?",
    "90328007.2": "Of course. We're family, after all.",
    "90328007.3": "I, uh... kinda forgot my wallet.",
    "90328007.4": "Well, I guess we're eating at home then.",
    "90328007.5": "Family...$9#$b#I wish my own parents thought that way.$2",
    "90328007.6": "Don't worry about it. My treat.$7#$b#Can't say I'm surprised.$3",
    "90328007.7": "And eat what at home? Crumbs?$7#$b#Come on, don't be a buzzkill. We're finally out!$7",
    "90328007.8": "So... you come here often?$19#$b#I'll admit, I don't get into town much.$7",
    "90328007.9": "Maybe I should get out more...$19",
    "90328007.10": "I like this place. The whole town, really. Everyone's so... nice.",
    "90328007.11": "A little fresh air never hurt anybody.",
    "90328007.12": "No wonder you're so pale, you're always cooped up inside!",
    "90328007.13": "Maybe the world isn't so bad after all...$3#$b#Before I met you, I didn't really have anyone.$2",
    "90328007.14": "I guess so.$3",
    "90328007.15": "What's it to you? Is this not how you wanted me?$17#$b#You should be happy I'm even still standing.$19",
    "90328007.16": "Figured out what you're having, pal?$1#$b#Oh, and for the lady.",
    "90328007.17": "Is this your wife? I don't believe I've met her before.#$b#Need a minute to decide? Can I get you a coffee to start?$1",
    "90328007.18": "The bartender's a real blabber, isn't he?$19#$b#Where were we?$2",
    "90328007.19": "Oh, right. We came here to eat.$7#$b#How about a couple of omelets?$22",
    "90328007.20": "Or would a salad be better?$6",
    "90328007.21": "Let's go with the omelets.",
    "90328007.22": "A salad sounds good, actually.",
    "90328007.23": "I want cake!",
    "90328007.24": "Alright, two omelets it is.$19#$b#I still think the salad would've been the healthier choice.$7",
    "90328007.25": "Salad is the safer bet. Lighter on the waistline.$22#$b#And it's still pretty tasty.",
    "90328007.26": "No, you don't. We're getting the salad.$17",
    "90328007.27": "Well, it looks better than I expected. How's the taste?$7",
    "90328007.28": "Guess it's about time to head home, huh?$3#$b#I'm getting pretty sleepy.$7",
    "Marlin.spring.1": "A new year. Hoping for a fresh catch, in more ways than one.$1#$b#A man's gotta have hope, right?",
    "Shops.MarlinShop.Any": "Eyes on the prize, I see. See anything you like?",
    "Shops.MarlinShop.None": "Closed up. Come back when Marlin's around.",
    "NPCName:RedPandaBazaar_Marlin": "Marlin",
    "Marlin.Introduction": "New face? What can I do for you?#$e#The new farmer from Pelican Town? News to me.$2#$b#Name's Marlin. I run the fishing shop here.",
    "Marlin.DumpsterDiveComment": "You won't find anything worth your time in the trash, son.",
    "Marlin.HitBySlingshot": "What's the big idea?$3",
    "Marlin.GreenRain": "Everyone's scared, but not me.#$b#Weather like this? The big ones are bound to be biting.$1",
    "Marlin.GreenRainFinished": "Yesterday? Skunked. Not a single bite.$2#$b#Guess I was wrong. Maybe the fish hate this weather as much as we do.$1",
    "Marlin.GreenRain.2": "The strange rain's back.#$b#Think I'll play it safe and mind the shop today.$1",
    "Marlin.GiftReaction.Birthday.Love": "An old sailor like me... you remembered my birthday? Thank you, truly.$1",
    "Marlin.GiftReaction.Birthday.Like": "A birthday gift? It's been a while. This is... really nice. Thank you.$1",
    "Marlin.GiftReaction.Birthday.Neutral": "For me? Thanks.",
    "Marlin.GiftReaction.Birthday.Dislike": "I'll, uh, take it.",
    "Marlin.GiftReaction.Birthday.Hate": "Is this some kind of joke?$5",
    "Marlin.Gift.StardropTea": "This smells like a dream I once had. In a good way. Thank you.$1",
    "Marlin.Gift.Catfish": "Now that's a fine fish! Must've been eating well!$1",
    "Marlin.Gift.Sturgeon": "Now this is a prime specimen! You pull this from the lake?",
    "Marlin.Gift.Albacore": "Will you look at the size of this thing!$1",
    "Marlin.Gift.Tuna": "Ha! I've spent half my life battling these bruisers. Respect for landing one!$1",
    "Marlin.Mon.0h": "I'm no philosophical man, but there's a peace you find sitting by the water.$1#$b#You got many fishermen back in your town?",
    "Marlin.Tue.0h": "Business has been slower than a sleepy slug.#$b#Guess fishing's not everyone's cup of tea.",
    "Marlin.Wed.0h": "How's that farm of yours coming along?#$b#I try my hand at a few indoor plants myself.$1",
    "Marlin.Thu.0h": "You got the fishing bug?$1#$b#If you do, I've got the gear to feed it.",
    "Marlin.Fri.0h": "Time and tide wait for no man.#$b#Week's almost done.$1",
    "Marlin.Sat.0h": "Well, howdy, farmer.#$b#You're a ways from home, ain't ya?$1",
    "Marlin.Sun.0h": "I've got a soft spot for catfish.$1#$b#Simple reason: they get big, and they taste good.$1",
    "Marlin.Mon.2h": "Years back, I waited two straight days for a legendary pike.$1#$e#The one that got away... literally.",
    "Marlin.Tue.2h": "This town suits me. A quiet spot by the water, fish right on the doorstep.$1",
    "Marlin.Wed.2h": "Land any whoppers lately?#$e#Anything that put up a good fight?$1",
    "Marlin.Thu.2h": "Well, look who it is! Pelican Town's finest!#$b#To what do I owe the pleasure? Need supplies?$2",
    "Marlin.Fri.2h": "Know your way around a fishing rod? Same here.$1#$b#I always have a bite to eat first. Keeps your focus sharp.",
    "Marlin.Sat.2h": "Folks ask why I love fishing so much.#$e#I tell 'em it's my therapy. Cheaper, too.#$e#And if I'm lucky, it's dinner. Heh.$1",
    "Marlin.Sun.2h": "How was your week? Upgraded your tackle yet?#$e#Here, I've got a spare rod. [649] It's a good one.$1",
    "Marlin.Mon.4h": "Well, howdy, @.$1#$b#You'll have to share your pumpkin-growing secrets with me sometime.$1",
    "Marlin.Tue.4h": "Heard tales of a fish that only bites in the dead of night.#$e#Just a fish story, I reckon. Never seen hide nor scale of it.$2",
    "Marlin.Wed.4h": "A fish gets away, you blame yourself.#$b#Sometimes, you just need better gear. Makes all the difference.$1",
    "Marlin.Thu.4h": "Give me a drizzly day over a sunny one any time.$1#$b#Fish go wild in the rain. Can't say I feel the same.$3",
    "Marlin.Fri.4h": "Friday night at the saloon? Not really our tradition here.$1#$b#Maybe on a Sunday, but don't hold your breath.",
    "Marlin.Sat.4h": "You know how to swim?#$b#It's a good skill for a fisherman. Safety first.$2",
    "Marlin.Sun.4h": "Nearly forgot to feed the aquarium crew.$1#$e#Good lookin' out.",
    "Marlin.Mon.6h": "Whoa there, @!#$b#Someone mailed me a haul of fish! My tank's overflowing, so this one's on me. [705 698 130]$1",
    "Marlin.Tue.6h": "Our Mayor's got a face like a stormy sea.$1#$e#But he's got a good heart beneath it. Just hard to see sometimes.",
    "Marlin.Wed.6h": "I ever tell you I was a sailor in my youth?#$e#Sailed distant oceans. We'd fish to pass the time.$2#$b#Those were the days.$1",
    "Marlin.Thu.6h": "My Uncle Arthur swore by stinky cheese for catching sunfish!$1#$b#True story. Maybe you'll meet him one day.",
    "Marlin.Fri.6h": "The fish weren't biting today. Bad omen, that.$2",
    "Marlin.Sat.6h": "Bit of a trek to the river from here. Makes river fishing a chore.$1",
    "Marlin.Sun.6h": "Town's full of folks, but I'd rather be talking to the fish.$1#$b#Not many bother with an old salt like me. You're an exception.",
    "Marlin.Mon.8h": "Hello, friend! Fancy wetting a line today?#$e#Or just browsing?$1",
    "Marlin.Tue.8h": "I've heard of your local legend, Willy.$1#$b#Crossed paths with him once. A real fisherman, that one.",
    "Marlin.Wed.8h": "If it isn't my favorite customer.$1#$b#Caught a beauty yesterday. Thought you might appreciate it. [136 700 715]",
    "Marlin.Thu.8h": "This old shop's always open for you, as long as I'm breathing.$1#$b#Doubt anyone else wants a shop that smells like low tide, anyway.",
    "Marlin.Fri.8h": "You see bubbles on the water?#$e#That's the fish telling you where the party is. Best fishing spot you can find.$2",
    "Marlin.Sat.8h": "Brought in any trophies lately?$1#$b#How's the farm? You got a pond yet?$2",
    "Marlin.Sun.8h": "Life here is quiet. Simple.$1#$b#And after a life at sea, that's just fine by me.",
    "Marlin.Mon.10h": "Didn't expect a bright young thing like you to take a shine to an old timer like me.$1#$b#Guess I'll have to teach you all my tricks.$1",
    "Marlin.Tue.10h": "Your rod lookin' a little dusty lately, friend.$2#$e#Just pulling your leg!$1",
    "Marlin.Wed.10h": "I'm proud of this little shop. Dreamed of it on the long voyages.#$b#It's not much, but it's mine. And that's enough.$1",
    "Marlin.Thu.10h": "My old captain told me, 'Marlin, if you ever leave the sea, don't you dare sell your rod.'$1#$e#I still have it. Don't use it much, but I keep it clean.",
    "Marlin.Fri.10h": "Think I should stock some new lures?$1#$b#What's the word on the street, @?",
    "Marlin.Sat.10h": "Nothing beats your own chair.#$b#My old bones can't take long days on the water anymore.$1",
    "Marlin.Sun.10h": "The sewers?$2#$e#I've heard things... best to let sleeping fish lie, I say.$1",
    "Marlin.GiftTastes.love": "Now this is a gift! You've made an old man's day.$1",
    "Marlin.GiftTastes.like": "Well, isn't that thoughtful. Thank you.",
    "Marlin.GiftTastes.dislike": "Seen enough of that back in my sailing days. Not for me.$3",
    "Marlin.GiftTastes.hate": "Oof. This is... not good, friend.$2",
    "Marlin.GiftTastes.neutral": "I'll take it, sure.",
    "MarlinShop1.15.12": "Someone left their shears behind.",
