    "ChenXiaoMing.cs.4463.spring": "I've already given water to your pet today. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.cs.4470.spring": "I've finished watering the crops. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.cs.4474.spring": "I didn't realize you had so many animals. $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.cs.4481.spring": "I fixed up the fences on the farm. $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.cs.4463.summer": "I've filled %pet's water bowl. #$b#It's too hot not to stay hydrated in summer. $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.cs.4470.summer": "It's so hot out. Why are you still watering crops? $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.cs.4474.summer": "The animals are already fed. $17",
    "ChenXiaoMing.cs.4481.summer": "I think your fences need replacing soon. $17",
    "ChenXiaoMing.cs.4463.fall": "What are you looking at? Is there something wrong? $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.cs.4470.fall": "I didn't expect you to grow so many crops. $2",
    "ChenXiaoMing.cs.4474.fall": "The animals have been fed for today. $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.cs.4481.fall": "I can't stand fixing fences. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.cs.4463.winter": "Don't you think %pet is adorable? $22",
    "ChenXiaoMing.cs.4470.winter": "Why are you growing so many crops in winter? Are you trying to wear me out? $2",
    "ChenXiaoMing.cs.4474.winter": "Don't feed the animals again today. They'll get sick. $2",
    "ChenXiaoMing.cs.4481.winter": "If I were you, I'd just tear down those old fences. $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.cs.4463.spring.2": "I hope %pet doesn't get out of control. $3#$b#Otherwise, I'll send them to Panhong. $24",
    "ChenXiaoMing.cs.4470.spring.2": "Why did you plant so many crops again? $9#$b#It took me forever to finish watering them. $29",
    "ChenXiaoMing.cs.4481.spring.2": "Don't worry about the fences. I've already fixed them. $24",
    "ChenXiaoMing.cs.4463.summer.2": "Do you even remember the last time you gave %pet water? $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.cs.4470.summer.2": "I don't think I ever want to water crops again. $2",
    "ChenXiaoMing.cs.4474.summer.2": "Oh, I almost forgot, but I've already fed the animals. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.cs.4481.summer.2": "I'm so exhausted right now. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.cs.4463.fall.2": "Fall is like this. Everything dries out. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.cs.4470.fall.2": "I've already watered the crops. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.cs.4474.fall.2": "And the animals too. $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.cs.4481.fall.2": "You should probably tear down those fences. $17",
    "ChenXiaoMing.cs.4463.winter.2": "It's winter. Don't you think %pet should spend more time indoors? $9",
    "ChenXiaoMing.cs.4470.winter.2": "Is farming in winter really that fun? $29",
    "ChenXiaoMing.cs.4474.winter.2": "Forget it. You wouldn't understand anyway. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.cs.4481.winter.2": "Don't worry about the fences. They're already fixed. $3",
    "LiQingFeng.cs.3980": "Marry you? $11#$b#At least give me time to prepare. Seriously. $12",
    "ChenXiaoMing.cs.3980": "Marriage? I never thought I'd have to prepare for it this soon. $9#$b#I came here to get away from that pressure, but now? $3#$b#It doesn't seem so scary anymore. I'd love to be with you. $22",
    "SpringFair": "Spring Fair",
