    /*************   信件 Mail *************/
    "LiQingfeng.Mail.01": "I'm not very good at writing letters, but I really need your help right now. ^The shops in town don't have fresh milk. Could you bring a small bottle to my café? ^I really need it. ^—Qingfeng[#]Qingfeng's Request",
    "SpringFair.Mail": "We're setting up a stall tonight at 8 PM at the Red Panda Bazaar. ^I heard there's free food there. Maybe you'd like to try it? ^^—Mayor Lewis[#]Spring Fair Festival Invite",
    "LiQingfeng.Mail.02": "If you have time, come find me on the second floor of my house. ^^—Qingfeng[#]Qingfeng's Invitation",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Mail.01": "Come see me in town after 8 PM. I think we should have a private talk. ^^—Your girlfriend Chen Xiaoming[#]Talk with Chen Xiaoming",
    /*************  NPC礼物爱好对话  NPCGiftTastes *************/
    "LiQingFeng.Gift.Daffodil": "A daffodil? I absolutely love this! $7",
    "LiQingFeng.Gift.Prismatic.Shard": "What's this? It's so colorful and pretty! $1",
    "LiQingFeng.Gift.Milk": "This is perfect for making milk tea. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.Gift.Cheese": "I have plenty at home, but I still love it. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.Gift.Rabbit's.Foot": "A... rabbit's foot? $3",
    "LiQingFeng.Gift.Green.Tea": "Looks nice! I think Caroline would like this too. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.Gift.Peach": "A peach! I love it. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.Gift.Pearl": "Where did you find something so rare? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.Gift.Pearl.milk.tea": "I really love this! $1",
    "LiQingFeng.Gift.StardropTea": "What is this? What flavor is it? $17#$b#It's delicious! Thank you so much! $1",
    "LiQingFeng.GiftTastes.love": "You got this for me? I love it!",
    "LiQingFeng.GiftTastes.like": "This is nice, thank you so much.",
    "LiQingFeng.GiftTastes.dislike": "Uh... thanks? Is that what you wanted me to say?",
    "LiQingFeng.GiftTastes.hate": "Do you think this is funny? I don't like it at all.",
    "LiQingFeng.GiftTastes.neutral": "Oh, this? Okay then.",
    "LiQingFeng.GiftReaction.Birthday.Love": "Wow, I really love this! Thank you so much! $7",
    "LiQingFeng.GiftReaction.Birthday.Like": "A gift? It looks lovely. Thank you!",
    "LiQingFeng.GiftReaction.Birthday.Neutral": "This is for my birthday? Oh, thanks. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.GiftReaction.Birthday.Dislike": "A... gift? Uh, okay. $3",
    "LiQingFeng.GiftReaction.Birthday.Hate": "Oh... $18",
    
    "ChenXiaoMing.Gift.CoffeeBean": "Oh, what's this? A coffee bean from @! If I turn it into coffee, you wouldn't mind, right? $27#$b#Just kidding, I love it. Thanks! $6",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Gift.TripleShotEspresso": "Does this smell... extra bold? $26#$b#Of course, I like it. I wouldn't lie to you. $1",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Gift.Coffee": "Wow, a freshly brewed cup of coffee? This is great. $6",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Gift.Strawberry": "A strawberry? This is my absolute favorite. Thank you so much! $1",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Gift.StardropTea": "What's that amazing smell? $19#$b#Oh, Stardrop Tea? I love it! $1",
    "ChenXiaoMing.GiftTastes.love": "Is this what I think it is? A gift from @! $6#$b#I mean it... I really love this. $1",
    "ChenXiaoMing.GiftTastes.like": "For me? I didn't expect this. Thank you, I appreciate it! $24",
    "ChenXiaoMing.GiftTastes.dislike": "Really? This is what you chose to give me? $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.GiftTastes.hate": "What is this? Seriously? This is... disappointing. $5",
    "ChenXiaoMing.GiftTastes.neutral": "Well, since it's from you, I guess I'll take it. $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.GiftReaction.Birthday.Love": "This birthday gift is amazing! It's perfect, thank you so much! $9",
    "ChenXiaoMing.GiftReaction.Birthday.Like": "You remembered my birthday? And you even got me a gift? That's really thoughtful of you. Thanks! $1",
    "ChenXiaoMing.GiftReaction.Birthday.Neutral": "Hmm, a birthday gift from you? It's alright, I guess. $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.GiftReaction.Birthday.Dislike": "Wait, this is a birthday gift? It doesn't quite seem like it. $27",
    "ChenXiaoMing.GiftReaction.Birthday.Hate": "What is this supposed to be? $5#$b#A surprise? Well, I am surprised... but not in a good way. $8",
    
    "ShiFuShan.GiftTastes.love": "This looks really nice, @. $1",
    "ShiFuShan.GiftTastes.like": "I'll accept this, thank you.",
    "ShiFuShan.GiftTastes.dislike": "Is this supposed to be a gift? I didn't think this could count as one.",
    "ShiFuShan.GiftTastes.hate": "I'm too old for jokes like this. Please don't... $2",
    "ShiFuShan.GiftTastes.neutral": "Thank you. $2",
