    "LiQingFeng.AcceptBouquet": "For me? Oh... thank you. $11#$b#Alright, I'll accept your feelings. Don't make me regret it. $12",
    "LiQingFeng.HitBySlingshot": "Ow! What was that for? That hurts! $18",
    "LiQingFeng.MovieInvitation": "A movie? Of course! I love going to the movies. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.Spouse.MonstersInHouse": "Wait, what? Monsters? In the house? $3#$b#Deal with them, dear! I'm not doing it! $18",
    "LiQingFeng.SpouseStardrop": "What's this? Is it safe to eat? $17#$b#Just teasing! I got it just for you. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.RejectBouquet.Divorced": "Do you really think I'd fall for you again? Take it away. $5",
    "LiQingFeng.RejectBouquet.NpcAlreadyMarried": "You're already married! How could you even think of this? $2",
    "LiQingFeng.RejectBouquet.VeryLowHearts": "Do we even know each other? This feels like a bad joke. $3",
    "LiQingFeng.RejectBouquet.LowHearts": "I don't think we're that close yet. Sorry. $9",
    "LiQingFeng.RejectGift.Divorced": "Don't bother. It's too late for us. $3",
    "LiQingFeng.RejectMermaidPendant.PlayerWithSomeoneElse": "You're with someone else. What are you thinking? $3",
    "LiQingFeng.RejectMermaidPendant.Divorced": "Are you trying to insult me? $2",
    "LiQingFeng.RejectMermaidPendant.NpcWithSomeoneElse": "Sorry, I already have someone special. $3",
    "LiQingFeng.RejectMermaidPendant.Under8Hearts": "We're not that close. $3",
    "LiQingFeng.RejectMermaidPendant.Under10Hearts": "Not yet, dear. Let's take our time. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.RejectMermaidPendant.Under10Hearts.AskedAgain": "You really don't give up, do you? We need more time. $18",
    "LiQingFeng.RejectMermaidPendant.NeedHouseUpgrade": "I'd love to, but... your house is too small for the two of us. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.RejectMovieTicket.AlreadyInvitedBySomeoneElse": "Sorry, I already made plans with someone else. $3",
    "LiQingFeng.RejectMovieTicket.AlreadyWatchedThisWeek": "I've already been to a movie this week. Let's go next time. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.RejectMovieTicket.Divorced": "A movie with you? No, thanks. $3",
    "LiQingFeng.FlowerDance.Accept_Spouse": "Of course, dear. I'd love to dance with you. $12",
    "LiQingFeng.FlowerDance.Accept": "You want to dance with me? Alright, let's do it. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.cc.Complete": "You fixed the Community Center? That's amazing! $1#$b#It's nice to see that place lively again.",
    "LiQingFeng.cc.Bus": "The bus is working again? That's wonderful! $3#$b#I can't wait to visit the Oasis store!",
    "LiQingFeng.joja.Begin": "Have you heard? Joja is turning the old Community Center into their warehouse. $3#$b#I thought Mayor Lewis wanted to fix it. Guess I was wrong. $18",
    "LiQingFeng.movieTheater": "There's a new movie theater? Really? $1#$b#I can't wait to watch something there, it's so much better than staying at home. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.GreenRain": "Huh? What's going on outside? $3#$b#I've lived here for a while, but I've never seen weather like this before. $2",
    "LiQingFeng.GreenRainFinished": "Yesterday was so strange! I thought I was dreaming because I slept too much. $17#$b#But I guess it's nothing serious. Even my father called to check if everything was okay. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.GreenRain.2": "Again? This weather is back? $3#$b#It always leaves the yard such a mess, with weeds everywhere. $18",
    "LiQingFeng.Resort": "Are you here for vacation too? $1#$b#I'm just checking out the food. I hope they have something special. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.Mon.0h": "How have you been lately, @? I feel a bit sleepy again. $2#$b#Maybe I'll need another cup of milk tea to wake myself up later. #$e#Do you like milk tea? $3",
    "LiQingFeng.Tue.0h": "So sleepy today... $2#$b#Looks like I'll need to take a nap later. $8#$e#Oh, I didn't see you there. Did you need something today? $1#$b#Alright then, see you. $2",
    "LiQingFeng.Wed.0h": "My father is always away for work and hardly comes home, so I've gotten used to living here alone. $2#$e#Do you live by yourself too, @?",
    "LiQingFeng.Thu.0h": "I'm not really into video games, but my father is the complete opposite. $3#$b#When he was younger, he was so obsessed with games that he'd forget to eat. #$e#He says playing a great game is like admiring a masterpiece, it's easy to get lost in it. $3",
    "LiQingFeng.Fri.0h": "Yeah, I don't drink alcohol, and neither does my family. $3#$b#We've had some unpleasant experiences with it, so we've always disliked that kind of thing. $2",
    "LiQingFeng.Sat.0h": "Saturday, boring old Saturday. $8#$b#Oh! Sorry, I stayed up too late listening to music again last night. $2#$e#Well, alright then. Take care. $2",
    "LiQingFeng.Sun.0h": "Hi there! Just saying hello? Of course! #$e#I like saying hi too, but I get a little shy, especially when everyone in town gathers together. $3",
    "LiQingFeng.Mon.2h": "Hi there, @. How's your farm doing lately?#$b#Sounds like it's going great!$1#$e#If you have some free time this week, feel free to come hang out with me.",
    "LiQingFeng.Tue.2h": "Anything good happen today? Can you share it with me?$1#$e#Wow, that's amazing! How interesting.",
    "LiQingFeng.Wed.2h": "I'm so tired, @. I feel like I need to go back to bed.$8#$e#Alright, see you later then.$2",
    "LiQingFeng.Thu.2h": "What should we chat about today? Music, maybe? Do you have a favorite band, @?#$e#I love Green Day! I listen to their songs almost every day. What about you?$7#$b#Honestly, I'm just bored and looking for company. Hope that's okay.$3",
    "LiQingFeng.Fri.2h": "Hey! Do you notice anything different about me today?$7#$b#What? Too childish? Can't I be a little playful?$3#$b#Alright, I know you're just joking.$7",
    "LiQingFeng.Sat.2h": "I'm not a big fan of fishes, not for any particular reason. My family just didn't cook it much.$2#$e#I feel like it's more of a thing older folks enjoy. At least, that's what I think.",
    "LiQingFeng.Sun.2h": "I don't read novels much, but a lot of great movies are based on them.$3#$e#I heard there's a girl up north who writes novels. I wonder how her stories would look as movies.$7",
    "LiQingFeng.Mon.4h": "What a refreshing day! Anything new happening lately?$1#$b#Sounds pretty nice. Want some milk tea?#$e#Just kidding, you're not getting any! Haha.$7",
    "LiQingFeng.Tue.4h": "Hi there! By the way, what's your favorite drink?$1#$e#Oh, I see! You're asking about mine?#$b#I love bubble milk tea! The tea is so fragrant, and the pearls are so soft and chewy. It's absolutely delicious!$1",
    "LiQingFeng.Wed.4h": "You're asking about my father? He's a designer. He often teaches me things like drawing.$17#$b#But his biggest dream was to become a pilot. Sadly, that's not really possible anymore.$3#$e#But that's all in the past now. What's your dream?",
    "LiQingFeng.Thu.4h": "How's your farm doing today?$1#$e#The way you manage it sounds so interesting. I hope it keeps getting better!#$e#Anyway, I'll take my leave. Time for another cup of milk tea!$7",
    "LiQingFeng.Fri.4h": "How is it Friday already?$17#$b#I don't really go to the saloon. If I do, I usually just get some coffee.$3#$e#Compared to milk tea, coffee is more energizing, but it's too bitter for me.$7",
    "LiQingFeng.Sat.4h": "How's your day going?$e#Are you getting enough rest this season?",
    "LiQingFeng.Sun.4h": "Maybe I should try growing some plants? They'd look great in my room.$7#$b#You're the expert on this. Could you help me pick something suitable?",
    "LiQingFeng.Mon.6h": "......$3#$b#Oh! Sorry, I was lost in thought.#$e#Do you like watching movies? If you're interested, I can show you some of my favorites sometime.$1",
    "LiQingFeng.Tue.6h": "What do you think of my home's decor? I feel like it's a bit too vintage.$17#$b#Of course, I didn't design it. My father insisted on this style, so I had no choice.$2#$e#At least I get to decorate my own room. Do you think adding some plants would make it better?$3",
    "LiQingFeng.Wed.6h": "Anything fun happening today, @?#$b#Sounds great! By the way... how does my makeup look today? Not bad, right?$7#$e#Alright, see you tomorrow then. I'll head out for now.",
    "LiQingFeng.Thu.6h": "I've been in Pelican Town for a while now, but I haven't made many friends.$2#$e#Maybe it's because I'm a bit shy. Should I try joining more town activities?",
    "LiQingFeng.Fri.6h": "Friday, Friday, feeling lively!$1#$e#You mean the traveling merchant near the Cindersap Forest? I don't go there...#$b#The scenery is nice, but it's so far, and walking all that way feels exhausting...$1",
    "LiQingFeng.Sat.6h": "Got any plans this Saturday?$e#Maybe I could make some milk tea for you?$1#$b#If it's made with milk, it's healthy, right? I think so...$3",
    "LiQingFeng.Sun.6h": "I'm so sleepy... Do you feel like chatting?$2#$e#You should've said so earlier! Talking about this wakes me right up.#$e#Wait, you noticed I didn't wear makeup today and still think I'm cute? You've got a good eye.$2",
    "LiQingFeng.Mon.8h": "Take me on, I'll be gone~$1#$b#Uh, I guess I started singing to myself again.$3#$e#Sorry about that. I just got so caught up in the moment.$1",
    "LiQingFeng.Tue.8h": "How's it going today? Do you have any animals on your farm?#$b#I love bunnies! Someday, I'd love to have a whole group of them.$1#$e#See you later, bye!$7",
    "LiQingFeng.Wed.8h": "You're asking why I always look sleepy?$3#$b#It's because I like listening to music late at night. What kind of music do you enjoy?#$e#It matters, of course! Listening to music keeps me up, so I end up going to bed really late.$2#$e#I know it's not a great habit, but I just can't help it...$2",
    "LiQingFeng.Thu.8h": "I live alone and I've gotten used to it.$2#$b#But someday, I'd love to travel more. How about a trip to Zuzu City?",
    "LiQingFeng.Fri.8h": "It's a shame that Gus doesn't sell bubble tea.$2#$b#I guess I'll have to gather the ingredients and make it myself.$3#$e#Do you have a favorite drink? Maybe coffee or tea?",
    "LiQingFeng.Sat.8h": "It's Saturday! How was your week?$e#As for me, it's just the usual... milk tea, milk tea, and more milk tea.$7",
    "LiQingFeng.Sun.8h": "I'm not a big fan of crowded places. They make me feel uneasy.$2#$b#But chatting with you is different. I feel like I can really open up.$7#$e#Promise me you'll come talk to me again next week, okay?",
    "LiQingFeng.Mon.10h": "A new week has started! Got anything exciting planned? $12#$b#Me? I don't have a farm, so I don't have nearly as much work to do. $11#$e#Huh? Move in with you? Haha, don't be silly! $15",
    "LiQingFeng.Tue.10h": "Hey! How's your day going? $1#$b#Me? I'm just happy every time you show up. #$e#I wish we could always stick together. I really hope we can always be together. How about starting this spring? $4#$e#Haha, I knew you'd say yes! You're adorable. $12",
    "LiQingFeng.Wed.10h": "What kind of movies do you like? $e#Oh, we're into the same stuff? That's awesome! Want to watch one of my favorites together? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.Thu.10h": "@! There you are! How's it going? $e#Do I like bunnies? Of course! Wait... did you just say you'd give me a rabbit's foot? Please tell me you're joking. $3",
    "LiQingFeng.Fri.10h": "So, what's growing on your farm these days, @? $7#$e#Oh, have you heard about this magical plant? They say it's from a panda way up north.#$e#But honestly, I prefer bunnies way more than plants, hehe. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.Sat.10h": "Alright, be real, did you put a spell on me? You're all I think about. $1#$e#Wait, what? You actually know magic? Stop messing with me! Haha. $7#$e#Okay, my magician, show me your best romantic trick! $12",
    "LiQingFeng.Sun.10h": "Have you seen 'La La Land'? $7#$e#It's such a cool movie! There's this one line I love.#$b#'When I first saw you, I imagined spending my whole life with you.' $11",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Mon.0h": "Oh! Hey there?$8#$b#Hmm... yeah, that's right.$2#$e#Sorry, I'm just feeling a little sleepy.$2",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Tue.0h": "How's your day going?#$e#The heat is so intense it's making me forget how tired I am.$3#$e#Anyway, see you later. Bye-bye!",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Wed.0h": "It's such a hot day.#$b#Are you seriously working on your farm in this heat? You're so dedicated.$3",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Thu.0h": "How are you doing today?#$e#That sounds really fun! I'd love to hear more about it.$1",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Fri.0h": "Oh, it's you! Did you need something?#$e#You just came to say hi? Of course, that's always welcome.$1",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Sat.0h": "Saturday's here again. How's your farm been this week?#$e#Don't overwork yourself in this weather. You don't want to get heatstroke! Take care, okay?$7",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Sun.0h": "I'm starving.$2#$b#I think I need a milk tea right now.$3",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Mon.2h": "I'm so sleepy today.$2#$e#I think I need another nap.$2#$e#Ugh...$2",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Tue.2h": "Want to chat for a bit? Sure!#$e#It's getting hotter and hotter. I really wish I had ice cream right now.$3#$e#You say there's a small stand in town? Too bad they only have the classic flavors.$4",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Wed.2h": "It's so hot, I'm starving, and I'm exhausted.$2#$e#I need to head back and cool off. See you tomorrow!$2",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Thu.2h": "What's your favorite thing about this season?$3#$b#I saw on TV that people are growing hops and starfruit. Do you have any on your farm?",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Fri.2h": "Today? It's way too hot...$3#$e#Stop staring at me like that! I feel like my makeup is melting.$18#$e#Anyway, I'll get going now.",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Sat.2h": "I'm not a big fan of summer, mostly because...$2#$b#There are bugs everywhere! Flying ones, crawling ones.$2#$e#You don't have any on you, do you?$3",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Sun.2h": "It's Sunday? This week went by so fast.$3#$b#How's your farm? Everything going smoothly?#$e#Well, I won't keep you any longer. See you around.$7",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Mon.4h": "Wow, it's you again. $3#$e#On such a hot Monday? If I get heatstroke, will you carry me home? $2#$b Just kidding, of course. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Tue.4h": "Hi there! Besides bubble tea, what else do I like? $1#$b#In summer, it's iced bubble tea, of course. Winter?#$b#Hot bubble tea, of course! But winter's still a long way off. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Wed.4h": "My father? I haven't seen him for a while now. I'm used to it. $2#$e#I know he's working hard for me, but I still wish he could spend more time with me. $2",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Thu.4h": "Thursday, huh? $1#$b#I almost forgot what day it is. #$e#Maybe I should take a nap to clear my head. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Fri.4h": "Friday already. Are you heading to the saloon for some fun? #$b#Why don't I go to the saloon? I don't like drinking, and Gus doesn't have bubble tea. $2",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Sat.4h": "How's your day? Is the farm keeping you busy? $1#$e#Don't overwork yourself in this heat, okay?",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Sun.4h": "Ugh, I hate summer! $2#$b#Everything feels like it's melting. I can't imagine how people lived in the past without air conditioning. $3",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Mon.6h": "Oh, it's you! How's your day going? #$e#My face is red? It's probably just from the sun. $4",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Tue.6h": "Hey, how's everything? Tuesday already? #$b#Looks like Pierre's shop is closed tomorrow. $1#$e#Not that it matters, I usually get what I need online anyway.",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Wed.6h": "Anything to tell me? Of course, I want to hear! #$e#How's the farm? You must have it full of summer crops by now. $1#$e#That's it? Alright, see you later! $1",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Thu.6h": "You always seem to have time to visit. $1#$e#I'm starting to miss my father. He used to take me on trips this time of year. $2",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Fri.6h": "Friday already, so exciting! $1#$b#Wait, did I say this last time? I can't remember. Haha! $7#$e#Oh, okay, I guess I did. $3",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Sat.6h": "How's your Saturday? #$b#Me? I've been kind of lazy this summer. $1#$e#See you tomorrow? Sure, why not. $3",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Sun.6h": "How am I today? Pretty cute, don't you think? $7#$e#How was your week? Is the farm doing okay?",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Mon.8h": "Monday already? I think I stayed up too late again last night. $2#$b#But as soon as you show up, I feel energized. Hehe, how's your day? $1",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Tue.8h": "Today? It's going great, really! $3#$e#Do you have any movies you want to watch? Maybe you could come over sometime, and we can watch one together. #$b#What kind of movies do you like? Just... not horror, okay? $3",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Wed.8h": "This summer is so boring, everything is just unbearably hot. $2#$e#But when you're here, it's different. You always bring something fun to talk about.",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Thu.8h": "Bunnies! Bunnies! Bunnies! #$e#I'd love to have a whole bunch of them at home! $1",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Fri.8h": "How's it going today? Have you ever been to the Coal Forest? $1#$e#I've heard from the villagers that there's a strange person living in the tall tower there, so I've never dared to go. #$e#Have you been? It must feel like an adventure! $1",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Sat.8h": "Hop... hop... hop... $1#$b#Oh, you caught me again! I was just talking to myself. #$e#It's nothing, I just like talking to myself when I'm alone. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Sun.8h": "Sunday, and it's still this hot summer Sunday. $2#$b#In this heat, I really don't feel like going anywhere. Just stepping outside makes me sweat all over. $2#$e#Do you take extra baths in this weather? $3",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Mon.10h": "@! $7#$b#How do I look today? Cute enough for you? Hehe. $1#$e#Having you around this summer makes me so happy. $12",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Tue.10h": "Have you ever been to the desert? I can't imagine what's fun out there. #$b#But if it's with you, I bet anything could be fun! Being around you makes everything better. $1#$e#See you tomorrow? Why wait until tomorrow? $18",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Wed.10h": "Oh, you're here again? #$b#Of course, I'm happy to see you! Why wouldn't I be? $1#$e#You're my favorite person. Well, okay, maybe after my father! $4",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Thu.10h": "@! How's your day going so far? #$e#Do you have bunnies on your farm? Can I come over and pet them? Please? $3",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Fri.10h": "When I was a kid, I used to dream about being with someone I really loved. $1#$b#Is that silly? Or do you think it's kind of sweet? $7#$e#You're so fun to talk to. See you tomorrow, okay? $18",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Sat.10h": "I don't like you... just kidding! $18#$e#How could I not? You're my favorite person, silly! $1#$e#Well, after my father. But you're right up there! $1",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Sun.10h": "Got any plans? How about bubble tea with me? $12#$e#Do you have milk at your place? Maybe I could come over and make some for us! $11",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Mon.0h": "Oh? Hello there...$2#$b#Yeah, I'm still sleepy. $8#$e#Alright then, take care now. $2",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Tue.0h": "Hi there, @.#$b#Isn't fall the season of harvest? What kinds of crops are you growing on your farm?#$e#Me? I don't plant much, honestly. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Wed.0h": "How's your day going?#$b#It's Wednesday already... time just flies, doesn't it? $3#$b#Oh, alright. See you later. $18",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Thu.0h": "Isn't fall just so beautiful? $1#$b#It feels like the perfect time for some milk tea, don't you think?#$e#Your farm must have plenty of things for making it.",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Fri.0h": "I'm not a fan of alcohol, and I don't drink it. $18#$b#No real reason, I just don't enjoy it. $18#$e#Well, I guess that's all for today.",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Sat.0h": "(Qingfeng looks like she just woke up) $2#$e#Oh, good morning. $8",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Sun.0h": "Today? I've got a few things to take care of.#$b#Next time, okay? I should have time then. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Mon.2h": "@! How's your day going?#$b#Fall is here! Do you grow fairy roses on your farm? $1#$e#I've always loved those flowers.",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Tue.2h": "Did I catch you staring? $3#$b#It's alright, I don't mind.",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Wed.2h": "Oh, @, it's you. $3#$e#I was daydreaming about a story and didn't even notice you. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Thu.2h": "Wait, it's Thursday already? I completely forgot. $2#$b#I'm terrible at keeping track of days. What was your name again, @? $3#$e#Just kidding! $7",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Fri.2h": "Hmm, yeah, today's definitely Thursday. I'm sure of it. $7#$b#What? It's Friday? $3#$e#You're not messing with me, right? $3",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Sat.2h": "Oh? Hi there! Got some free time today? $3#$e#Your farm's so far away... don't you ever get overwhelmed with work? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Sun.2h": "I love spending Sundays watching movies, it's the best way to unwind.#$e#Oh, and listening to music too. Are you into funk? $7#$b#Not like Green Day punk... I mean phonk, P-H-O-N-K.",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Mon.4h": "Fall Mondays... I just love this kind of atmosphere. $1#$b#How's everything going on your farm, @?#$e#Alright, I won't keep you. See you later. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Tue.4h": "@! Do you have a favorite drink for fall?#$b#I'll try just about anything, as long as it's not alcohol. $7#$e#Vegetable juice? Maybe... but it might be a little too bitter for me. $3",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Wed.4h": "It's already fall, and my father still hasn't come back. He just tells me how busy he is over video calls. $2#$e#But when you visit, it's not so lonely anymore.",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Thu.4h": "I love fairy roses. Their soft pink color is so pretty. $1#$e#Kind of like my hair, actually. Although I don't remember when I dyed it. $7#$b#I heard Pierre's daughter dyed her hair too. Hers is more of an amethyst shade. $3",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Fri.4h": "Today is definitely Friday. I'm not wrong this time.#$b#You can't trick me, I checked the calendar! Haha. $7#$e#How's the farm doing? Everything going well this fall?",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Sat.4h": "You know how to fish? That's pretty cool. #$b#No, no, don't give me any. I don't cook fish, and I'm not a big fan of eating it. $3#$e#Wait, fish, not crimson feathers? Where did you even hear about that?",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Sun.4h": "Chatting? Of course, I don't mind. #$e#Turns out Zuzu City is pretty interesting, but if it gets too crowded, I lose all my excitement. $2",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Mon.6h": "How's your day going? Mondays must be super busy for you, huh? #$b#I've never really worked on a farm, but maybe you could teach me sometime? $7#$e#I'm thinking about getting some plants. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Tue.6h": "Oh, you're here again! Hurry up, come closer. #$b#How do I look today? Do I have that fall vibe going? $7#$e#I definitely didn't learn this from my father though, he's not exactly the best at styling. $3",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Wed.6h": "It's Wednesday already? I don't really have anything planned. $e#Sounds like you're pretty busy. Have you had a break since moving from Zuzu City? $3#$e#Well, even when you're busy, it's good to take a moment and enjoy the view. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Thu.6h": "Pelican Town isn't that exciting, it's pretty much the same old thing. $2#$b#I don't know what Lewis is up to, but he's not really making this place any more fun. $8",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Fri.6h": "It's Friday! I'm sure it's Friday! You can't trick me. $7#$e#Do you watch the TV? I mostly watch that chef hat guy's show. $e#Oh, and yes, I do everything 100%, haha, just kidding. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Sat.6h": "How's your day going? $e#With all those animals, your farm must be super busy! I love little bunnies! $1#$e#Winter's almost here, have you made sure they're all warm enough? $3",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Sun.6h": "How's today? I feel super energetic, like I could watch a bunch of movies! $1#$e#Of course, I'm not as tired now that I've met you. $e#I used to nap a lot, but now I just sleep when I feel like it. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Mon.8h": "Hey, you're here again! How's your day? Did you bring something cool to show me?#$e#If I had my own farm, I'd totally plant a giant field of fairy roses in the fall. $1#$b#And I'd use all the milk to make milk tea. I mean, who doesn't love milk tea?",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Tue.8h": "Books? No, I'm not much of a reader. Not every girl's into that, you know. $8#$e#But music? Oh, I'm all about it. Rock music? Absolutely, punk rock all the way! $7#$e#You said there's a three-person band in town that's pretty good? Maybe we can go see them together sometime.",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Wed.8h": "Fall is so pretty, isn't it? Everything's just so colorful. $1#$b#But it's getting chilly, so don't go catching a cold, okay? $7#$e#I don't get sick that much, but I bet the town doctor's making a fortune this time of year. $3#$e#I mean, paying for medicine is just how it goes, right?",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Thu.8h": "Thursday, huh? Alright, I'll trust you on this one.#$e#What, you caught me? Guess there's no escaping now! $17#$e#How was my impression? It's a line from this comedy I like.",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Fri.8h": "I don't drink, so you won't catch me at the saloon. $3#$b#Yeah, my family's not really into drinking either. You shouldn't drink too much, okay? $3#$e#I had a relative who drank too much... it didn't end well. $2",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Sat.8h": "Saturday? Wait, I thought it was Friday. $1#$e#Oh, never mind. How's your day going so far?#$b#Alright then, see you tomorrow. I always look forward to hanging out with you. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Sun.8h": "Do you know the secret to making amazing milk tea?#$e#Do you have a kitchen at home? You've gotta know how to cook at least a little, right? $7#$e#Alright, that's it for this week. Let's catch up next week, okay?",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Mon.10h": "Hey there! Are you cold?#$e#Want me to warm you up? Just kidding! Hehe. $12#$e#What? No, it's not what you're thinking. Really, it's not. $11",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Tue.10h": "You're here again! What, you can't get enough of me, huh? You little rascal. $3#$e#Me, upset? Of course not! You're always welcome.#$b#Want me to sing you a song? Hehe... I'm just joking! Unless you really want me to. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Wed.10h": "A movie? With me? Of course, I'm in!#$e#As long as it's not a horror movie, I'm fine. But something romantic would be the best. $7#$e#What? Hehe. $12",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Thu.10h": "You're here every single day, huh? Not that I mind! $7#$e#How was my day? Hmm, just the usual—milk tea, movies, milk tea, movies, and more milk tea. #$e#What? Stop teasing me! Hehe. $12",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Fri.10h": "You... $12#$b#Oh, nothing. You just look kinda sweet today. $11#$e#What? No, I don't want to eat you or anything... maybe just a tiny lick. $12#$b#Like candy, of course! Hehe. $12",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Sat.10h": "Saturday? It's Monday, isn't it? $17#$e#What? Oh, I'm just messing with you! That's what girlfriends do. $7#$e#You can try teasing me too, but don't expect me to fall for it! $12",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.Sun.10h": "Oh, it's Sunday already? No big deal. $12#$e#It's just... seeing you makes me blush a little. Sorry! $11#$e#Huh? $9#$b#What? Hehe. $12",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Mon.0h": "It's getting so cold! How are the animals on your farm doing? $2#$b#Wait, don't they hibernate? Oh... I guess not. $3#$b#Well, I think I might need to hibernate! $8",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Tue.0h": "You're not busy this winter? How come you have so much free time? $17#$b#Oh, right. No crops to take care of in winter. Lucky you! $2#$b#Alright then, see you later!",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Wed.0h": "So sleepy... $2#$b#Oh, you're that farmer, right? Here to chat again? $3",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Thu.0h": "Does your farm have any winter crops? $b#Pierre doesn't sell seeds in winter, right? I've never bought seeds myself. $3#$b#Do you have a greenhouse on your farm? That sounds so cool! $9",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Fri.0h": "I don't drink, okay? Don't ask why. $3#$b#Do I even look like someone who drinks? Nope, didn't think so. $18",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Sat.0h": "Looks like it's Saturday. This winter feels soooo long. #$b#Hot milk tea? Now that's a great idea. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Sun.0h": "You don't sleep in on Sundays? $2#$b#Well, I'm definitely sleeping in today. $8",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Mon.2h": "Hey, @! Busy this winter? #$b#If not, you could always drop by my place—just not during nap time, okay? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Tue.2h": "Something good happen? You've got that 'super smug' look on your face. $7#$b#Your smile's so big it could reach the sky! It's even more dramatic than in the movies I've seen. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Wed.2h": "Any plans for Wednesday, @? #$b#If it's too cold outside, you can always stop by my place to warm up! $7",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Thu.2h": "Have you ever seen those little bugs in the ground? Are they worms? I've never dug one up. $3#$e#Ugh, they seem to get more active in winter. So gross. $9#$b#Wait... have you actually dug one up? Eww! $3",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Fri.2h": "Do you like cooking? #$b#My fridge is full of ingredients, but... no fish. $7#$e#I've never met anyone as obsessed with fish as that old guy down south. $3",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Sat.2h": "Cold days like this are perfect for cozy winter outfits. $7#$b#Do you keep your clothes organized and ready to wash? I've got a bunch of stuff stored upstairs. $3",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Sun.2h": "Finally Sunday! Winter really feels never-ending, huh? $3#$b#I'm doing fine, though. My house isn't too cold, thanks to the genius invention of floor heating! $7#$b#Alright then, see you next week? Bye! $7",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Mon.4h": "Hey, you're back again, @! #$b#Anything new and exciting this winter? $7#$e#Oh, that sounds pretty cool!",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Tue.4h": "You look just as sleepy as I feel! $1#$e#Or is winter keeping you busy with so much work? #$b#How about I make you some hot milk tea to cheer you up when I get the chance? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Wed.4h": "It's already Wednesday? Winter naps make time fly by, don't they? $18#$b#I heard there's no snow in the desert out west during winter. It must be so warm there! $17",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Thu.4h": "How's the farm doing? Not much to grow in winter, right? $7#$e#And the animals? I heard they need heaters to stay warm in winter. $9#$b#If you need anything, come find me! I'll cheer you on... mentally, at least. Hehe. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Fri.4h": "Feeling cold lately? You look like you're about to disappear into your coat! $3#$e#So, are you heading to the saloon tonight? $17#$b#Me? I don't really like going there, but I guess it's not a bad place to warm up. $18",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Sat.4h": "Oh, hey there! #$b#What's up today? Are you here to hang out with me? $17#$e#Alright then, see you tomorrow, @? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Sun.4h": "Just stopping by to say hi? Of course, anytime! Are you busy this weekend? #$b#Do you have farm work to do in winter, or are you just cozy at home like me? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Mon.6h": "Hmm... $3#$b#Oh, I was just thinking about a scene from a movie. #$b#Do you have a favorite movie scene? $1",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Tue.6h": "Isn't winter just the perfect season for sleeping? $2#$b#You agree, right? Long nights and short days... or was it the other way around? $4",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Wed.6h": "Ever thought about going camping? I feel like I need to explore nature a bit, @. #$b#Wait, it's winter now? $1#$b#I guess I'm still sleepy. $2",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Thu.6h": "Do people usually go out much in winter? $3#$b#I wouldn't know, I barely leave the house myself!",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Fri.6h": "Friday, Friday! Feeling full of energy! $1#$b#Wanna have a snowball fight? $7#$b#Just kidding. I'm not actually that good at it. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Sat.6h": "Nothing beats a warm drink on a day like this. #$b#Hot milk, hot coffee... and of course, hot milk tea! $1",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Sun.6h": "Sundays in winter just scream 'nap time,' don't they? $2#$b#But now that you're here to chat, I don't feel so sleepy anymore. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Mon.8h": "Take me on, I'll be gone~ $1#$b#Oops, I started singing again, didn't I? $3#$b#Sorry about that! I just got lost in the moment. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Tue.8h": "Do you think bunnies would look extra cute bundled up for winter? #$b#I really want to see it! How about we try it on your farm? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Wed.8h": "Do you think the water's frozen over in this weather? $3#$b#I don't fish, so it's not like I'd know. #$b#But if you go ice fishing, make sure to stay warm, okay? $2",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Thu.8h": "Winter is the perfect time to stay cozy at home, sipping on some hot milk tea by the heater. Don't you agree? $7#$b#I don't have a heater, though, it's just a thought! Haha.",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Fri.8h": "I absolutely love watching movies. $1#$b#When I was little, my father and I would watch all sorts of films together, even kids' movies. #$b#I really miss those times. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Sat.8h": "How about we jam out to some punk rock together? $7#$b#It's great for warming up the vibe... and your body too, hehe.",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Sun.8h": "Winter feels like the season for family gatherings, doesn't it? I wish my father was here. $2#$b#But having you around makes things so much better. $1#$b#Promise me you'll come by next week too, okay? $1",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Mon.10h": "I heard there's a little talking red panda up north! $3#$b#Have you met him? $3#$b#I hope no one's hurt him... or that he hasn't hurt anyone else, right?",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Tue.10h": "When making hot milk tea in winter, you have to get the temperature and timing just right. $1#$b#It's all about patience, gently warming it—kind of like us, don't you think? $7#$b#This cozy feeling is so nice, isn't it?",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Wed.10h": "Have you ever been to a movie theater? #$b#The immersive feeling is amazing! And enjoying it with some milk tea and popcorn? Perfect. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Thu.10h": "@, you haven't caught a cold or anything, have you? $3#$b#I'm not sure how good I'd be at taking care of someone, but if you get sick, I'll try my best! Maybe with a warm towel or something? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Fri.10h": "@, could you lend me your coat? $7#$b#I'm not actually that cold, but isn't it romantic, like in the movies? $1",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Sat.10h": "Did you remember to wear gloves today? Make sure you're staying warm! #$b#If you didn't, I guess you can borrow my hands to warm yours for a bit. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.Sun.10h": "Oh no, your cheeks are so red from the cold! We need to warm you up right away. $3#$b#What? It's not from the cold? Oh, I get it now, you little rascal, hehe. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.12": "Egg Festival, huh? When I was little, I hadn't moved to Gingko Lane yet, so I never joined the egg hunt. $1#$b#I'm too old to compete with the kids now—if my father knew, he'd definitely laugh at me. $3#$b#Oh, by the way, I heard Pierre sells strawberry seeds during the festival. Have you saved up enough money for them? $1",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.13": "Are you joining the Egg Festival today? If so, I'll wish you good luck in advance! #$b#If only there were unlimited bubble tea at the festival... but unfortunately, Gus didn't prepare any. $3",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.16": "You have time to visit me today? Of course, you're always welcome here! $1#$b#Why am I so happy? My birthday gift from my father just came in! $1#$b#Wait, your parents didn't give you birthday presents? No way... (Qingfeng silently thinks: 'Poor thing, the farmer's life must be rough.') $3",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.23": "Tomorrow's the annual Flower Dance. Me? I don't like dancing. $3#$b#I prefer watching everyone get all shy and awkward! Hehe. #$b#What? No, I'm not embarrassed, it's just... just don't ask! $3",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.24": "There's no way I'm dancing. Never, not even if you begged me. $7#$b#But are you? Got someone in mind? Just curious... $7",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.10": "Ugh, that purple guy's back. I don't like him. $2#$b#Of course, I can tolerate the potluck soup, it's not as good as bubble tea, but still. #$b#Have you prepared any ingredients? Lewis says we can add our own to the potluck. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.11": "Looks like a lot of people are headed to the beach for the festival. #$b#Me? Of course I'm going! Staying cooped up all the time isn't good. I need to get out and breathe some fresh air. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.28": "The Moonlight Jellies? I saw them once in one of my father's paintings. #$b#If only he could come and see them with me tonight. $2",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.15": "Tomorrow, Pelican Town will be bustling with the fair, so much fun and food! $7#$b#Your farm must have a lot of great items ready for display, right?",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.16": "Honestly, all these strangers make me feel uneasy. $3#$b#But free food from Gus makes all those worries disappear! $7",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.27": "Finally, this season is coming to an end. $1#$b#As for Spirit's Eve tomorrow, I'm not a fan of the maze, and I'm not expecting any treats inside... it's definitely not going to be food. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.7": "The Festival of Ice is the most boring festival. No good food, no fun activities. $2#$b#I'm skipping it tomorrow. It's so dull, staying home and watching BiliBili is way more interesting. $3",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.14": "Tomorrow night? Winter nights are way too cold and late for me. $3#$b#If my father knew I was wandering around so late, he'd worry about me again. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.17": "I can't miss the annual Night Market, it's too much of a waste! $17#$b#I promise I'll head home quickly tonight. #$b#I mean it! Hehe. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.24": "Tomorrow is my favorite festival, Feast of the Winter Star! So many delicious dishes on the table, it's irresistible. $1#$b#Have you prepared your gift? I nearly forgot until you mentioned it. $3",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.25": "@, is there a gift you're really hoping for? #$b#Interesting! For me, it's always my father's gift. He knows exactly what I love. $2",

    "ShiFuShan.Introduction": "Hello there. Nice to meet you. My name is Shi Fushan, and I'm the mayor of Red Panda Bazaar. #$b#I hope you visit often to bring some life to our town.",
    "ShiFuShan.danceRejection": "Me? I don't enjoy dancing. $3",
    "ShiFuShan.DumpsterDiveComment": "I doubt you'll find anything you need in there. $3",
    "ShiFuShan.HitBySlingshot": "That's not a nice joke to play on someone. $5",
    "ShiFuShan.GreenRain": "In all my years, this is the first time I've seen such weather. $3#$b#But the governor said this rain is completely harmless, so don't be scared. $2",
    "ShiFuShan.GreenRainFinished": "I hope we don't see rain like yesterday again. $3#$b#If it happens again, I think we'll all handle it better. $1",
    "ShiFuShan.GreenRain.2": "Looks like this rain is going to become a yearly guest. $3#$b#It's a good reminder to keep our backyards clean. $0",
    "ShiFuShan.Mon.0h": "The weather's lovely today. Perfect for being outdoors.",
    "ShiFuShan.Tue.0h": "I know Mayor Lewis from Pelican Town quite well. $3#$b#We often share stories from the past and trade tips about being mayors.",
    "ShiFuShan.Wed.0h": "Hmm? Is something the matter? #$b#What is it? Do I have something on my face? $2",
    "ShiFuShan.Thu.0h": "It's not that I don't want to talk. I just have other things to take care of. $1#$b#Feel free to look around if you need anything.",
    "ShiFuShan.Fri.0h": "Sorry you caught me in this state. #$b#I'm not feeling well today. I was up all night working on paperwork. $1",
    "ShiFuShan.Sat.0h": "Hello, @. I wanted to ask you something. $2#$b#Why do other visitors run away when they see me? I just don't get it. $1",
    "ShiFuShan.Sun.0h": "Chandler is one of the few friends I have around my age. He occasionally helps out and shares amusing insights about everyday life. #$b#I hope you get the chance to meet him.",
    "ShiFuShan.Mon.2h": "Hello there, are you shopping at the market? Wishing you a pleasant shopping experience.",
    "ShiFuShan.Tue.2h": "Qing Feng and Xiao Ming look so much like sisters, even though they aren't.",
    "ShiFuShan.Wed.2h": "If I come across as cold, I truly apologize. #$b#It's just how I am, I'm used to it.",
    "ShiFuShan.Thu.2h": "Qingfeng and Xiaoming are always up early running their business, such hardworking young people. $2",
    "ShiFuShan.Fri.2h": "As mayor, it's my duty to maintain order at Red Panda Bazaar. $4",
    "ShiFuShan.Sat.2h": "I remember Qing Feng used to live in Pelican Town for a while. I'm so glad she moved here.",
    "ShiFuShan.Sun.2h": "Seeing Red Panda Bazaar thrive makes me very happy.",
    "ShiFuShan.Mon.4h": "Be honest, do I look scary when I make this face?#$b#Oh, never mind. Don't worry about it. I'm just used to looking like this.$1",  
    "ShiFuShan.Tue.4h": "@, hey there. I've got a lot going on today, so I can't talk much.",  
    "ShiFuShan.Wed.4h": "Ugh, the paperwork is piling up again. Looks like another late night for me.#$b#What can I say? It's part of the job.$4",  
    "ShiFuShan.Thu.4h": "You live in Pelican Town, right? What's it like over there?#$b#Mayor Lewis stops by the Red Panda Bazaar sometimes, but I haven't had the chance to visit Pelican Town much.$3#$b#I get it. I'll make a trip out there sometime.",  
    "ShiFuShan.Fri.4h": "Oh, it's Friday already? Maybe I should take a little break this weekend.",  
    "ShiFuShan.Sat.4h": "@, can I ask you something? What do you think of me?#$b#Wait, do I really look mean? I guess I just have a serious face.$1",  
    "ShiFuShan.Sun.4h": "@, did you really come all this way just to say hi? You must be so busy with everything on the farm.",  
    "ShiFuShan.Mon.6h": "You're our guest, so of course we'll make you feel right at home.",  
    "ShiFuShan.Tue.6h": "I hope everyone here can live life the way they want at the Red Panda Bazaar.#$b#That includes you too. If you ever want to move here, you're always welcome.#$b#Haha, just kidding!$1",  
    "ShiFuShan.Wed.6h": "I think the Red Panda Bazaar is just as good as any other city, and I'm proud of that.",  
    "ShiFuShan.Thu.6h": "Hey @, I've got some official business to handle today. Good luck with your work too!",  
    "ShiFuShan.Fri.6h": "Thanks for visiting. As the mayor of the Red Panda Bazaar, I really appreciate having people like you here.",  
    "ShiFuShan.Sat.6h": "@, farming must be exhausting, huh?#$b#You're always running around, carrying things and staying busy...",  
    "ShiFuShan.Sun.6h": "If you're ever looking for me and I'm not around, just ask Chandler. He always knows where I am.$2",  
    "ShiFuShan.Mon.8h": "@, are you busy running around for the farm again today? You really are a hardworking person.$3",  
    "ShiFuShan.Tue.8h": "Hmm? If you've got something on your mind, just say it. Don't worry, I won't bite.",  
    "ShiFuShan.Wed.8h": "@, what's life like on the farm? It must feel so fulfilling.#$b#If I weren't getting on in years, I'd love to give it a try myself.",  
    "ShiFuShan.Thu.8h": "The spring breeze feels so refreshing. Sometimes I just like to stand still and soak it all in.$3",  
    "ShiFuShan.Fri.8h": "@, if you have the time, drop by the Red Panda Bazaar more often. Don't think of us as strangers.",  
    "ShiFuShan.Sat.8h": "I really enjoy playing chess. What else do I like, you ask?#$b#Hmm, probably watching TV or movies.$4",  
    "ShiFuShan.Sun.8h": "I feel so fortunate to live at the Red Panda Bazaar.",  
    "ShiFuShan.Mon.10h": "When you've got some free time, come play chess with me. It's one of the few ways I unwind.",  
    "ShiFuShan.Tue.10h": "Seeing the Red Panda Bazaar thriving makes me truly happy.#$b#But don't worry, I won't let anyone come here and cause trouble.$5",  
    "ShiFuShan.Wed.10h": "@, you're here! No wine today, how about a cup of tea instead?",  
    "ShiFuShan.Thu.10h": "@, would you mind showing me your farm?#$b#I'm just curious and want to take a look around.",  
    "ShiFuShan.Fri.10h": "How did I become the mayor of the Red Panda Bazaar? That's a long story.#$b#I'll share it with you someday.",  
    "ShiFuShan.Sat.10h": "@, looking at you reminds me of my younger days. What a pleasant feeling.",  
    "ShiFuShan.Sun.10h": "@, the view by the bridge here at the Red Panda Bazaar is incredible. It's the perfect spot to relax.#$b#Many visitors can't stop praising it.",  
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Mon.0h": "Summer is here. The heat makes you sweat so easily, but it won't stop me from working.",  
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Tue.0h": "Did you know there's a red panda here named Pumpkin Pie? It's a rare species.#$b#He's our mascot, and that's why this place is called the Red Panda Bazaar.",  
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Wed.0h": "I'm not a fan of cicadas. Their constant chirping sometimes keeps me from napping.",  
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Thu.0h": "Chandler is great at chess, but he still can't beat me.",  
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Fri.0h": "We don't know each other well yet, but as mayor, I won't let anyone disrupt the lives of the people here. Understood?$2",  
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Sat.0h": "Does Pelican Town have Joja stores too? People there seem to dislike Joja a lot.#$b#We're not particularly interested in them around here.",  
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Sun.0h": "We warmly welcome all visitors here, and of course, that includes you.",  
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Mon.2h": "Do you grow hot peppers on your farm? If you do, please bring me some. I'll pay for them. #$b#I love spicy food and enjoy trying all kinds of peppers. $1",
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Tue.2h": "A tourist once called me an old man and quickly took it back, but I didn't mind. $1#$b#At my age, I really am an old man. What's there to be afraid of? $5",
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Wed.2h": "This weather is so hot. Just walking a few steps makes me sweat. How do you handle working on the farm? $4",
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Thu.2h": "Don't cause trouble around here, or I won't let it slide. $5",
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Fri.2h": "Are you familiar with the Red Panda Bazaar? Do you need me to show you around?",
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Sat.2h": "I usually cook for myself, only buying ready-made meals when I'm really busy. Honestly, that stuff isn't very healthy. $1",
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Sun.2h": "What's wrong? Do I look like someone unreasonable? If there's anything on your mind, feel free to tell me.",
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Mon.4h": "If you want others to respect you, you need to learn to respect them first. That's just common sense.",
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Tue.4h": "You're quite unusual. Most people don't look me in the eyes for more than five seconds.",
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Wed.4h": "I used to just want a simple life, but now that I'm the mayor of Red Panda Bazaar, I have responsibilities to fulfill. $4",
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Thu.4h": "I know my gaze can seem intense, but I can't put on a gentle expression either. $3",
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Fri.4h": "I can't stand sneaky people. They're usually up to no good. If you have something to say, just say it to my face. $5",
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Sat.4h": "@, do you think my beard is too long? Should I trim it or shave it off? #$b#Never mind, I think it looks fine the way it is.",
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Sun.4h": "Qingfeng and Xiaoming's shop is always busy. Does everyone love coffee that much? I don't really get it. $2",
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Mon.6h": "Ah, nothing feels better than playing a game of chess after finishing work.",
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Tue.6h": "Even though I'm the mayor, I still shop, eat, and sleep like everyone else. I hope you'll see me as an ordinary person.",
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Wed.6h": "@, you seem really busy. Hmph, that's how a farmer should look.",
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Thu.6h": "Sometimes, I patrol the center to see what everyone's up to. #$b#They usually greet me, and we chat a bit if there's time. The day passes like that, and it feels fulfilling. $3",
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Fri.6h": "Why is that red panda called Pumpkin Pie? Well... #$b#It's because his color looks like a pumpkin, and he's so round he almost seems... tasty? $1",
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Sat.6h": "I hear farmers like foraging for food... are they even tasty? They don't seem healthy either. $1",
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Sun.6h": "I enjoy having eggs with milk. It's very nutritious.",
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Mon.8h": "When the Red Panda Bazaar is fully built, I want to stand at the top and take in that magnificent moment.",
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Tue.8h": "Why do I live alone? No comment. $5#$b#Just don't compare me to someone like Lewis, okay? $2",
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Wed.8h": "Why am I the mayor? It's because I've got plenty of experience. What other reason could there be?",
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Thu.8h": "Ahem, @, why are you running straight toward me? I haven't even thought of what to say yet. $1",
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Fri.8h": "Do you know Pam? She used to be my drinking buddy, though it's been ages since we've met. I don't drink much anymore.",
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Sat.8h": "Finally finished all the things I'd been putting off. Tonight, I can finally enjoy a proper game of chess.",
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Sun.8h": "Don't let my age fool you. I've still got it! Back in the day, I was in great shape. $4",
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Mon.10h": "@, you're running around again, aren't you? #$b#It reminds me of my younger days. Those times are long gone. $3",
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Tue.10h": "Thank you so much, @. You're not only a great customer of Red Panda Bazaar but also my friend.",
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Wed.10h": "@, I respect you a lot. Being a farmer takes effort most people can't match, and you're still in the prime of your life.",
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Thu.10h": "Red Panda Bazaar is doing well, but honestly, who wouldn't want to make it even better?",
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Fri.10h": "I wish I had a car. It would make getting around easier, and I could visit Pelican Town too. $3",
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Sat.10h": "Today, I need to meet Six and then Chandler, and after that... $1#$b#Oh, it's you, @. I'm just jotting down my schedule for the next few days. #$b#Sorry, I have to go now.",
    "ShiFuShan.summer.Sun.10h": "Once I finish everything, I can finally rest. @, you should rest too. Don't overwork yourself.",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Mon.0h": "Pumpkin Pie supposedly has a brother named Amber. So, there are other red panda species out there after all.",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Tue.0h": "I noticed something last night. Doesn't the fall moon look bigger and rounder than usual?",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Wed.0h": "Xiao LeiWen is such an adorable penguin. He's brought in a lot of tourists. #$b#By the way, how did he end up at Red Panda Bazaar? $1",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Thu.0h": "You're not very familiar with Red Panda Bazaar yet, are you? Spend more time here, and you'll see what kind of place it is.",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Fri.0h": "Even the kindest person can get angry. As the saying goes, even a Buddha can have a temper. So don't go around annoying people for no reason.",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Sat.0h": "I had a cup of coffee, listened to a song, checked the time... Well, it's time to get to work.",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Sun.0h": "Six might seem a bit eccentric, but deep down, he's a good person.",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Mon.2h": "I usually don't argue with unreasonable people. It's pointless because we see things differently. $2",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Tue.2h": "Fall is the best  season for pumpkins. They're so versatile. #$b#I remember Lewis once sent me a photo of a huge pumpkin he saw during a festival.",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Wed.2h": "I couldn't sleep last night, so I'm a bit tired. I think I'll take a nap later. $3",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Thu.2h": "I'd love to join the festivals in Pelican Town, but traveling that far is exhausting. $4",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Fri.2h": "By the way, Pelican Town looks pretty big, but it doesn't seem like many people live there.",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Sat.2h": "My favorite drink is white wine, followed by hot tea. Occasionally, I'll have some coffee.",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Sun.2h": "This morning, Chandler showed off some machine to me. $2#$b#That old guy even mocked me for not knowing how to use it. So annoying! $5",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Mon.4h": "The ground is covered with fallen leaves. When I have free time, I help clean them up. $3",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Tue.4h": "Do I seem serious all the time? I have to project the authority of a mayor. What if someone causes trouble? $5",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Wed.4h": "Sometimes, I wish I could set aside my role and just be like the other residents in the bazaar. $1",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Thu.4h": "A customer got lost the other day, and Qingfeng was very helpful to them. I'm proud of her.",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Fri.4h": "Lewis is someone I consider a good friend. #$b#He doesn't compare himself to others and has given me great advice. $3",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Sat.4h": "We have an annual market festival here. Make sure to come on time. $3",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Sun.4h": "@, even though you're an important customer, you still need to follow the rules. I treat everyone equally. $2",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Mon.6h": "@, you're really prepared, even carrying a watering can along with your other tools. Fully equipped, huh?",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Tue.6h": "The breeze feels so nice today. It's not too cold or too hot, just perfect. I should get out and walk more.",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Wed.6h": "I spent the whole night sitting at my desk working. My back still hurts. $2",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Thu.6h": "Hmph, don't let this look fool you. I was quite handsome when I was younger. Believe it or not. $2",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Fri.6h": "@, do you really go to bed at 2 AM and wake up at 6? Can four hours of sleep be enough? $4",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Sat.6h": "If I didn't go to bed early, there's no way I could get up at 6 in the morning. $4",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Sun.6h": "Ah, no time to cook today. Should I grab some instant food from Joja? $1",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Mon.8h": "The way young people entertain themselves these days is so strange. Computers and game consoles and all that.",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Tue.8h": "@, do you like music? Do you prefer something calming or rock? #$b#I'm into vintage styles, and if it's on a record player, even better. $3",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Wed.8h": "I received a huge fish this morning. Willie sent it. #$b#How did he know I hadn't had fish from Pelican Town in so long?",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Thu.8h": "@, chatting during free time like this is quite enjoyable.",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Fri.8h": "Chandler gave me some headphones, said they're great for music, but my radio works just fine.",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Sat.8h": "I love both boiled and fried eggs. Add some bread and fresh milk, and that's the perfect breakfast! $4",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Sun.8h": "When I focus on work, the whole day just disappears. Time really flies. $1",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Mon.10h": "Seventeen... eighteen... hey! @, you startled me, and now I forgot what I was counting! $5",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Tue.10h": "I'm usually chill, but I get really competitive when playing chess.",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Wed.10h": "Qingfeng and Xiaoming are such wonderful kids. Sometimes I treat them like my own daughters.",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Thu.10h": "@, so you came all the way from Zuzu City to Pelican Town to take over your grandfather's farm? Impressive. $4",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Fri.10h": "Hmm... I suddenly forgot what I was about to do. Getting old, huh? $5",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Sat.10h": "@, are you done with work? Come have a drink with me.",
    "ShiFuShan.fall.Sun.10h": "I love teasing Xiao Leiwen. If I hold out a little fish, he'll wiggle over in no time.",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Mon.0h": "Winter is here. I need to remind everyone to dress warmly. You too, don't catch a cold.",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Tue.0h": "Winter makes work harder, but it won't stop us. $3",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Wed.0h": "Xiaoming is a lovely girl. Should I introduce her to you as a friend?",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Thu.0h": "I'm quite particular about how fish is prepared. I prefer steaming over braising because it's healthier. $3",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Fri.0h": "I have to say, business these days feels so competitive. $2",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Sat.0h": "I often end up dozing off in my chair by the fireplace. Can't help it, it's just so cozy. $3",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Mon.2h": "Do you know Willy? He's the one who taught me how to fish.",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Tue.2h": "In such cold weather, nothing beats a steaming cup of tea.",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Wed.2h": "Ever since winter began, Pumpkin Pie rarely comes out. Could it be hibernating? $1",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Thu.2h": "I became mayor thanks to everyone's support, not just good luck.",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Fri.2h": "I need to allocate the budget more wisely for development. $2",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Sat.2h": "There was a time when Six almost argued with a customer. Thankfully, it was resolved, but I hope such incidents stay rare. $1",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Mon.4h": "@, as a farmer, you probably don't have crops to tend to in winter, right? That means more time to visit the bazaar. $3",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Tue.4h": "@, does Pelican Town have many events? #$b#Hmm... I should think about hosting more events for our bazaar too. $1",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Wed.4h": "I really enjoy eating chicken, especially chicken breast—it's great for staying fit. $4",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Thu.4h": "@, I heard Pelican Town hosts a Night Market three times a year? #$b#Ah, I'd love to visit it someday. $1",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Fri.4h": "Don't let my appearance fool you. I'm actually a very reasonable person, even if my expression says otherwise.",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Sat.4h": "@, watering the farm every day must be exhausting, right? $4 #$b#Oh, you have sprinklers? Never mind then. $1",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Mon.6h": "Every winter, I have to stop drinking white wine, and it's hard to resist. $1 #$b#But it's fine, a cup of warm milk works just as well.",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Tue.6h": "@, if you can, please recommend going to the Red Panda Bazaar to your friends. I guarantee they'll enjoy their time here.",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Wed.6h": "The scenery at Red Panda Bazaar is truly breathtaking. #$b#Not to boast, but many visitors have praised it. $3",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Thu.6h": "Someone once asked me how I feel about Little Red Panda Bazaar. $4 #$b#Isn't it obvious? It will always be the best in my heart!",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Fri.6h": "I occasionally rest by the bridge. The sea breeze feels incredibly soothing.",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Sat.6h": "What? You raise dairy cows on your farm too? $4 #$b#I'd love to taste the milk from cows you've raised.",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Mon.8h": "There's a difference between tourists and customers. Tourists mostly come for sightseeing, while customers select and purchase items. $5 #$b#But you, of course, are one of our valued patrons.",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Tue.8h": "I think we should be more forgiving toward everyone. After all, everyone makes mistakes, including me. $3",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Wed.8h": "When Qingfeng and Xiaoming first met me, they were too nervous to speak. $2 #$b#I'm not sure when they got comfortable, but now we talk just fine.",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Thu.8h": "I have to say, competition in business is really intense these days. $2",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Fri.8h": "@, are you interested in tea? I really enjoy barley tea. Join me for a cup sometime.",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Sat.8h": "Could you stop staring into my eyes like that? It makes me want to glare back at you.",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Mon.10h": "ZuZu City may be famous, but Red Panda Bazaar is just as great! $4",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Tue.10h": "Spend when needed, save when possible. For the market, I'm willing to give everything. $5",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Wed.10h": "@, traveling all this way in the heavy snow... you're amazing for making the effort.",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Thu.10h": "I make it a habit to sleep early at night. Waking up to clear in the morning is undeniably uplifting. #$b#It's the perfect start to the day.",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Fri.10h": "Many say being a mayor is tough, but all I need to do is fulfill my duties responsibly.",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Sat.10h": "When I'm not watching TV, I listen to the radio. I enjoy vintage music, it brings back so many memories. $3",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Sun.0h": "I have some old friends living in a small town called Pinewood. Isn't there a place there called North Bay? #$b#It's been ages since I heard from them. Should I write them a letter? $4",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Sun.2h": "I don't understand why so many dislike Joja. They've never caused trouble in our market.",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Sun.4h": "Pumpkin Pie is a red panda. Red pandas and lesser pandas are the same thing. Got it? $2",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Sun.6h": "@, do you have chickens on your farm? $4 #$b#I'd love to try eggs from the ones you've raised.",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Sun.8h": "Heh, Lewis wrote me a letter bragging about his performance today, but I've definitely outdone him.",
    "ShiFuShan.winter.Sun.10h": "The drifting snowflakes, what a poetic and serene sight it is.",
    
    "ChenXiaoMing.Introduction": "Oh? Hi there. Is that how I should say it? $17#$e#Wait, you're the new farmer? $21#$b#I've got lots of things you might need. If you have some time, stop by and take a look, okay? $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.danceRejection": "Dance? You should ask Qingfeng. I've seen her dance before, and I think she'd love to. $27",
    "ChenXiaoMing.divorced": "Please, just leave me alone. $5",
    "ChenXiaoMing.breakUp": "Stay away from me. Right now. $8",
    "ChenXiaoMing.DumpsterDiveComment": "That's... an interesting hobby, but I think I'll keep my distance. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.AcceptBouquet": "What's this? Oh, I thought we were just friends. $5#$b#But now you want me to be your girlfriend? Is that it? $11#$b#Alright, fine. So... we're a thing now? $15",
    "ChenXiaoMing.HitBySlingshot": "Hey! Are you serious? Try that again, I dare you. $5",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MovieInvitation": "A movie? I think you might've asked the wrong person. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Spouse.MonstersInHouse": "You want me to handle these monsters? Seriously? $20",
    "ChenXiaoMing.SpouseStardrop": "Oh, what's this? A Stardrop! $19#$b#Wait, you're giving this to me? Just like that? $21",

    "ChenXiaoMing.RejectBouquet.Divorced": "Get out, and take that with you. $5",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.RejectBouquet.NpcAlreadyMarried": "I don't think I'm that kind of person. $5",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.RejectBouquet.VeryLowHearts": "Please put that away. $3",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.RejectBouquet.LowHearts": "I think between us, it's better to let it go. $3",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.RejectGift.Divorced": "Leave! $5",
  
    "ChenXiaoMing.RejectMermaidPendant.PlayerWithSomeoneElse": "Are you insulting me? I'm not that kind of person. $5",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.RejectMermaidPendant.Divorced": "Get lost! $5",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.RejectMermaidPendant.NpcWithSomeoneElse": "Sorry, someone's already done that. $3",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.RejectMermaidPendant.Under8Hearts": "That's not a funny joke. $3",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.RejectMermaidPendant.Under10Hearts": "Wow, @, you're really rushing this, aren't you? $7",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.RejectMermaidPendant.Under10Hearts.AskedAgain": "But, we're just not there yet. $6",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.RejectMermaidPendant.NeedHouseUpgrade": "Your house can't even fit two people. You know what I mean. $13",
  
    "ChenXiaoMing.RejectMovieTicket.AlreadyInvitedBySomeoneElse": "Maybe next time. $3",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.RejectMovieTicket.AlreadyWatchedThisWeek": "I'm not in the mood for a movie right now. $3",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.RejectMovieTicket.Divorced": "Go find someplace else to be. How do you even have the nerve to invite me to a movie? $5",  
  
    "ChenXiaoMing.FlowerDance.Accept_Spouse": "Dance? Seriously? I didn't think you'd enjoy watching me dance. $14",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.FlowerDance.Accept": "I think I... $3#$b#Oh, forget it. Let's dance. $6",  
  
    "ChenXiaoMing.cc.Complete": "Lewis told me you fixed up the community center. $19#$b#Pierre must be over the moon. ",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.cc.Bus": "That drunk driver? Back at work? $21",  
  
    "ChenXiaoMing.GreenRain": "What is this? What's with this weather? $5#$b#Why didn't anyone tell me about this? $5",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.GreenRainFinished": "Yesterday's weather ruined my business. $5#$e#Well, are you buying anything today? $7",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.GreenRain.2": "This weather again? $5",  
  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Resort": "I've decided. I don't want to go home anymore. $19#$b#Just kidding. $22",

    "ChenXiaoMing.Mon.0h": "Ugh, I've never liked Mondays. $3#$b#To me, Mondays feel like... judgment day. $27",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Tue.0h": "What do you grow in Pelican Town, @?#$b#Oh, I'm just curious. Anyway, do you need anything? $19",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Wed.0h": "Oh, hello there, farmer. $26#$b#You're joking right? That's very funny. $27",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Thu.0h": "What? Fine. $3#$b#As if I hadn't already noticed. $26#$e#You think that's funny? $27",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fri.0h": "Lewis actually invited me to grab a drink in your town. $3#$b#I bet Qingfeng's keeping secrets again, she's probably working on a new coffee. $19",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Sat.0h": "I'd rather stay in bed all day today. $3#$b#That's fair, isn't it? $7",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Sun.0h": "What a beautiful day. $25#$b#The only downside is that Qingfeng isn't working, I was hoping for more of her pudding. $24",  

    "ChenXiaoMing.Mon.2h": "Well, look who it is, @ from Pelican Town. $b#Here to shop this early on a Monday? $19#$e#What, Pierre didn't have enough stock for you? $20",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Tue.2h": "You must be really bored, or you wouldn't come chat with me. $7#$e#What? You like the way I talk? $6#$b#You're joking, right? $27",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Wed.2h": "Back in college, I never thought I'd end up here again. $17#$b#Weird, huh? Judging by the look on your face. $16#$e#So, what are you buying today, @? $2",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Thu.2h": "Oh, hi, @. $3#$e#It's nothing, just forgot to brush my hair when I woke up, haha. $26",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fri.2h": "Yep, I'm still alive. $3#$e#You seem surprised, what's with that expression? $27",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Sat.2h": "Why isn't Qingfeng working today? $21#$b#Didn't she say she loves making milk tea? Oh right, it's Saturday.? $21",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Sun.2h": "So, tell me about your time in Zuzu City. I want to hear all about it! $22#$b#Or... are you here just to buy something? $2",

    "ChenXiaoMing.Mon.4h": "How's life been lately? $19#$b#Are you settling into your farm life?#$e#Just asking. Want to buy something? $19",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Tue.4h": "Good morning? $27#$b#@? Oh, I think I just mistook you for someone else. $21",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Wed.4h": "I've been thinking, I've never really been passionate about anything. $17#$b#Have you ever been truly passionate about something? $7",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Thu.4h": "Looking to buy something today? #$b#Or maybe... just here to chat? $19",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fri.4h": "Tell me about your time in Zuzu City. $19#$e#Was it boring?",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Sat.4h": "I feel like taking it easy today. $3#$b#But honestly? It's not like I've been that busy lately. $7",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Sun.4h": "Still busy today? But isn't it Sunday? $19",  

    "ChenXiaoMing.Mon.6h": "I've been thinking about reorganizing the counter soon. $3#$b#What do you think?",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Tue.6h": "Yes, I already washed my face today. $7#$e#Stop staring at me. $3#$e#You're still staring. $7",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Wed.6h": "I think staying in the shop suits me better. $3#$b#Do you work on your farm every single day? $19",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Thu.6h": "I've always wondered why there are so many fireflies at night sometimes. $7",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fri.6h": "It's nothing, forget it. $3#$b#Please don't ask again, okay? $2",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Sat.6h": "I'm still deciding what to eat tonight. #$e#I'm not sure yet. $3",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Sun.6h": "Is it the weekend already? I didn't even notice. $26#$e#But I guess every day feels the same to me. $27",

    "ChenXiaoMing.Mon.8h": "Oh, it's Monday already. $27#$b#No big deal, don't worry about it. $26",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Tue.8h": "Can we maybe want to talk? #$e#Maybe I shouldn't have said that. $26",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Wed.8h": "I've been thinking... maybe I could try drawing sometime? $19#$e#I once tried drawing a cat. $16#$b#It was so bad I couldn't stop laughing. $26",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Thu.8h": "Have you ever tried doing something different when you're not busy? #$e#No? $7",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fri.8h": "I feel like having something nice for dinner tonight. $3#$b#I'm so done with instant noodles. $3",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Sat.8h": "I've been thinking about calling home. $3#$b#But every time I do, I change my mind. $7",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Sun.8h": "Today feels just like yesterday. $3#$b#I guess tomorrow will too. $7",  

    "ChenXiaoMing.Mon.10h": "I made a cup of coffee this morning. $22#$e#Want to try it? I made it for you. [(O)395]",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Tue.10h": "Uh... you're here again. $3#$b#Aren't you busy today? $7",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Wed.10h": "Looking for a discount? $19#$b#I don't think I can help with that. $26",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Thu.10h": "I think I'm starting to enjoy this kind of life. $7#$b#Can I visit your farm sometime?",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fri.10h": "How's your day going? $3#$b#Oh, me? I actually remembered to wash my face today. $7",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Sat.10h": "Oh, I think you gave me a flower once. $19#$b#I almost forgot about it. $22",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.Sun.10h": "I think I can finally take a break today. $22#$b#As long as it doesn't get too crowded. $26",  

    "Chandler.Introduction": "I don't think I've seen you before. Are you from Pelican Town?",  
    "Chandler.Mon.0h": "I think I finally have time to visit my old buddy.",  
    "Chandler.Tue.0h": "Oh, are you a farmer? $1#$b#You must know how to fish, right?",  
    "Chandler.Wed.0h": "Not sure why, but there are always so many fireflies at night. $3",  
    "Chandler.Thu.0h": "Do you grow a lot of crops on your farm?",  
    "Chandler.Fri.0h": "Sorry, I'm a bit busy right now.",  
    "Chandler.Sat.0h": "@? That's your name, right? #$b#Didn't expect people from other towns to visit. $1",  
    "Chandler.Sun.0h": "If I have time, I'd like to visit your town. #$b#Do you have a saloon there too?",  
    /*************  普通对话婚后 Dialogue Spouse*************/
    "Spouse.LiQingFeng.DumpsterDiveComment": "Dear, were you really digging through the trash? $2",
    "Spouse.LiQingFeng.HitBySlingshot": "What's wrong with you? That hurts! $18",
    "Spouse.LiQingFeng.MovieInvitation": "I was hoping you'd ask. Let's go to the movies! $7",
    "Spouse.LiQingFeng.cc.Complete": "You fixed the Community Center? That's amazing, dear! $1#$b#It feels alive again.",
    "Spouse.LiQingFeng.cc.Bus": "You got the bus working? That's wonderful! $3#$b#Now I can visit the Oasis store!",
    "Spouse.LiQingFeng.joja.Begin": "Dear, did you hear? Joja is turning the Community Center into a warehouse. $3#$b#I thought Mayor Lewis wanted to fix it. Guess I was wrong. $18",
    "Spouse.LiQingFeng.movieTheater": "A new movie theater? Really? $1#$b#I can't wait to go, it's so much better than staying home. $17",
    "Spouse.LiQingFeng.GreenRain": "Why is everything green outside, dear? It's so strange. $3#$b#I've never seen anything like it before. $2",
    "Spouse.LiQingFeng.GreenRainFinished": "I'm so glad you stayed with me last night. It made everything easier. $9",
    "Spouse.LiQingFeng.GreenRain.2": "This strange weather again? $3#$b#It's okay. I feel safe with you here. $4",
    "Spouse.LiQingFeng.Resort": "Are you here to relax too, dear? $1#$b#I'm just checking out the food. I hope there's something tasty. $17",
    /*************  NPC婚前2天对话  NPC Engagement Dialogue *************/
    "LiQingFeng.Engagement.1": "Just give me another day or two, okay? Seriously! $11#$b#Ahhh, stop rushing me already! Go, go, shoo! $12",
    "LiQingFeng.Engagement.2": "Oh! What are you doing here, dear? $12#$b#Wha—why so impatient? Geez, you're too much sometimes! $16",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Engagement.1": "Why so rushed? You think planning a wedding is easy? $7#$e#Go back and wait for an update. Hmph. $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Engagement.2": "Is waiting two more days that hard? What's there to be so anxious about? $2#$b#Rushing won't help. $17",
    /*************  婚后对话  MarriageDialogue *************/
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.OneKid.0": "Our baby is so cute, just like you. $17#$e#I can't believe we're parents now. It feels like I just met you yesterday. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.OneKid.1": "I grew up without a mom, and I never thought much about it. $2#$e#But after meeting you, I finally get what it means to be a mom. $3#$e#Oh, wait, no, I mean after %kid1 came along! $7",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.OneKid.2": "Are you planning to hang out with %kid1 today? #$b#If I'm always the one with them, they might forget what you look like! $7",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.OneKid.3": "I... I'm still new to being a mom. I don't really know what I'm doing. $3#$e#It's not my fault! It's my first time being married too. $2",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.OneKid.4": "Shh, keep it down. You'll scare our baby. $17#$e#Do you think %kid1 looks more like you or me? #$b#Obviously, they take after me. Look how cute they are! Haha. $1Li",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.TwoKids.0": "Wow, time really flies. We have two kids now. $3#$e#Hey, do you remember how you found me that night when I almost fell asleep? #$b#Haha, so... do you think I look extra cute today? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.TwoKids.1": "Two kids running around, and I'm completely wiped out. $2#$e#Can you just hug me for a second? I'm so tired I feel like I'm about to collapse. $8",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.TwoKids.2": "Oh, there you are! Got time to hang out with these two rascals today? $17#$b#I know you're busy, but if it's always me, they might forget what you look like... $18",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.TwoKids.3": "Well, well, look who decided to show up! $7#$e#So, what's the plan? Spending time with the kids? #$b#If you're too busy, I'll handle it... again. Ugh... $18",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.TwoKids.4": "Hmm? $9#$e#Oh, nothing. Just stayed up too late last night. $18#$b#Why don't you take care of the kids today? Your wife could use some love. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.Neutral.0": "You're up? $3#$b#How do I look today? Am I pretty? $7#$e#Alright, alright, stop asking so many questions. Go get to work! $17",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.Neutral.1": "So, what's the plan for today? Gonna keep flirting with me? $7#$e#Look at you being all cheeky. I'm already your wife, so teasing you a little is no big deal. $17#$b#Alright, alright, go on. Just make sure to come back early tonight.",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.Neutral.2": "Oh, look who's finally awake. #$b#Got any plans for today? @$1#$e#How about staying home and spoiling your adorable wife? Hmm? $17#$b#Just kidding. Go get busy. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.Neutral.3": "Oh, okay. $3#$e#Take it slow out there, and don't forget to come home early tonight. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.Neutral.4": "How's life with me? Sweet enough for you? $7#$e#Ugh, the way you talk sometimes. You're really something. $18",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.Neutral.5": "Hmm? @? $7#$b#You're the one being childish! And what's wrong with being a little childish anyway? $18#$e#Go on, shoo, get to work. $18",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.Neutral.6": "Ever since I met you, I can't seem to think about anything else. All I want is to be with you every day. $18#$b#So? Aren't you going to come and spoil your wife?",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.Neutral.7": "Have you decided what to do today, @? $17#$b#Alright, alright, go ahead. I've got things covered here at home. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.Neutral.8": "You're awake? My little bunny? $7#$b#What's wrong with calling you my little bunny? You're too much. $18#$e#Now, hurry up and cheer up your wife, silly. $18",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.Neutral.9": "Oh, okay. $3#$b#It's nothing. You just look so... irresistible. $17Li",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.Bad.0": "What's wrong? $9#$b#Oh, fine... $3",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.Bad.1": "Here we go again, huh? $18#$b#You think shooting me with a slingshot is fun, don't you? $18",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.Bad.2": "I'm so annoyed with you. Hmph. $18",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.Bad.3": "Oh, look who it is. Isn't it the brat who loves their slingshot? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.Bad.4": "Oh, it's you. Never mind. $18",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.Bad.5": "I'm starting to think living with you isn't as fun as it used to be. $18",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.Bad.6": "It's nothing. Really, I'm fine. $3",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.Bad.7": "Oh... $3",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.Bad.8": "Haha, is that the best you can do? $18",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.Bad.9": "Alright, fine. $18",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.patio": "Huh? Oh, hey, @! $1#$b#Nothing much, just hanging out. #$e#What, can't I enjoy some fresh air? $18",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.spouseRoom": "Hmm? $3#$e#You startled me again! Couldn't you say something first? #$b#These are things I brought from home. Do they look good here? $17#$e#Before you go... can we... you know? Just for a moment? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.funLeave": "I'm heading to the yard to check for mail, dear. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.funReturn": "Hmm? What is it, dear? $17",

    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.OneKid.0": "",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.OneKid.1": "",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.OneKid.2": "",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.OneKid.3": "",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.OneKid.4": "",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.TwoKids.0": "",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.TwoKids.1": "",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.TwoKids.2": "",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.TwoKids.3": "",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.TwoKids.4": "",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.Neutral.0": "Being with me is pretty fun, right? Go ahead, admit it! $7#$e#Haha. $27",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.Neutral.1": "I never imagined I'd be living on a farm someday. $3#$b#But, honestly, it's not so bad.",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.Neutral.2": "Oh, hey there! #$e#Just messing with you. $22",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.Neutral.3": "Are you busy today? Or just pretending to be?",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.Neutral.4": "It's getting late already. Shouldn't you be heading out to work? $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.Neutral.5": "You've been busy, haven't you? I can tell.",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.Neutral.6": "Something on your mind? Oh, nothing? You're such a tease. $27",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.Neutral.7": "How'd you sleep last night? $27#$b#Honestly, life on your farm isn't quite as magical as I thought it'd be. $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.Neutral.8": "Cooking? Oh, don't count on me for that... I'm hopeless in the kitchen. $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.Neutral.9": "What a great day! Almost as great as you. $22#$b#Alright, off you go. There's work to do.",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.Bad.0": "What's wrong with you? $9#$b#Fine, whatever. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.Bad.1": "Seriously? Again with this? $18#$b#You think shooting me with a slingshot is fun? Grow up. $18",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.Bad.2": "Ugh, I can't deal with you right now. $18",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.Bad.3": "Oh, look who it is, the slingshot champion. Should I be impressed? $17",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.Bad.4": "Oh, it's you. Great. What do you want? $18",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.Bad.5": "I'm starting to wonder if living with you is as fun as I thought it'd be. $18",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.Bad.6": "Nothing's wrong. Really, I'm fine. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.Bad.7": "Wow. Really insightful. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.Bad.8": "That's all you've got? How disappointing. $18",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.Bad.9": "Yeah, okay. Sure. $18",

    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.0": "Ugh, rain again? Someone's gonna end up looking like a soaked chicken. $3#$b#It's kind of funny to imagine, don't you think? $9#$b#And yes, I'm talking about you. Who else would it be? $7#$e#What, you gonna bite me? $12",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.1": "Rainy days, hmm... they're not exactly my favorite. $2#$b#Still, at least you can skip watering the crops today. #$e#Oh, before you go—can I have a little kiss? Please? Just one. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.2": "The soft patter of rain outside feels kind of cozy, doesn't it? $2#$e#Do you have plans for today? Fishing, maybe? $9#$e#Oh, nothing. You just look so... irresistibly adorable. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.3": "There's something so comforting about rainy days, don't you think? $7#$e#I'll probably curl up with a good movie and some music. That's cute, right? #$e#But, can you come home early tonight? Pretty please? $18",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.4": "...$3#$b#Hmm? Did you need something, dear? $9#$e#You're really heading out in this weather? It must be so cold... $17#$e#But it's okay. As long as you're here tonight, I'll feel warm. $11",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day": "It looks like one of those gloomy, rainy days. $2",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.0": "Rainy nights can feel so lonely... until you're here with me. How was your day? #$e#I made some snacks. Don't say no, they're for you. [223] $7#$e#Ready to call it a night? Let's get cozy in bed. $12",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.1": "Well, look who's back, my favorite person in the world! $7#$e#How was your day? Did the rain soak you? #$e#Don't worry, I don't mind at all. I love you just the way you are. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.2": "How was today? Did anything fun happen? $b#I knew you'd come back, I get a little scared when I'm alone on nights like this. $3#$e#But now it's perfect. Just you and me, together. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.3": "I never trusted those grand love stories. They felt so fake... until I met you. $3#$e#Now, everything feels so real and beautiful. I'm so lucky to have you. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.4": "You're home! I thought I might spend another lonely night like I used to. $2#$e#But now, even rainy nights feel warm and full of life because of you. $17#$b#Are you ready? I've missed you so much. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night": "You're finally back! My day feels complete now. $2",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.0": "Good morning, love. Are you hungry? Want me to whip up something for you? [221] $7#$b#You know I wasn't much of a cook before, but I learned because I wanted to take care of you. $18#$e#I might not be the best, but if it's for you, I'll keep trying until it's perfect. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.1": "Awake already? Have you decided what you're doing today? #$e#How about finding something cute, maybe a bunny or two, to pamper your wife? $7#$b#Don't forget before you leave, okay? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.2": "I don't have much here except cookies. [223] $3#$b#How'd you sleep last night? Did you dream about me? Hehe. $17#$e#Oh, before you go, can I steal a quick kiss? Just one. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.3": "Hehe. $15#$e#Oh, it's nothing. You just look so sweet today. $16#$b#Promise me you'll come home early tonight? It feels so empty without you. $11#$e#Oh, and don't forget your things, okay? $12",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.4": "Feeling hungry? I prepared something just for you. [223] #$b#I'm spoiling you, so can you come home a bit earlier tonight? $18#$e#I finally have someone I can rely on, and yet some nights, I still feel so alone without you. $3",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day": "So, tell me... what happened today? I want to hear it all! $7",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.0": "You're finally home! How was your day? Not too tiring, I hope? $7#$b#Good, because being your wife is exhausting... I spent the whole day waiting for you to come back. $17#$e#Ready for bed? Or do you have something else in mind first? $15",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.1": "Look who's back! Let your wife take a good look at you, are you okay? You didn't overwork yourself, did you? $7#$b#I missed you so much today. It felt so lonely without you. $17#$b#But now that you're here, I feel so much better. I always worry when you're gone. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.2": "Oh, if it isn't my favorite person. $7#$e#What? You don't like it when I say that anymore? You used to love it! $7#$b#You look soft and cozy tonight. What? You think I'm the only one who looks like that? $11#$e#Does that mean you're planning to cuddle me all night? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.3": "Hmm? Oh, it's nothing. I was just waiting for you to come home. $9#$e#Are you planning on using your special skills in bed tonight? $4",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.4": "Today was exhausting for me. How about you? $2#$e#Oh, really? So, when are you planning to sleep tonight? $3#$b#You love me that much, huh? Why don't you show me how much tonight? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night": "Are you sure you don't have anything else to do before bed? Or should we just head to bed now? $11",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.0": "It feels so nice to get some fresh air. What's the plan for today? #$e#Hungry? No, no more snacks. Have some tea instead. [614] $3#$b#There, all set. Now off you go, and don't ask too many questions, or you'll regret it tonight. $18",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.1": "This farm is so beautiful. You know, I've never lived on a farm before, but I love it here. $7#$e#When you were in the city, I bet you missed your grandpa's farm, didn't you? Now it's all yours to take care of. #$b#You've done such a wonderful job managing it. Go on, keep at it, and don't let the weeds take over! $7",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.2": "You're finally up, my little bunny. I've been waiting for you. $1#$b#You've made this place look amazing, almost as good as my family's garden. Hehe. $7#$b#Just kidding! With you in charge, I'm sure it'll be even better than my family's place. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.3": "How did you sleep last night? Judging by that smug look on your face, I'd say pretty well. Hmm? $17#$b#Don't forget to come home early tonight. The person who loves you most will be waiting here. $7#$e#Alright, off you go. Don't worry about the house—I've got everything under control. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.4": "Hmm? Oh, you're awake? $3#$e#So, how do I look today? Cute, right? $7#$e#I'm your wife, after all. Is it wrong to want to be a little cute for you? $18#$b#Not going to do something before you leave? Come on, just a little something! $17",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor": "Good morning! $7#$e#Ready to take on the day? #$b#Maybe later we could make something delicious for dinner? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Good.0": "Did you dream about anything last night? $3#$b#I had a dream about some red pandas running around me. Wait, no, it was a whole group of them. $9#$e#It was so weird... They could talk, and one even made milk tea. $3",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Good.1": "Hey, dear, it's just another day with you and me. $7#$b#What's the plan today? You seem excited. Hmm? $17#$b#Alright, just don't forget what I asked for before you go. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Good.2": "You're up? $17#$b#It's nothing, just thinking... $e#Marrying you makes me so happy. Do I really have to say it out loud? Go on, get to work! $4#$b#You're making me blush here. How could you do this? $11",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Good.3": "You look so sleepy, it's adorable. $17#$e#I kind of want to nibble your ear right now, but maybe I'll save it for tonight. $7#$b#Why? Because I love teasing you. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Good.4": "Well, look who's up! $7#$e#You were sleep-talking last night, saying something about how good I smell. $3#$b#Having someone like me? The whole town's jealous. $17#$e#So, are you going to spoil me today, or what? $12",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Good.5": "Got any plans today, dear? $7#$b#I was thinking about trying to make a new drink. What do you think? $17#$e#Maybe sour plum juice? I heard it's popular up north.",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Good.6": "You're still watching BiliBili? $3#$b#Do you have a favorite creator? I know one! $3#$e#Their name's Yucang, and they're hilarious. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Good.7": "Are you awake? You were snoring like a piglet last night. $3#$b#I could barely sleep. Seriously. $8#$e#Ugh, I might need a nap later. $2",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Good.8": "What do you feel like doing today? How about some roleplay? $7#$b#I'll be the mom, and you're the kid. What do you think? $17#$e#Just kidding! You're so easy to tease. $17#$b#Or maybe we could play tag tonight? Hmm? $12",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.MarriageDialogue.Good.9": "Hey, bunny, you're awake! $3#$b#What? You don't like being called bunny? So picky! $7#$e#I don't care. I love you more than anything. Like, so, so, so much. $17#$e#So much it's ridiculous. Hehe. $15",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.spring.1": "Wow, look outside! Spring is back. $17#$b#What are you planning to plant this year? $e#Go on, don't just stick around here all day. Shoo, shoo! $18",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.spring.7": "How's your week going? Isn't life amazing now that you have me? $7#$b#What? What's wrong with spoiling your wife a little? Honestly. $18#$e#Ugh, just go get to work already. Shoo! $17",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.spring.8": "It's a fresh start to the week! $1#$b#Got any plans? Care to share them with me? $e#You seem pretty excited, ready to take on the day, dear? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.spring.12": "The Egg Festival is almost here again. Can you believe how fast the year has gone? $18#$b#Every day with you just flies by. I feel like I've been snacking too much lately. $8#$b#Are you planning to get more strawberry seeds this year? I think Pierre also has those bunny plushies. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.spring.13": "Are you hunting for eggs again this year? With the kids? $b#Is that game really that fun? Honestly, I think Lewis came up with the most boring event ever. $18",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.spring.15": "Are the salmonberries ripe again today? Time really flies. $3#$b#I just remembered how the ones in our yard always end up all over the ground. Such a mess to clean up. $2#$e#Alright, go take care of it, but don't forget the thing I asked for. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.spring.16": "Guess what day it is today? I hope you didn't forget. $7#$b#It's not your birthday, but I still got you a gift, dear. [279] $1#$e#So? Is it good? Do you like it? $18",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.spring.18": "With a wife like me, even the stars would throw up their hands. $7#$b#Huh? Nothing, nothing at all. $15#$e#Don't ask so many questions, go get to work already! $11",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.spring.23": "The Flower Dance is tomorrow already? This year went by so fast. $b#Wait, what day is it today? Monday? $17#$e#Ugh, stop messing with me. It's clearly Wednesday! $18#$e#If I say it's Wednesday, then it's Wednesday. Hmph. $18",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.spring.24": "I don't like dancing, stop asking. $18#$b#I can't dance, okay? And you better not dance with anyone else but me. $17#$e#If you keep this up, I'll get jealous. Watch out tonight... I'll deal with you. $11",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.spring.28": "Is it summer already tomorrow? Time flies, doesn't it, dear? $7#$b#What are you planting this summer? Hops or starfruit? $e#Alright, alright. Go get ready. I'll be waiting for you tonight. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.patio": "What's up? $9#$b#Oh, nothing. I just felt like hanging out outside. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.spouseRoom": "It's so hot, and you're still going to work? $17#$b#It's fine. As long as I have you, I'm happy. $b#Can we... you know, maybe? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.funLeave": "I'm heading to the yard to check for mail, dear. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.funReturn": "Hmm? What is it, dear? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.0": "Looks like it's raining again. Finally, it feels cooler. $17#$b#What's your plan for today? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.1": "Looks like you don't have to water the fields in this heat. $17#$b#Am I right? $17#$e#Alright, alright, go get busy. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.2": "W-what is it? $4#$b#N-nothing! Go work, don't ask! $11",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.3": "What's your plan for today? The rain's really coming down. $17#$e#At least I don't have to water the fields, seriously. $18",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.4": "Listen, do you hear that? $17#$b#Drip, drop... It's the rain. $1#$e#Alright, alright, go on and get to work. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day": "Finally, it's a little cooler today. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.0": "How was your day? You didn't catch a cold, did you? $3#$b#Good, that's a relief. It looks so chilly out there. $1#$e#Want me to make you something to eat? [224] $12",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.1": "Hey, you. $7#$e#Did you get caught in the rain? Are you wet? $1#$e#Why would I mind? Don't be silly. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.2": "How was your day? Was it fun? $b#I knew you'd come back. I get so scared at night alone. $3#$e#Relax. Tonight it's just us, together forever, and tomorrow too. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.3": "I never believed in those love stories. They're just made-up movie stuff. $3#$e#But after I met you, I realized... $b#Everything's so beautiful. I'm so lucky. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.4": "You're finally back. I thought I'd be spending another night alone like before. $2#$e#Since I met you, even the loneliest rainy nights don't scare me. I know you'll always be here until the rain clears. $17#$b#Are you ready? I can't wait another second. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night": "What time are you planning to sleep tonight? $17#$b#Hmm? $9#$b#Oh, you look a little tired. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.0": "How did you sleep last night? You look so pleased with yourself. $7#$b#Do you want something to eat? It's so hot today, I feel like I'm melting. [237]$17#$e#Alright, alright, finish up and get to work. Don't get heatstroke, okay? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.1": "It was so hot last night. Why do you smell kind of sticky? $3#$e#What smell? You know, that sticky kind of smell. $4#$b#Alright, alright, get to work now. $11",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.2": "What's the plan for today? #$b#Do you want something to drink? Maybe some green tea? [614]$17#$e#Can I kiss you? Just a quick one, okay? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.3": "Everything feels so sticky today, seriously. $2#$e#And you too, you're all sticky. $3#$b#But I'm your wife, so how could I ever mind? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.4": "Can you come home early tonight? I get so worried when you're out late. $2#$b#Alright, but you have to promise me, okay? $3",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day": "It looks so hot outside. $18#$b#Are you still going out? $3",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.0": "Finally, you're back! $1#$b#What time are you planning to sleep tonight? $7#$e#Alright then. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.1": "Was it hot outside? $17#$b#Okay, are you ready for bed? ",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.2": "You didn't get too hot, right? It really seemed scorching today. $1#$e#Good, as long as you're fine. Want some ice cream? [233]$7",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.3": "Hmm? $9#$b#Hehe. $17#$b#Nothing, really, nothing at all. $11",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.4": "Have you decided when you're going to bed? $1#$e#Okay, fine, I'll follow your lead then. $3#$b#What? Stop asking, seriously. $11",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night": "Is it bedtime now? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.0": "It's so hot out here, seriously. $11#$e#If I'd known, I wouldn't have come out today. $12",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.1": "Oh, you're awake? $7#$e#It's nothing. I just wanted to come out and take a look. $17#$b#I never thought I'd live on a farm, but now it feels really nice. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.2": "It's so hot today, and you're still heading out? $17#$b#Alright then, hehe. $1#$e#Me? I don't have to work, you know. $18",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.3": "Make sure you come home early tonight, okay? $17#$b#Alright, I'll wait for you at home. $e#Okay, okay, off you go now. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.4": "Want a cookie? I've got one saved just for you. [223]$7#$e#Of course, I saved it on purpose, obviously. $17#$b#Alright, alright, don't forget to come back early. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor": "It's so hot out here. $2#$b#I think I'll head back inside soon. $7#$b#Anything you want to do before I go? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Good.0": "What is it? $3#$e#Alright then. $17#$b#It's so hot outside. Don't forget to stay hydrated, okay? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Good.1": "Weren't you heading out? $17#$e#Alright, just make sure to come back early. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Good.2": "Oh, you're up? $17#$b#It's nothing, really... um... $e#I'm so happy to be married to you, okay? Why do I have to say it out loud? Go on, get to work. $4#$b#You're making me so embarrassed. How could you do this? $11",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Good.3": "It's so hot today. Are you heading out again? $2#$e#Alright, fine. It's nothing, really. $11#$b#Seriously, stop asking. $12",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Good.4": "Hmm? $3#$b#Didn't you already leave? $3#$e#How do I look today? Am I pretty or what? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Good.5": "Do you have any plans today, my little bunny? $7#$e#Want something to drink? Maybe a glass of milk? [184]$17#$b#Of course it's leftover, silly. $11",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Good.6": "Hmm, okay then. $17#$b#It's nothing, I was just thinking about spending time with you. $7#$e#Of course it's fun. It's my favorite thing to do. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Good.7": "Aren't you ready yet? $9#$b#Come on, everyone's waiting for you. $17#$e#Hurry up, stop hanging around me all the time! $17",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Good.8": "N-no, it's nothing, really! $11#$e#Oh, stop it, really... $12",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.MarriageDialogue.Good.9": "Oh, you're here again? $17#$b#What's wrong? Don't be so petty, getting upset over nothing. $7#$e#I don't care, I'm your wife! $17",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.summer.1": "I don't really like summer. Everything's so sticky. $3#$b#Do you smell good? Let me sniff you. $12#$b#Oh, stop it! What's wrong with smelling you, honestly! $11",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.summer.8": "Isn't it someone's birthday today? I don't think I'm wrong. $17#$b#Yeah, I'm not a dummy. You're the dummy! $7#$e#Go on, little bunny, get to work already. It's too hot to be sticking to me like this. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.summer.10": "Is that guy coming again this year? The one who freeloads every time. $3#$b#I'm not a freeloader, so don't even ask. $11#$b#Hurry up and prepare the ingredients for tomorrow's feast, or I might just eat you for dinner instead. $12",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.summer.11": "Got all the ingredients ready for the feast, my little bunny? $7#$b#Me? I can only make milk tea and cookies. $3#$e#Do you think adding cookies to the soup would taste good? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.summer.15": "It's so hot. Are you still heading out to work today? $2#$b#Do you want some ice cream before you go? [233]$17",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.summer.26": "This summer's almost over. Finally! $7#$e#Bugs everywhere, everything's sticky. How could anyone like summer? $18#$e#Hey, you smell kinda funny. Did you even shower? $3",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.summer.28": "Want to go to the beach tonight to see the jellyfish? $7#$b#I'll go too. As long as I'm with you, I'll go anywhere. $7#$b#Don't forget your romantic magic before we leave, hehe. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.patio": "The leaves are turning all yellow. $17#$b#It feels like the season is painting the world, don't you think? $17#$b#Oh, by the way, do you think I look pretty today? $7#$e#Alright then, just wondering. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.spouseRoom": "What is it? You're here again? $3#$b#Fine, are you going out today? $17#$e#Just don't come home too late. I'll wait for you. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.funLeave": "I'm going home for a visit today, alright? $1",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.funReturn": "Hmm? What is it, dear? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.0": "Is it raining again? $17#$b#Be careful out there, okay? $7#$e#This weather always makes such a mess in the yard. Honestly. $2",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.1": "Oh, look, it's raining. $1#$b#What's the plan today? $7#$e#Alright, just come back early. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.2": "The rain makes it feel colder and colder. $2#$e#Do you want something warm to drink? $7#$e#What about my reward then? $11",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.3": "It's raining again. Wait, it's raining again? $3#$b#So, does that mean you're staying home today? $1#$e#I'm kidding. If you don't work, what are we going to eat? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.4": "The rain just keeps dripping outside. $3#$b#Do you know what you're going to do today? $1#$e#Don't come home too late, alright? It's too cold for me to wait alone. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day": "It's raining again, isn't it, dear? $1#$e#I really thought today would be sunny. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.0": "You're finally back. I've been waiting for so long. $1#$b#Are you ready? If you're ready, then... $7#$e#Why do I have to say it out loud? Honestly. $11",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.1": "You didn't get wet, did you, dear? $17#$e#Good. Now, come to bed. $1#$e#Why? Do I really have to explain? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.2": "You didn't get wet, right? You don't look great. $3#$b#Good, I knew you wouldn't leave me all alone. $1#$e#Hurry up and come to bed. I've been waiting for you. $11",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.3": "Who are you? Why are you in my house? $3#$e#I'm your wife? You can't fool me. How could I be your wife? $17#$b#What's wrong? Did I scare you? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.4": "You're back. I'm glad to see you home. $1#$b#So, have you decided what we're doing tonight? Maybe... $17#$b#That game we talked about? $11#$e#I'm joking, hehe. Now, go to sleep. $12",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night": "Are you ready for bed, dear? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.0": "Are you awake? The weather's getting colder and colder outside. $17#$b#Hurry and make the most of it before winter comes. I'll just be here waiting for you. $7#$e#Before you go... hmm? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.1": "Have you decided what you'll do today? $7#$b#Really? Are you sure? $11#$e#Alright then, go on. Just come back early, okay? $1",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.2": "Do you want some cookies? $7#$b#Alright, but don't forget to come back early. I'll just be waiting here. $17#$e#Another kiss? Honestly. $11",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.3": "Look, something tasty! $1#$e#Where's the tasty thing? Aren't you the tasty one? $17#$b#You know I love snacks. $11#$e#Alright, just come back early, okay? $12",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.4": "Off to work again? $1#$b#Fine, fine, go on. $17#$e#Why are you staring at me? Just go already! $11",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day": "No... it's nothing. $11#$b#You just mumbled some nonsense in your sleep last night, that's all. Now go, shoo, shoo. $12",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.0": "Well, look who's back. $1#$b#How was your day? Wasn't it so much better with me around? $17#$e#Alright, alright. Go get some sleep. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.1": "Everything outside looks so withered and lifeless. $18#$b#And you? Are you ready? $1#$b#Or are you planning to do something before bed? $11",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.2": "You're back. It was hard waiting for you all alone. $17#$b#Go get ready. I'm heading to bed soon. $1#$e#Go on, why are you still standing here? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.3": "Look who finally showed up. $7#$e#It's nothing. I was just waiting for you to come back. Why? $17#$b#As long as you're okay, that's all that matters. Same here, tonight with you. $4",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.4": "Everything outside looks so scary, all yellow and red. $3#$b#But with you here tonight, what's there to be afraid of? $1#$e#Or maybe... should I be more worried about you tonight? $11",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night": "Why are you back so late again? $2",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.0": "The atmosphere outside... it changed, hasn't it? $3#$e#Oh, you're awake, dear? $1#$b#Alright then, off to work you go. Stop clinging to me all the time. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.1": "I really love it here. Because you're here. $1#$e#Of course, you've got work to do today too. $1#$b#Go on, don't worry. I'll take care of things at home. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.2": "It's so beautiful out here, especially in the fall. $1#$b#But compared to our little yard? It's not quite there yet. $7#$e#Alright, alright. Off you go already. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.3": "Have you figured out what you're doing today? $17#$b#Alright, but make sure you come home early tonight. I don't want to be alone here after dark. $18#$e#What? Stop staring and just go. $11",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.4": "Don't I look extra pretty today? $7#$e#Cute or not, I'm still your wife, hmph. $11#$b#Go, go, go. You're just here to tease me, aren't you? $11",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor": "Good Morning! $1#$b#Looks like there are a lot of leaves outside today. $17#$b#Think you could sweep it up a bit when you have time? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Good.0": "Weren't you heading out? At this hour? $3#$e#Alright, just don't catch a cold. It's getting colder. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Good.1": "What's wrong? $1#$e#If it's nothing, then go get busy. Don't mind me.",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Good.2": "Fall feels pretty nice... aside from all the falling leaves. $17#$b#But it's lovely, don't you think? My love. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Good.3": "I'm starving. $3#$e#Are you delicious? Maybe I should take a bite? $11#$e#What? You sneak a taste of me all the time! $12",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Good.4": "You're here again, dear? $11#$e#No, nothing! Get to work already. You're so annoying sometimes. $12#$e#Go on, seriously! You're too much. $11",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Good.5": "Hey, bunny? $17#$b#My little bunny? $7#$e#Just teasing you! Are you not busy today? $1#$e#Alright, then. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Good.6": "A Junimo? What's that? $3#$b#A tiny apple-like spirit? Really? $17#$e#Like... the doll in my room? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Good.7": "Why aren't you working yet? Honestly! $18#$e#Go, go, go! $2",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Good.8": "Do you have a favorite band, dear? $17#$e#Wait, did I already ask you that? $3#$b#I've got such a terrible memory. Really! $17",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.MarriageDialogue.Good.9": "It's getting colder and colder, isn't it? $17#$b#Soon enough, everything outside will be covered in white. $7#$e#Alright, alright, go get ready. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.fall.1": "Is it fall already? Look outside! $17#$b#If I could, I'd lie on the grass all day. $7#$e#Oh, right, you should get ready for the fall crops. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.fall.8": "What is it? $17#$b#It's getting colder. Have you thought about what to prepare for winter? $7#$e#Alright then, go on and get to it. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.fall.15": "You've got something ready for the showcase, right? $7#$b#I hope you won't let me down, okay? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.fall.16": "As the best wife ever, guess what's for breakfast today? [201] $7#$b#Hurry and get everything ready. Don't disappoint me! $1",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.fall.19": "Isn't Robin's birthday coming up in a few days? Wonder if she's still busy that day. $17#$b#Me? I'm not going to Pierre's to work out. I'm still young! $18#$e#Go, go! You're saying I'm fat? If I gain a little weight, will you stop liking me? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.fall.22": "It's the last week of fall. What's the plan? $7#$b#Me? I'd rather stay home and sip bubble tea. $18#$e#What's wrong with bubble tea? Ugh, you're the big pig here. $18",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.fall.26": "Have you decided what to eat tomorrow night? $17#$b#Wait, no... what to do for fun? $7#$e#Liking food isn't a crime, okay? Seriously. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.fall.27": "There's going to be so much good food in town tonight! $1#$b#I can't wait. $7#$e#Alright, alright, get back to work. See you tonight. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.fall.28": "I'm so sleepy right now. Stayed up way too late yesterday. $2#$e#Go do your thing. $8#$e#What? I'm this tired, and you still want kisses? $11",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.patio": "Is it really this cold outside? $3#$e#What's wrong? $17#$b#Alright, go on to work. I'll wait for you at home. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.spouseRoom": "Even in this cold, the house still needs tidying. $1#$b#What is it? Have you figured out what to do today? $7#$e#Seriously? You still want that? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.funLeave": "The house feels like it's freezing. I think I'll go back home to check on it today. $3#$b#Don't worry, I'll be back early. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.funReturn": "Hmm? What is it, dear? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.0": "Isn't this strange? Why is it raining in winter? $3",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.1": "Rain? In winter? $3",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.2": "What's going on? How can it rain on such a cold day? $3#$e#Do you know why this is happening? $2",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.3": "How can it rain on such a cold day? $2",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.4": "Something's odd with the weather today. Why is it raining in winter? $3",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day": "It's raining in winter? $3",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.0": "This is so strange. It rained all day today. $3#$e#Are you alright? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.1": "It rained all day today. $2",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.2": "Rain? In winter? And it lasted all day? $2",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.3": "This rain is so strange. Why isn't it snowing instead? $3",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.4": "Are you cold? This rain feels so weird. $2",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night": "I know this is your doing! $7#$b#What? Isn't it your fault that it rained all day? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.0": "It's so cold today! Do you want something to eat? [231] $7#$b#Oh, you want more? Well then, off to work with you! $17#$e#Alright, alright. Go on now, and stop clinging to me. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.1": "Have you decided what you're doing today, my little bunny? $7#$e#Oh no, don't drag me into it. That's your thing. $17#$b#Just don't let me down, okay? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.2": "It really looks freezing outside. $7#$b#Did you dress warmly enough before heading out? $2#$e#Don't catch a cold, alright? You know how messy it gets when you're sick. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.3": "What's wrong, dear? $17#$b#Oh, nothing? That's good. I thought something happened again. $1#$e#Promise me you'll be back early tonight, okay? You know I get scared being alone. $18#$e#Alright, deal? With a kiss? $11",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.4": "Want something to drink? Maybe some milk? [184] $17#$b#When you're done, make sure to come back early, okay? Please? $7#$e#Fine, fine. Go work already, and stop clinging to me. $11",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day": "Even on such a cold day, you're heading out to work? $2",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.0": "Look who's finally home, my dear! $1#$b#How was your day? You didn't freeze out there, did you? $17#$e#Good, as long as you're fine. So, what's next on your list? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.1": "You're back! It was so cold out there... You didn't freeze, did you? $3#$b#Alright, it's freezing tonight. Want to eat something warm? [223] $17#$e#Okay, okay, let's get to bed. It's freezing here too. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.2": "What's wrong, dear? You're at it again, aren't you? $11#$b#Aw, come on... still clinging to me this late? $12#$e#Fine, fine. Let's talk about it in bed, seriously. $15",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.3": "What's up with you now? $7#$e#Alright, fine. Just go to sleep already. $17#$e#Go on! Stop clinging to me all the time. $18",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.4": "It's really chilly tonight. $2#$e#Are you cold, dear? Hmm? $3#$b#How about I warm you up a bit later? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night": "Ready to hop into bed and warm up? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.0": "Has it really gotten this cold outside? $3#$b#On such a chilly day, you're still going out to work, dear? $1#$e#Alright then, just make sure to come back early tonight, okay? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.1": "You know, I actually kind of like winter. Look at how beautiful everything looks out here. $17#$b#At least it's cooler than summer, right, dear? $7#$e#Stay warm though, and don't catch a cold. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.2": "Getting some fresh air out here feels so nice. $1#$b#So, have you decided what you're going to do today, dear? $7#$e#Maybe? Visiting some animals again? That sounds fun to me. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.3": "Oh, you're finally up. I came out here to get some fresh air. $1#$b#Alright, alright. Go get to work already and stop clinging to me. $18",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.4": "It's so cold out here; I think I'll head back inside soon. $2#$e#Alright, dear, just don't forget to come home early. $8",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor": "Wow, look at all that snow! $3#$b#I didn't think it'd still be this cold outside. $2",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Good.0": "The snow outside looks so white and pretty, doesn't it? But don't catch a cold, dear. $17#$e#Alright then, I'll wait for you at home. $1#$e#Okay, okay, just go already. You're at it again, seriously! $17",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Good.1": "I had the strangest dream last night, dear. $2#$b#What was it about? Well... $3#$e#I dreamed we were standing on a mountain, and you were saying all sorts of weird things. $2",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Good.2": "Would you like a cookie? I saved some from yesterday. [223] $9#$e#Too hard? Too hard, you say? $3#$b#Alright, I admit it, I messed up again. $2",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Good.3": "I still like winter a lot. At least there are no bugs around. $1#$b#What about you, dear? $7#$e#By the way, are you sure you're not forgetting to do something before you leave? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Good.4": "Horoscopes? Are you talking about... $17#$b#The ones in the sky? Constellations? $3#$e#I don't really understand all that horoscope stuff. Are you teasing me? $18#$e#Well, tease all you want. I'm still your wife. Deal with it! $11",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Good.5": "Once, there was this blonde guy who tried to win me over before you came to the valley. $3#$e#But I turned him down immediately, he was way too childish. $17#$b#Besides, I knew someone better was waiting for me. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Good.6": "What's up with you? Why do you keep coming back to check on me? $17#$e#Ugh, just go to work already, or we'll run out of money for the house! $11#$b#Go on, stop sticking to me all the time. $11",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Good.7": "Winter means no crops to plant, right? Dear? $7#$b#But you should still find something to do, how about making bubble tea? $17#$e#Oh, I guess that's more my thing. Never mind! $3",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Good.8": "What is it, my little bunny? $7#$b#What's wrong with calling you my little bunny? You're adorable, aren't you? $17#$e#You're not? Then does that make me the cute one? $7#$b#Hmm? Alright, alright, just make sure to come back early tonight. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.MarriageDialogue.Good.9": "Hmph. $11#$e#What's wrong? You already know, don't you? $12",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.winter.1": "Is winter here again? I was so groggy when I woke up this morning. $8#$b#You're probably not as busy in winter, right, dear? $2#$e#How about I help you stay warm tonight? Just a thought. $11",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.winter.7": "I'm not a fan of the Ice Festival, just a bunch of older folks fishing out there. $2#$b#If you want to go, that's fine, but I'd rather stay home. It's too cold for me. $3",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.winter.8": "Go ahead without me. I just feel like staying home today. $2#$b#I think I might take another nap later. You have fun out there. $8#$e#Oh, alright then, take care and walk safely. $2",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.winter.11": "Are you feeling cold? Want me to help warm you up? Hehe. $12#$b#Tonight, huh? Oh, alright, then tonight it is. $11#$e#Before you go, can I steal a kiss? Please? Pretty please? $15",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.winter.24": "Have you prepared tomorrow's gifts yet, dear? $7#$b#Me? I'd love to get something delicious. $1#$e#What's wrong with wanting tasty things? Honestly. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.winter.25": "Are you ready? The town is full of delicious food waiting for us today! $7#$e#Hurry, hurry! I can hardly wait! $1",
    "LiQingFeng.MarriageDialogue.winter.28": "On the last day of the year, why don't you grant me one little wish? Hmm? $17#$e#Tonight? Fine, fine, tonight it is. $11#$b#Just one thing, really! You're so mean sometimes. $12",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.patio": "It feels so nice to step outside and get some fresh air. $1#$b#But don't forget to come back early tonight, alright? $7#$e#Alright, go on and get to work now. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.spouseRoom": "Dear, I suddenly feel like this spot looks a bit... plain. $2#$b#What do you think? $3#$e#Honestly, there's not much I could've brought from home, as you know. $17#$e#Alright, before you go, aren't you forgetting something? $1",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.funLeave": "Spring has arrived... I need to go check on the yard at home. $1#$b#Of course, you're welcome to join me, dear. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.funReturn": "Hmm? What is it, dear? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.0": "Hear that outside? What do you think it is? $7#$b#It's rain, you silly! $1#$e#Hey, I'm not the silly one. I'm super smart, remember? $17#$e#Anyway, don't you have stuff to do? Even if it's raining. Go, go! $1",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.1": "Rainy day, huh? $3#$b#It's kinda nice though. Perfect for staying in and napping. $17#$e#Obviously, I mean me napping! What did you think I meant? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.2": "Rain like this always makes everything feel cooler outside. $1#$e#Make sure you come home early tonight, okay? It's quiet here without you. $2#$e#Oh, wait! Are you sure there's nothing else you need to do before you go? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.3": "The weather looks pretty gloomy today. $3#$b#Are you still heading out? $7#$e#Make sure you dress warm. Don't catch a cold, okay? $1",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.4": "Spring rain always comes right on time. $1#$b#What's your plan for today? $7#$e#Oh, I know! How about making some snacks? $17#$e#Wait, you thought I meant you? Nope, I'm talking about me! Now go do your thing. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day": "The weather today? $17#$b#Kinda gloomy, huh? $3",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.0": "What do you think? Is the rain heavy outside? $17#$e#Me? Hmm... $3#$b#I think being here with you tonight is way better. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.1": "It's been raining all day. I hope it clears up tomorrow. $2#$e#Anyway, how was your day? $3#$b#Ready for bed, dear? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.2": "How was your day? Good, right? I bet it was! $3#$b#So, are we having a little midnight snack? [221 224 231] $3#$e#Spending the night together? Of course! Why wouldn't we? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.3": "Still raining? I thought it'd stop by now. $3#$b#Hey, don't you wanna do something fun before bed? $7#$e#What kind of fun? Oh, you know exactly what I mean. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.4": "Look who finally came back! It's so late! $7#$b#I thought I'd spend another night alone, but here you are. $17#$e#Alright, ready for bed? Let's go. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night": "Are you ready for bed, dear? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.0": "Guess what's on the menu this morning? [221 194 231 197] $17#$b#Does it taste good? #$e#Really? That's awesome. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.1": "Being with you means I have to wake up early now. $2#$e#Ugh, don't tease me like that. You're the worst. $11#$b#Go get to work already, and stop sneaking kisses! $12",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.2": "I had a yard before, but it wasn't great for growing crops. $2#$b#Your place, though? It's perfect for that! $17#$e#Go get busy, and don't forget to come home early tonight. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.3": "It's just another day with you and me. $7#$b#People say marriage is the end of love, but I don't think so. $17#$b#To me, it's a new beginning. Our beginning. $7#$e#So? You get what I'm saying, right? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.4": "The weather looks so nice today, doesn't it? The sunlight's even shining into the house. $17#$b#Of course, that probably means it's going to get hotter later. $1#$e#Alright, time to get ready. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day": "Heading out again today? $17#$b#Alright then.",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.0": "Why are you so late? I was starting to worry! $2#$b#Ugh, seriously, who stresses out their wife like this? $18#$e#Hey, stop clinging to me already! $18",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.1": "Oh? You're back? $2#$b#It's nothing, just a tiring day, that's all. $8#$e#You go ahead and get to bed. I'll join you in a bit, okay? $2",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.2": "Well, well, look who's home! My little bunny? $7#$b#Is it you, my little bunny? $17#$e#No? Then who are you? $3#$b#Hmm? $9#$b#You're totally my bunny! Did I get you with that? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.3": "So, what do you feel like eating tonight? Got anything in mind? $17#$b#How about some cookies? I just baked some today. [223] $1#$e#Good, right? I haven't even tried them yet. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.4": "How was your day? Anything interesting happen? $7#$e#I was just curious, dont mind me. $17#$b#Tonight? Oh, are we starting again? You serious? $11",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night": "Not planning to do something fun before bed? $11",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.0": "Wow, I didn't realize how much things had changed out here. $17#$e#This yard... $3#$b#It looks a little different from what I imagined, but it's still really nice. $1",  
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.1": "I really like it here. It's way better than I expected. $1#$b#Do you want to know why? $7#$b#Of course, it's because I'm here with you, silly. $17",  
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.2": "The way you've taken care of things outside, it's just... $18#$b#Huh? $3#$b#I thought you didn't hear me. $7#$e#Yes, I said it. So what? What are you gonna do, bite me? $12",  
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.3": "How did you sleep last night? Getting some fresh air feels really nice. $17#$b#Alright then, just make sure to come back early tonight, okay? I'll be scared if I'm alone without you. $1#$e#Alright, alright, go do your thing. $1",  
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.4": "Do you think I look cute today? $7#$e#Come on, say it, silly. $18#$e#Say it, or I'll have to punish you. $17#$b#What's wrong with being a little cute? Don't you like it? $18#$e#Fine, go back to work then. Seriously, hmph. $18",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor": "Alright, alright, get to work already! $12#$e#Go on, hurry up. $11",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.0": "You? Weren't you out already? Don't you know how late it is? $3#$e#Alright, go get to work then. $3",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.1": "I really love the feeling of spring. $1#$b#What do you think? Don't you agree?",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.2": "Why do you smell... $3#$e#so nice? $12#$e#What? Don't you think so? $11",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.3": "Still sleepy, are you? $2#$e#Alright then, I guess I am too. $8",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.4": "Married life is nice. $17#$b#But it's not quite... as exciting as I imagined. $18#$e#Before you go, aren't you planning to do anything else? $11",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.5": "I think I'll dig out those old albums today. $9#$b#And? Just wait for you to come home?",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.6": "Weren't you out working already? $3#$e#It's fine. Taking a break at home is pretty nice too. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.7": "Did you sleep well last night? You look so smug. $17#$b#Me? Same as usual. $1#$e#So, don't forget to come back early tonight.",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.8": "Hey, wanna... do that? $7#$e#What are you thinking? I meant washing the dishes tonight. $1#$e#What did you think I meant? $11#$b#Oh, I see... you're so cheeky. $12",
    "LiQingFeng.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.9": "Are the flowers outside blooming already? $17#$b#Could you bring back some daffodils? $1#$e#You know what I like most, don't you? My little bunny. $7#$e#Alright, alright, see you tonight then. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.2.MarriageDialogue.spring.1": "Everything outside looks... $17#$b#so green! $18#$e#Does that mean... spring is here! $1",
    "LiQingFeng.2.MarriageDialogue.spring.7": "Do you want some milk tea? $7#$b#Of course, I made it myself! $17#$b#Is it good? If it is, then get back to work. Go on, go on! $1",
    "LiQingFeng.2.MarriageDialogue.spring.8": "What fun things did you do last week? $1#$b#Come on, tell me. It's been so boring lately. $7#$e#Alright then, doesn't sound as exciting as I thought. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.2.MarriageDialogue.spring.12": "Tomorrow is the Egg Festival? $3#$b#Does that mean... lots of yummy food? $1#$e#Alright, alright, just kidding. Go on and get busy. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.2.MarriageDialogue.spring.13": "Still looking for eggs? $3#$b#You're more boring than I thought if you enjoy playing with kids! $18",
    "LiQingFeng.2.MarriageDialogue.spring.15": "Spring is already halfway over. Can you believe it? $1#$b#Just thinking about all the time we've spent together makes me so happy. $17#$e#Don't you feel so too, dear? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.2.MarriageDialogue.spring.16": "Isn't today someone's birthday? $11#$b#Whose? Do I really need to say it? $12#$e#Oh, you want a gift? Nice try! It's my birthday! But I guess I can give you something too, so here, take this. [279] $11",
    "LiQingFeng.2.MarriageDialogue.spring.18": "Who am I? Your wife? $18#$b#Of course I am, silly! Just messing with you. $7#$e#Alright, alright, stop teasing me and get to work. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.2.MarriageDialogue.spring.23": "Tomorrow means lots of good food again! $1#$b#And? $3#$b#And lots of tasty drinks too! $1#$e#What else? Did you really think we'd have to dance together? $11#$b#But... it's not so bad if it's with you. $12",
    "LiQingFeng.2.MarriageDialogue.spring.24": "Dancing? $3#$b#You know I'm just going to flail around awkwardly. $11#$e#So why ask? Alright, fine, if it's with you, making a fool of myself isn't so bad. $12",
    "LiQingFeng.2.MarriageDialogue.spring.28": "Time flies, doesn't it? Summer's almost here. $17#$b#Of course, that also means those annoying bugs will be back. Ugh. $2#$e#So... see you later tonight? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.patio": "Heading out today, dear? $1#$b#Stay hydrated out there, okay? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.spouseRoom": "If I'd known, I wouldn't have brought so much stuff when I moved here. $18#$e#Hmm? $3#$b#Oh, you're awake? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.funLeave": "How about grabbing an ice cream on the way today? $17#$b#What do you think, dear?",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.funReturn": "Hmm? What is it, dear? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.0": "It's raining again today. Ugh. $2#$b#Are you still heading out to work? Alright then. $3",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.1": "Outside? Is it raining again? $3#$b#It's okay. At least you'll be by my side tonight. $17 Alright, alright, go on. Don't forget to come back early. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.2": "What are you up to? $11#$b#Nothing? Then why are you standing so close? $12",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.3": "Have you heard about it, dear? $17#$b#Heard about what? You know what I mean, don't be silly. $11",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.4": "What a perfect day, don't you think? Look outside! $17#$b#Oh wait, never mind... it's raining again. $9",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day": "Finally, a bit of cool weather today. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.0": "You're back? Did you get soaked? $1#$b#Have you ever heard of something called an umbrella? $e#They say you can only get those in the city. Weird, right? $3",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.1": "How was your day? $7#$b#Let me guess, you didn't water the crops today! $1#$e#Alright, alright, let's get ready for bed. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.2": "Looks like this rain isn't stopping until tomorrow. $2#$b#What do you think, dear? $3#$e#So, ready for bed? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.3": "I don't like the rain. $2#$b#Especially summer rain. $3#$e#What do I like? Isn't it obvious? $11#$b#Of course, it's the person standing right in front of me. $12",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.4": "You're back? $1#$b#I'm glad. I was really worried about you. $17#$e#So, any plans for tonight? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night": "You're back, dear? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.0": "Another unbearably hot day, huh? $2#$e#Want some ice cream, bunny? [233] $7#$e#Bunny? You don't see it, but in my eyes, that's exactly what you are. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.1": "It's boiling outside, and you're still going out to work? $2#$e#Alright, just be careful not to overheat. $3#$e#Hey, aren't you forgetting something before you leave? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.2": "It's too hot to talk much today. $2#$e#Alright then, just promise you'll be back early tonight, okay? $3#$b#You've got me worried, seriously. $18",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.3": "Looks like it's another day of cleaning up. Everything feels sticky. $2#$e#It's fine, though. I've got the house covered, so you go do your thing. $7#$e#Seriously, go on. You're starting to feel sticky too. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.4": "Want something to eat? Maybe... this? [196 201 226 230 231 236 239 606 610 731 732] $7#$e#Delicious? Well then, get to work already. $17#$e#Go on, don't start clinging to me again. $11",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day": "Take care out there, okay? Don't get heatstroke. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.0": "You're back! Finally. $1#$b#So, what time are you planning to sleep? $7#$e#Alright then. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.1": "Was it hot outside? $17#$b#Alright, are you ready for bed yet?",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.2": "You didn't overheat, did you? It was crazy hot today. $1#$e#Good, I'm glad. Want some ice cream? [233] $7",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.3": "Hmm? $9#$b#Hehe. $17#$b#What? Nothing, seriously. $11",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.4": "Have you decided when you're going to sleep? $1#$e#Alright, I'll just do the same then. $3#$b#What? Don't overthink it. $11",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night": "Why are you back so late? Seriously. $18",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.0": "It's ridiculously hot out here. Seriously. $11#$e#If I'd known, I wouldn't have come out today. $12",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.1": "You're up? $7#$e#Oh, nothing. I just wanted to take a look around. $17#$b#I never thought I'd enjoy living on a farm, but it's actually pretty nice. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.2": "Heading out in this heat? You're something else. $17#$b#Alright then, hehe. $1#$e#Me? I don't need to work. $18",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.3": "Make sure you're back early tonight, okay? $17#$b#Alright, I'll be waiting at home. $7#$e#Okay, okay, go on already. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.4": "Want a cookie? I've got one left. [223] $7#$e#Of course, I saved it just for you. Honestly. $17#$b#Alright, alright, don't forget to come back early. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor": "I'm craving for some ice cream. $3#$b#Could you bring me one when you get back? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.0": "What is it? $3#$e#Alright then. $17#$b#It's so hot outside. Make sure to stay hydrated, okay? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.1": "Weren't you heading out? $17#$e#Alright, just don't come back too late. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.2": "Oh, you're awake. $17#$b#It's nothing, just feeling, um... $7#$e#I'm really happy being with you. Do I have to say it? Now go get to work! $4#$b#Ugh, you're making me all flustered. How can you do this? $11",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.3": "It's so hot today. Are you heading out again? $2#$e#Alright, fine, nothing. $11#$b#Seriously, it's nothing. Stop asking. $12",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.4": "Hmm? $3#$b#Didn't you leave already? $3#$e#So, how do I look today? Pretty, right? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.5": "What's the plan today, dear? $7#$e#Feel like drinking something? Maybe some milk? [184] $17#$b#Of course, it's just leftovers, silly. $11",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.6": "Hmm, alright then. $17#$b#It's nothing, just thinking about spending time with you. $7#$e#Of course it's fun! It's my favorite thing to do. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.7": "You're not ready yet? $9#$b#Come on, everyone's waiting for you. $17#$e#Hurry up, stop clinging to me already. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.8": "It's nothing! Seriously, nothing at all. $11#$e#Ugh, stop it already! You're so annoying sometimes! $12",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.9": "Ugh, you're here again. $17#$b#What? Don't be so petty, getting mad over a little teasing. $7#$e#Doesn't matter. I'm your wife, so deal with it! $17",
    "LiQingFeng.2.MarriageDialogue.summer.1": "Hehe. $12#$b#What's up? Oh, nothing, really. $11#$e#It's just... you smell kinda nice, you know? $12",
    "LiQingFeng.2.MarriageDialogue.summer.8": "A new week has started. $17#$b#Do you have plans for the week? $7#$e#Alright then, just remember to come back early tonight! $7",
    "LiQingFeng.2.MarriageDialogue.summer.10": "The governor's coming for his free meal tomorrow. $3#$b#Honestly, every time I see that guy, it makes me uncomfortable. $2#$e#But when I'm with you, that feeling disappears completely. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.2.MarriageDialogue.summer.11": "Don't forget to bring some ingredients. $7#$e#Me? No, I'm not really into drinking that kind of stuff. $11#$e#Oh, I have a bottle of milk here. Want to take it with you? [184] $12",
    "LiQingFeng.2.MarriageDialogue.summer.15": "Is it Monday again already? $3#$b#Time flies so fast when I'm with you. $7#$e#Alright, alright, off you go now. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.2.MarriageDialogue.summer.26": "This summer is finally coming to an end. $1#$e#Which also means no more ice cream in town. $2#$b#How about... we try making some at home instead? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.2.MarriageDialogue.summer.28": "Jellyfish, huh? $17#$b#Those creatures? I don't really know much about them. $1#$e#But with you, why not? I'm up for anything. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.patio": "Has it already started looking like this outside? $17#$b#So, have you decided what to do today? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.spouseRoom": "Huh? What is it? $11#$e#Alright, but come back early tonight, okay? $12",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.funLeave": "If I don't check on my house soon, it's going to be covered in dust. $17#$e#Don't worry, I'll be back tonight. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.funReturn": "Hmm? What is it, dear? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.0": "It's raining today? I didn't even notice. $3#$b#Okay, just be careful when you go out, alright? $17#$e#I don't want you to come home with a mess again. $18",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.1": "Rain again in the fall? $3#$b#Alright, just watch out when you head out, okay? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.2": "Looks like someone gets to skip watering the crops today. $17#$b#Isn't that right, dear? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.3": "Today? Hmm? $3#$b#It's just rain, so what's the deal? $17#$e#Alright, not planning to do anything else? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.4": "It feels so chilly today. $2#$b#And damp too. $3#$e#Wrap things up quickly and come home to warm up, alright? $3",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day": "Ugh, this weather again, really? $18#$b#Hmm? $3",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.0": "You're finally back. I've been waiting here forever. $1#$b#Ready? If you are, then let's...? $7#$e#What? Do I really have to say it? $11",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.1": "You didn't get soaked, did you? $17#$e#Good, now hurry up and get to bed. $1#$e#Why? Do you really need to ask? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.2": "You didn't get wet, did you? But you don't look so great. $3#$b#Good, I know you wouldn't leave me here all alone. $1#$e#Hurry up and get to bed. I've been waiting forever. $11",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.3": "Who are you? How'd you get in here? $3#$e#I'm your wife? You can't fool me. How could I be your wife? $17#$b#What's wrong? Did I scare you? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.4": "You're back? Good to see you made it. $1#$b#Got any plans for tonight? Like maybe...? $17#$b#That game? $11#$e#Just kidding, hehe. Now go to bed. $12",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night": "Have you decided when to go to bed yet? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.0": "Are you awake? It's getting colder outside. $17#$b#You should hurry and get things done before winter. I'll just wait for you here. $7#$e#Wait, aren't you forgetting something before you go? Hmm? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.1": "Have you figured out what you're doing today? $7#$b#Have you figured it out? $11#$e#You have? Then go ahead, but don't come home too late. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.2": "Want some cookies? [223] $7#$b#Alright, just don't be out too late. I'll be waiting for you here. $17#$e#Another kiss before you go? Really now. $11",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.3": "Look, something delicious! $1#$e#Where? Well, aren't you the most delicious thing here? $17#$b#You know I can't resist good food. $11#$e#Alright then, just don't be back too late. $12",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.4": "Heading out for work again? $1#$b#Alright, alright, off you go. $17#$e#Go on, why are you still staring at me? $11",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day": "Have you figured out what you're doing today? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.0": "Look who's back! $1#$b#How was your day? Bet it wasn't as fun as being here with me. $17#$e#Alright, alright, go get some rest. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.1": "Everything outside looks like it's withering away. $18#$b#Have you? Are you ready? $1#$b#Not planning to do something before bed? $11",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.2": "Glad you're back. Waiting for you was tough. $17#$b#Go freshen up, I'm getting ready for bed soon. $17#$e#Hurry up already, what are you still doing here? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.3": "Look who's here. $7#$e#It's nothing, just waiting for you to come home. Why? $17#$b#If it's nothing, then good. Same for me, tonight's just us. $4",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.4": "It looks so spooky outside, all yellow and red. $3#$b#But of course, with you here tonight, what's there to worry about? $1#$e#Or maybe... I should be more worried about you? $11",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night": "Why are you home so late? You had me really worried. $18",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.0": "The weather's really changing out here, isn't it? $3#$e#You're awake? $1#$b#Alright then, get to work, okay? Stop clinging to me all the time. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.1": "I really love it here. Because you're here. $1#$e#Of course, we still need to get some work done today. $1#$b#Go on, I'll take care of things at home. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.2": "It's so beautiful here, especially in the fall. $1#$b#Though it still can't quite compare to my family's garden. $7#$e#Alright, alright, seriously. Get to work already. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.3": "Have you figured out what you're doing today? In fall, I mean? $17#$b#Okay then, just make sure to come home early tonight. I don't want to be home alone. $18#$e#What? Stop staring and get going already. $11",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.4": "Do I look extra pretty today? $7#$e#Cute or not, I'm still your wife, hmph. $11#$b#Shoo, shoo, stop teasing me and go! $11",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor": "The weather's getting colder and colder. $3#$b#Alright, alright, off you go, get to work! $7",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.0": "You're heading out now? At this time? $3#$e#Alright, just don't catch a cold, okay? It's getting colder. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.1": "Hmm? What's wrong? $1#$e#Oh, nothing? Good. Now go on, get to work. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.2": "Fall feels nice, doesn't it? Except for all the fallen leaves everywhere. $17#$b#Still, it has its charm, don't you think? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.3": "I'm starving! $3#$e#You look tasty. Should I take a little bite? $11#$e#What? Don't act surprised! You nibble on me all the time! $12",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.4": "You're back again? So soon? $11#$e#No, it's nothing! Just go do your work already. $12#$e#Ugh, go on, stop being such a tease! $11",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.5": "Little bunny? $17#$b#My little bunny? $7#$e#Just teasing! Aren't you busy today? $1#$e#Alright, guess not. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.6": "What's a Junimo? $3#$b#A tiny spirit that looks like an apple? $17#$e#Oh, like that plushie in my room? Cute! $17",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.7": "Shouldn't you be working by now? Seriously! $18#$e#Go on, get to it! $2",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.8": "Do you have a favorite band? $17#$e#Wait, did I already ask you that? $3#$b#Ugh, my memory's awful sometimes! $17",
    "LiQingFeng.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.9": "It's getting colder, don't you think? $17#$b#Before long, everything will be covered in snow. $7#$e#Alright, you should go get ready now. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.2.MarriageDialogue.fall.1": "Everything outside is turning yellow, huh? $17#$b#Does that mean fall is here? $1#$e#Alright, go get busy, okay? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.2.MarriageDialogue.fall.8": "It's getting colder, seriously. $18#$e#Be careful when you head out, alright? $1",
    "LiQingFeng.2.MarriageDialogue.fall.15": "Are you ready for the showcase? $7#$b#Like with the crops you grew this year? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.2.MarriageDialogue.fall.16": "Did you get everything ready for today's festival? I heard Gus prepared a lot of delicious food. $17#$b#Don't forget to bring what you need before we go, okay? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.2.MarriageDialogue.fall.19": "Wait, is it... Friday already? $11#$b#Oh, it is Friday. What's up? $12#$e#Alright then, just come back early, okay? $11",
    "LiQingFeng.2.MarriageDialogue.fall.22": "Is fall already ending? $17#$b#I thought it had just started. $1#$e#So, what's your plan for today? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.2.MarriageDialogue.fall.26": "I heard this year's festival is different from last year's. $3#$b#Really? Is that true? $3",
    "LiQingFeng.2.MarriageDialogue.fall.27": "Why are you up so early, scaring people like that? $3#$b#I'm just kidding! What were you thinking? $7#$e#Alright then, see you tonight? $1",
    "LiQingFeng.2.MarriageDialogue.fall.28": "The weather report says it's going to be really cold tomorrow. $2#$e#Alright, make sure to dress warmly when you go out, okay? $3",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.patio": "It's gotten so cold outside, hasn't it? $3#$e#What's on your mind? $17#$b#Alright then, get to work. I'll be waiting for you at home. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.spouseRoom": "Even on cold days like this, the house needs tidying up. $1#$b#What's wrong? Have you decided what you're doing today? $17#$e#What? Do you still need that? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.funLeave": "The house is almost freezing over. I need to check on it today. $3#$b#Don't worry, I'll be back early. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.funReturn": "Hmm? What is it, dear? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.0": "Isn't it strange? Why is it raining in winter? $3",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.1": "Rain? In winter? $3",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.2": "What's going on? How can it rain when it's this cold? $3#$e#Do you know what's causing this, dear? $2",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.3": "How is it raining on such a cold day? $2",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.4": "Something's off with the weather today. Why would it rain in winter? $3",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day": "Why is it raining today, love? $3",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.0": "It's so strange, it rained all day today. $3#$e#Are you alright, dear? $2",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.1": "It rained all day outside today. $2",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.2": "Rain? In winter? And all day too? $2",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.3": "This rain is so odd. Why wasn't it snowing instead? $3",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.4": "Are you feeling cold, dear? This rain feels so unusual. $2",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night": "It's been raining all day today. $2",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.0": "It's freezing out today. Want me to whip up something for you? [231]$7#$b#Need anything else? If not, shouldn't you get to work? $17#$e#Alright, alright, off you go. Stop clinging me already! $1",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.1": "Do you know what you're doing today? $7#$e#Oh no, I don't get to say it. That's your business. $17#$b#Get going. Don't let me down! $7",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.2": "It really looks freezing outside. $#$b#Are you dressed warm enough? You're heading out like this? $2#$e#Don't catch a cold, okay? I don't want you to get sick. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.3": "What's going on? $17#$b#Oh, nothing? I thought something happened. $1#$e#Can you come back early tonight? I don't like being here alone. $18#$e#Alright, deal? One kiss to make it official. $11",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.4": "Want something to drink? Maybe some milk? [184]$17#$b#Finish it and come back early, okay? $7#$e#Alright, alright, get to work already. Stop clinging to me! $11",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day": "Do you know what you're doing today? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.0": "Well, look who's back. $1#$b#How was your day? You didn't catch a chill, did you? $17#$e#Good. So, what now? Got anything planned? $7",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.1": "You're home. It's freezing out there. Are you okay? $3#$b#On a night like this, want something warm to eat? [223]$17#$e#Alright, get into bed when you're done. It's freezing here! $7",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.2": "What's up? Are you starting this again? $11#$b#It's so late, and you're still clinging to me. $12#$e#Fine, let's talk in bed if it's so important. $15",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.3": "What now? You look like something's wrong. $7#$e#Alright, seriously. Just go to bed already. $17#$e#Stop sticking to me all the time. $18",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.4": "It's so cold tonight. $2#$e#Are you cold? Hm? $3#$b#How about I help warm you up later? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night": "You're late again. Seriously, what's going on with you? $11",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.0": "Has it gotten this cold outside? $3#$b#Even on a freezing day like this, you're still heading out to work? $1#$e#Alright then, just make sure to come back early tonight. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.1": "I actually kind of like winter. Don't you think it looks nice out here? $17#$b#At least it's cooler than summer, right? $7#$e#Stay warm out there. Don't catch a cold. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.2": "Getting a breath of fresh air feels really good. $1#$b#Do you know what you're doing today? $7#$e#Maybe something fun, like checking on the animals again? That sounds nice. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.3": "You're finally awake. I just came out to get some air. $1#$b#Alright, alright, get to work already. Stop hanging around me so much. $18#$e#Go on, seriously. You're such a tease. $18",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.4": "It's so cold out here. I think I'll head back inside soon. $2#$e#Alright, just don't be out too long. Come back early. $8",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor": "I should've worn something warmer out here. $2#$b#Could you wipe your shoes when you come back inside? $3",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.0": "The snow outside looks so white and pretty, doesn't it? But don't catch a cold, dear. $17#$e#Alright then, I'll wait for you at home. $1#$e#Okay, okay, just go already. You're at it again, seriously! $17",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.1": "I had the strangest dream last night, dear. $2#$b#What was it about? Well... $3#$e#I dreamed we were standing on a mountain, and you were saying all sorts of weird things. $2",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.2": "Would you like a cookie? I saved some from yesterday. [223] $9#$e#Too hard? Too hard, you say? $3#$b#Alright, I admit it, I messed up again. $2",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.3": "I still like winter a lot. At least there are no bugs around. $1#$b#What about you, dear? $7#$e#By the way, are you sure you're not forgetting to do something before you leave? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.4": "Horoscopes? Are you talking about... $17#$b#The ones in the sky? Constellations? $3#$e#I don't really understand all that horoscope stuff. Are you teasing me? $18#$e#Well, tease all you want. I'm still your wife. Deal with it! $11",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.5": "Once, there was this blonde guy who tried to win me over before you came to the valley. $3#$e#But I turned him down immediately, he was way too childish. $17#$b#Besides, I knew someone better was waiting for me. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.6": "What's up with you? Why do you keep coming back to check on me? $17#$e#Ugh, just go to work already, or we'll run out of money for the house! $11#$b#Go on, stop sticking to me all the time. $11",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.7": "Winter means no crops to plant, right? Dear? $7#$b#But you should still find something to do, how about making bubble tea? $17#$e#Oh, I guess that's more my thing. Never mind! $3",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.8": "What is it, my little bunny? $7#$b#What's wrong with calling you my little bunny? You're adorable, aren't you? $17#$e#You're not? Then does that make me the cute one? $7#$b#Hmm? Alright, alright, just make sure to come back early tonight. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.9": "Hmph. $11#$e#What's wrong? You already know, don't you? $12",
    "LiQingFeng.2.MarriageDialogue.winter.1": "It's so cold out. How about a cup of milk tea? $7#$b#Alright, I'll be here at home waiting for you. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.2.MarriageDialogue.winter.7": "Just like last year, I'm not going to that boring festival. $3#$b#If you want to go, go by yourself. $3",
    "LiQingFeng.2.MarriageDialogue.winter.8": "Staying home and sleeping sounds much better today. $2#$b#Never mind, I'll check on the house later. $3",
    "LiQingFeng.2.MarriageDialogue.winter.11": "On such a cold day, you're still heading out? $17#$b#Aren't you forgetting to do something before you leave? $1",
    "LiQingFeng.2.MarriageDialogue.winter.24": "Did you get me a gift? $7#$b#Of course, I'm your wife. Why wouldn't I get a gift? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.2.MarriageDialogue.winter.25": "There's going to be so much good food today. $1#$e#Don't forget to take a gift when you leave. $7",
    "LiQingFeng.2.MarriageDialogue.winter.28": "Another year is almost over, huh? $17#$e#Have you figured out what you're doing tomorrow? $7#$e#What? I'm asking what your plans are for tomorrow. $11",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.patio": "Look at the farm, you've really made it your own, haven't you? $27#$b#No offense, it's about what I expected. $26#$e#I think I'll stay out here a little longer. $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.spouseRoom": "Is something bothering you? Does the house feel a little off to you? $19#$e#You're such a tease. Don't you have plenty to do today? $24",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.funLeave": "I think I'll stop by the shop for a bit today. $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.funReturn": "I'm so tired today. I'm definitely going to bed early. $13",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.0": "I hate rainy days. $17#$b#Nothing ever dries on days like this. $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.1": "Looks like it's raining again, doesn't it? $26#$b#What did you usually do on rainy days? #$e#Just curious, alright? $27",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.2": "The good news is, you don't need to water the crops today. $1#$e#The bad news? We still have other things to take care of.",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.3": "The rain always comes right on time. $13#$e#Can you please hold me tight, as if it's the last time. $10",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.4": "It's going to be colder today, I think. $3#$b#Come back early, alright? $2",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day": "I'll never like weather like this. $19#$b#Every time it rains, the house starts leaking. $21",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.0": "You're back early. Can you wipe your shoes, please? $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.1": "It's been raining all day, ugh. $17#$e#Clean yourself up, will you? You're soaked.",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.2": "How are you feeling? $b#Oh, I was talking about the rain, not me. $19#$e#Me? Hmm... well, you know I wouldn't say no to you. $6",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.3": "It's getting late, @. $19#$e#How about we get cozy and warm? $22#$b#Go ahead, hop into bed. $1",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.4": "Look who's back, my hardworking farmer. $1#$b#How was your day? #$e#Seems like it went well. Ready to call it a night? $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night": "It's still so damp outside. I really don't like this weather. $3#$b#Can we head to bed early tonight? $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.0": "Good morning. $7#$b#What? Was that not cheerful enough? You should see the look on your face. $27#$e#Do you want me to say, 'Good morning, darling! I've been waiting here forever for you!'? $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.1": "Got any plans for today? #$e#Oh, nothing, just curious. $21#$b#Before you go, aren't you forgetting something? $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.2": "I haven't decided what I want to do today. $19#$b#What do you think? Any ideas?",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.3": "Oh, look who's finally awake. $25#$b#How did you sleep last night? $1#$e#I don't think today will be too busy. $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.4": "The weather looks nice today. $1#$b#Come back early, okay? Don't leave me waiting all the time. $13#$e#Alright, I guess there's nothing else for now. $12",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day": "My hair's a mess after last night. $26#$b#Don't tell me you married me just because of how I look. $27",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.0": "Haha, I'm so sleepy. $7#$b#Let's go to bed early tonight. Staying up late isn't great, you know. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.1": "Oh, you're back. #$b#It was a good day, wasn't it? $19#$e#Maybe next time, you can take even longer. Just kidding! $25",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.2": "It's getting late, darling. $1#$b#What? You want me to call you that? $27#$e#That sounds so cringy, don't you think? $26#$b#Alright, alright, let's just go to bed. I'm tired. $27",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.3": "Huh? You startled me. $19#$b#How was your day? Judging by the look on your face... #$e#Are you ready to call it a night? $13",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.4": "Oh, you're back! $22#$b#You know, I think I'm really starting to love this life with you. Honestly, I am. $26#$e#Alright, that's enough talk. Let's get some rest, okay? $27",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night": "It's late now. $19#$b#Go wash up and get to bed. $27",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.0": "This place is way prettier than I thought it would be. $19#$b#I never really imagined what living on a farm would be like. #$e#Aren't you working today? Or are you just staying here with me? $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.1": "It's so nice out here, though I'm more of an indoor person. $7#$e#So, not busy today, huh?",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.2": "Good Morning! $1#$b#It feels pretty great being outside like this. $19#$e#Can you believe it? I definitely do. $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.3": "Oh wow, you're up early today! $19#$b#Have you figured out what you're doing yet? #$e#Alright, I'll be home if you need me. $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.4": "Wish I had my own farm too. $3#$e#Just kidding, don't take it seriously. $25",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor": "Got a busy day ahead?",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Good.0": "Do you need something? Should I call you 'darling'? $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Good.1": "I was thinking about my past, but it's nothing compared to how wonderful life is now. $17",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Good.2": "You don't mind if I still look after my shop, do you? $15#$e#But if I don't go, no one else will run it. $14",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Good.3": "I'm fine, really.#$e#What are you overthinking again? $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Good.4": "What's wrong? $2#$e#Oh, it's nothing? That's good.",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Good.5": "Should we stop by and say hi to your mayor sometime? $19#$b#Actually, let's skip it, I don't want it turning into another Mayor Shifushan situation. $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Good.6": "@? $21#$e#@. $25",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Good.7": "I've been thinking about changing my hairstyle. $20#$b#Do you like how it is now? $19#$e#Alright then, I won't change it for now. $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Good.8": "Today? #$b#Or were you talking about yesterday? $19#$e#Oh, my bad, I must've gotten it mixed up. $16",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.MarriageDialogue.Good.9": "You want to talk? You want to talk with your adorable wife? $27#$b#I think we talked plenty last night. Go get busy now. $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.spring.1": "Winter's over. $17#$b#It's starting to feel warm again, hehe. $27",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.spring.7": "Hey, stop daydreaming! $13#$b#Alright, I'll snap out of it too. We've got a lot to do today. $12",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.spring.8": "The week flew by so fast. $21#$b#Alright, I think it's time to get busy. $17",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.spring.12": "The Egg Festival? Sounds fun. $19#$b#In our town, it's hard to have festivals like that.",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.spring.13": "Good morning, @. #$b#Not lively enough? Hehe. Good morning, good morning! $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.spring.23": "When I first heard about the Flower Dance, I never imagined a festival like that. $24#$b#So? Are you going to ask me to dance? $25#$e#I never thought I'd love dancing because of someone. $27",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.spring.24": "Morning! Guess I should get ready to dance with you today. $22#$b#Or... should we just stand there together and not dance at all? $20",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.spring.28": "My strawberries are wilting. $27#$b#But the ones indoors are doing alright. $1#$e#Come back soon, okay?",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.patio": "Wow, it's even hotter out here than I thought. $3#$b#I think I'll cool off inside for a bit. #$e#What's on your mind? $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.spouseRoom": "Don't you think it'd be nice to have air conditioning? $27#$b#What do you think? $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.funLeave": "Feel like stopping by the shop today? It could be fun! $22",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.funReturn": "That sounded really nice. $26#$b#Not ready to call it a night yet? $27",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.0": "Another rainy day. $3#$b#Maybe we can just stay in today.",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.1": "The weather's pretty bad today. $3#$b#I'm still not sure what to do. $13#$e#What's with that look? $10",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.2": "Looks like you won't need to water the crops today, huh? $19#$e#Can you clean up your shoes when you get back? $16",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.3": "It's raining, but at least it feels cooler. #$e#Come back soon, okay? $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.4": "Hmm, it's raining. $3#$b#Yeah, I noticed. $27",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day": "It feels so damp inside the house. $5#$b#I guess I'll spend the day tidying up. $5",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.0": "I hope the crops are okay. $3#$b#It's been raining all day. $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.1": "Ugh, the laundry didn't dry again. $19#$e#Have you decided what time you're heading to bed?",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.2": "Can we sleep early tonight? $6#$b#Hmm? $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.3": "The cooler weather feels nice. $1#$e#How was your day? Tell me about it! $22#$e#Or... never mind, forget I asked. $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.4": "Can you wipe off your shoes? $19#$b#Me? Mine are already clean. $19#$e#What? Want to check? Oh, yeah, let's just go to bed. $13",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night": "Sigh, it's still raining outside. $7#$b#But falling asleep to the sound of rain is kind of nice. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.0": "Good morning, my hardworking farmer. $1#$b#What's the plan for today? #$e#Oh wait, that's your job to figure out. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.1": "It's so hot today. $3#$b#I didn't even sleep well last night. $5#$e#Did I snore? $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.2": "Are you heading out today? $19#$b#Be careful, okay? Stay hydrated. $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.3": "Oh, you're awake! $26#$b#You were snoring pretty loud, you know. $27#$e#Anyway, come back early today, alright? $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.4": "There's a weird smell in here. Do you smell it too? $19#$b#I'll clean up today and see what's going on. $21",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day": "Sorry, I'm not great at making fancy breakfasts. $3#$b#Honestly, I'm not even used to eating breakfast. $2",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.0": "Glad you're home. $16#$b#Let's try to get to bed early, even if it's a bit warm inside. $17",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.1": "Good morning. $26#$b#Oh wait, I mean good night. $27",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.2": "How are the crops outside? #$b#I'm a little worried something might go wrong. $3#$e#Alright then. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.3": "Well, look who's back! $18#$b#Was it a busy day? $19#$e#Doesn't seem like it was. $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.4": "Sometimes I feel like I could just stay here forever and never go back to the bazaar. $27#$b#When did you decide to leave Zuzu City? $26#$e#Was it when you got your grandpa's letter? $21",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night": "Let's hope there aren't any annoying bugs bothering us tonight. $19#$b#You didn't bring any in with you, did you? $21",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.0": "It's so hot. $17#$b#I think I'll head back inside. $16",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.1": "The weather's nice today, but maybe it's a little too warm. $7#$e#Have you decided what you're doing today?",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.2": "Look at how you've cleaned this place up. $24#$b#It really looks like a proper farm now. $24",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.3": "Do you smell something? $19#$b#It's like... I don't know what it is. $19#$e#Oh, maybe it's just sweat. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.4": "So, this is your farm? $20#$e#No, this is *our* farm. $22",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor": "Was that a bug? $21#$b#Yeah, I think I'll head back inside soon. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Good.0": "What's wrong? Was it too hot? $3#$b#I mean, what do you expect me to do about it? $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Good.1": "It's so early. Isn't it a little soon for bed? $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Good.2": "Uh... do I need to say something? $27#$e#Go on, get to work. $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Good.3": "Are you worried about me? #$b#Seriously? $24",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Good.4": "It's kind of early to go to bed, isn't it? $27#$e#Don't worry, I've got everything under control here. $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Good.5": "Your clothes look a little dirty. $21#$b#Do you need to get them washed? $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Good.6": "What do you want to eat? I'm not much of a chef, you know. $17#$e#So, uh... don't expect anything fancy. $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Good.7": "It's so hot. $17#$b#I'm thinking of grabbing some popsicles from Qingfeng's place. $16#$e#Do you know how to make ice cream? $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Good.8": "No worries, everything's fine here. $21",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Good.9": "Do you want to talk? Again? $21#$b#What should we talk about? The future or the present? $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.Summer.1": "Ugh, the worst season is here. $27#$b#I hate this scorching heat. $16",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.summer.8": "This week flew by, at least that's how I remember it. $3#$b#Maybe it's the heat messing with time? $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.summer.10": "What's the holiday? A feast? $19#$b#Where I'm from, people don't gather and eat that much food. $21#$e#At least, not these days.",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.summer.11": "Do you need me to remind you about anything? Like what to bring? $26#$b#I think I could join you in trying out this holiday. $25",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.summer.15": "I guess this is the hottest part of the year. $5#$b#I just don't like this kind of temperature. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.summer.26": "Hm? $22#$e#Can you come back early tonight? I want to go to bed early. $22",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.summer.28": "If you want, I could go with you to see the jellyfish tonight. $b#But if you don't want to, just forget I said anything. $7#$e#I can't think of a reason you'd say no. $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.patio": "Looks like the yard is covered in fallen leaves. $3#$b#Have you ever tried cleaning them up? $2",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.spouseRoom": "I don't feel like cleaning today. $3#$b#How about you take care of it this time?",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.funLeave": "I'm heading out for a bit today. $7#$b#Take care of the house, alright? $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.funReturn": "How's everything at home? $19#$b#Glad to hear it's all good.",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.0": "Oh no, it's raining today. $21#$b#Be careful out there, okay? $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.1": "Haha. $27#$b#What are you laughing at? $26#$e#I'm serious, what's so funny? $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.2": "A cup of coffee would be perfect right now. $3#$b#Don't you feel how cold it is today? $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.3": "I think the house could use a little cleaning up today. $7#$e#You seem... unusually happy? $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.4": "The weather? $21#$b#It's pretty nice, don't you think? $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day": "Hmm? Got anything you want to talk about today? $27#$b#How'd you sleep last night? I didn't even notice it was raining. $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.0": "Want some coffee? #$b#It's what I didn't finish earlier. [(O)395] $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.1": "You're back? $22#$e#Dry off your clothes, will you? $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.2": "It's been raining all day, it feels so cold. $3#$b#Don't you think? $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.3": "How was your day? $19#$b#You look drenched. #$e#Do you want me to help you dry off? $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.4": "Hey! Dry off your shoes, will you? $5#$b#I just cleaned the floor today. $5",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night": "I feel like going to bed early tonight. $3#$b#Huh? Oh, no big reason, I'm just really tired. $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.0": "I was thinking about our future. $19#$b#What if we moved to the city someday? #$e#Alright, let's focus on today's tasks first. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.1": "Good morning! $1#$b#Looks like we have a lot to get done today. #$e#Or... should we leave it for tomorrow? $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.2": "Is there something on my face? $7#$b#Then why are you looking at me like that? $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.3": "Oh, sorry, I didn't notice you. $3#$b#About your snoring last night? $27#$e#What? Do you really want me to elaborate? $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.4": "Fall, huh? I almost forgot. $17#$b#So, could you come home early tonight? $22#$e#Maybe we could... you know, talk like we used to, about the old days? $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day": "The weather's nice today, isn't it? $19#$b#Yeah, it really is. $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.0": "I was hoping you'd... $3#$b#Never mind, forget I said anything. $2",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.1": "Oh no, I think someone's back. $4#$b#Am I right, @? $12",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.2": "No, I don't feel like kissing right now. $3#$b#It just feels a bit too early. $4#$e#But if you insist, go ahead. $4",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.3": "Oh, you're back. $16#$b#I thought I'd be sleeping alone tonight. $16#$e#What's wrong? $2",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.4": "Good evening, friend. $18#$b#Oh no, wait. I'm your wife now. $19#$e#Just kidding! $22",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night": "I think I heard a crow just now. $19#$b#No, not *that* crow, just a regular one. $21",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.0": "So many leaves have fallen. $3#$b#Looks like winter is on its way.",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.1": "Did you hear that? Was something making noise just now? $21#$e#I hope I imagined it. Really hope so. $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.2": "The air out here feels so nice. $1#$b#So much fresher than inside.",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.3": "Should we stock up on more firewood? $3#$b#I'm not sure if this will be enough for winter. $3#$e#Well, we can figure it out later.",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.4": "Oh, you're awake? $22#$b#I thought you were planning to sleep all day. $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor": "Or... $17#$b#Maybe we should just live here forever. $23",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Good.0": "It's not time to sleep right now. $3#$e#I'm serious. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Good.1": "You know what? I'm done for today. $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Good.2": "What's up with that look you're giving me? $7#$e#Alright then. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Good.3": "I think everything's fine around here. #$b#Not busy today? $2",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Good.4": "Why do you keep staring at me? $7#$e#Didn't get enough of me last night? $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Good.5": "Your lips... $19#$b#It looks like... there's something there? $21",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Good.6": "Is something wrong? Are you okay today? $26#$e#Then why are you grinning like that? What? $27",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Good.7": "Are you alright? $21#$e#I was just asking, that's all. $21",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Good.8": "Hey there. Hehe. $27",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Good.9": "What should we talk about today? $22#$b#My past? $19#$e#No, I don't feel like sharing that right now. $24",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.Fall.1": "The leaves have turned yellow. $27#$b#Do you have any plans for planting this fall? $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.Fall.8": "Hmm? $19#$b#Oh, you're awake?",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.Fall.15": "Let me guess. $19#$b#You've already got everything ready for the fair. $22",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.Fall.26": "I'm still trying to figure out what to do tomorrow. $7#$e#Got any suggestions? $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.Fall.27": "If it's alright, I'd love to go into town with you tonight. $25#$b#Though, it might be a late night. $24#$e#Alright then, see you tonight. $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.Fall.28": "Fall's almost over. $3#$b#I hope tonight's snow isn't too heavy. $3#$e#Well, see you in winter? $27",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Winter.MarriageDialogue.patio": "It's so cold. $3#$b#Do you feel cold too? $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Winter.MarriageDialogue.spouseRoom": "You know, it'd be nice if you let me know when you're awake. $3#$b#So I can be a little more prepared. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Winter.funLeave": "Feel like stopping by the shop today? $19#$b#I need to head back for a bit.",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Winter.funReturn": "Hmm. $3#$b#Everything's fine. $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Winter.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day": "Wait, what? Outside... $21#$b#It's raining? $19#$e#How is it raining in winter? $21",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Winter.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night": "This is so strange. $3#$b#It's been raining all day, but it's winter. $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Winter.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.0": "Good morning! Looks like the snow got heavier again. $20#$b#Are you heading out today? #$e#Want a cup of coffee before you go? [(O)395] $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Winter.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.1": "Wow, the snow outside is really heavy. $27#$b#It's much cozier indoors. $26#$e#Did you sleep well? Why else would you have that expression? $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Winter.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.2": "Hey, watch your drool! $5#$b#It got on my clothes last night. $11",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Winter.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.3": "I just want to spend the whole day by the fire. $7#$b#What do you think? $3#$e#Or do we have stuff to do today? $6",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Winter.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.4": "Oh no, the snow piled up again. $20#$b#I really don't feel like shoveling it. $19#$e#What do you mean? Do you have something in mind? $13",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Winter.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day": "Do I look good? $7#$b#Then why are you staring at me like that? $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Winter.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.0": "Good night? $1#$b#Isn't it a little early for that? $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Winter.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.1": "I hope it won't be too cold tonight. $7#$b#Thinking about going to bed early?",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Winter.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.2": "Have you... not taken a bath in a while? $17#$b#You smell... kind of strong? $19#$e#Well, suit yourself. $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Winter.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.3": "Look who's back. Hm? $22#$b#What did you do today? Tell me about it. #$e#Really? That much? $21",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Winter.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.4": "Do I look funny to you? $7#$b#Then why do you keep looking at me like that? $3#$e#Did I say something wrong? $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Winter.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night": "What can you even grow in winter? $21#$e#I'm not a farmer. How would I know? ",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Winter.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.0": "I can't even remember why I came out in this freezing weather. $3#$b#Aren't you cold? $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Winter.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.1": "Nice weather? Maybe just a bit too chilly. $19#$e#Come back soon, okay? $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Winter.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.2": "I wish the snow wasn't so heavy. $19#$b#Maybe I'll just head back inside soon. $16",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Winter.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.3": "Do we still have enough firewood inside? $26#$e#It's nothing, just asking. $27#$b#Is it wrong for me to ask? $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Winter.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.4": "Oh, you're awake? $22#$b#I thought you were going to sleep all day. $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Winter.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor": "It's so cold I'm tempted to go back to the shop. $3#$b#Just kidding. $22",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Winter.MarriageDialogue.Good.0": "Di you came back because of the cold? $22#$e#Want me to warm you up? $24",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Winter.MarriageDialogue.Good.1": "You look like you've been really busy. $21",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Winter.MarriageDialogue.Good.2": "Is something wrong? $21#$e#Glad to hear it's nothing. $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Winter.MarriageDialogue.Good.3": "What's on your mind? $3#$b#Actually, I don't feel like talking right now. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Winter.MarriageDialogue.Good.4": "Are you done for the day? $7#$e#Was it really that much? $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Winter.MarriageDialogue.Good.5": "Is it really cold out now? $2#$b#It doesn't feel that chilly inside, does it? $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Winter.MarriageDialogue.Good.6": "What are you laughing at? $27#$e#Is it that funny? $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Winter.MarriageDialogue.Good.7": "Ugh, unbelievable. $3#$e#Stop staring at me all the time. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Winter.MarriageDialogue.Good.8": "Are you okay? I'm fine, by the way. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Winter.MarriageDialogue.Good.9": "Hmm? $b#What is it? $3#$e#Oh, it's nothing? That's good. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.Winter.1": "It's so cold. $3#$b#I think we could make the fire a bit bigger. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.Winter.7": "No. $3#$b#What? Are you talking about tomorrow's festival? #$b#Maybe we could give it a try? $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.Winter.8": "Should we check out the Festival of Ice? $19#$b#If you're up for it, I'll go with you.",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.Winter.11": "Good morning. $22#$b#By the way, what day is it today? $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.Winter.24": "There's a festival in town tomorrow, right? $3#$e#Have you prepared anything for it? $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.Winter.25": "I hope your gift... $19#$b#isn't food again. $27#$e#I guess we'll see... $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.MarriageDialogue.Winter.28": "See you tomorrow? $19#$b#I guess so. $18",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Spring.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.5": "I don't think there's water on my face. $3#$e#Can you stop staring at me? $2",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Summer.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.5": "I don't like rainy days. $7#$b#But at least it's a bit cooler now, right?",
    "ChenXiaoMing.Fall.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.5": "I don't feel like saying much tonight. $26#$e#Talking like this is exhausting, you know! $27",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.patio": "What are you looking at? $5#$b#Are you here to water the strawberries or something? $5#$e#Fine, my bad. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.spouseRoom": "Can you act normal? You're scaring me. $3#$b#At least don't surprise me like that next time. $7#$e#Aren't you going to get to work today? $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.funLeave": "Does the house need anything? Maybe I can pick something up today. #$b#Or do you want to grab something yourself? $22",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.funReturn": "My day wasn't great today. $3#$b#Let's just call it a night. $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.0": "Ugh, it's so damp in here again. $3#$b#I'm so done with this weather. $5#$e#Do you like it? $7#$b#Oh right, you probably do since you don't have to water the crops. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.1": "Do I look good or something? $17#$b#Then why do you keep staring at me? $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.2": "I hope my strawberries are okay. $21#$b#This rain shouldn't ruin them... right? #$e#I hope so.",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.3": "I didn't sleep well last night. $7#$b#Probably because you were pulling my hair in your sleep. $3#$e#Are you even listening? $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.4": "Is the roof leaking? $20#$b#I really hope I'm just imagining it. $21#$e#Why are you still staring at me? $3#$e#Is there something on my face? $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day": "Could you wipe your drool, please? $7#$b#It's practically competing with the rain outside. $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.0": "Ugh, the house feels so damp again. $3#$b#Forget it, I'll clean it tomorrow. #$e#This weather is perfect for mold to grow, don't ask how I know. $17",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.1": "It's so chilly tonight. $13#$b#Don't you want to warm up a bit? $12",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.2": "What's wrong with my hair? $7#$b#I don't know why it looks like this either. $19#$e#By the way, did you wipe your shoes when you came in?",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.3": "Hungry? Well, I'm not much of a cook. $3#$b#Honestly, as long as it's not instant noodles, I'm fine. $7#$e#I never want to eat instant noodles again in my life. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.4": "You look like you got soaked. $7#$b#Just like the crops in the field. $24",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.5": "Did you wipe your shoes before coming in? $3#$b#Can you please wipe them? Seriously. $2",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night": "What? Do I look weird today? $3#$b#Then why are you giving me that look? $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.0": "Good morning. I hope you didn't notice me lying on your hair last night. $26#$b#If you want to complain, go ahead. I won't stop you. $27#$e#Will I see you in bed tonight? $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.1": "Do you really think I'm that interesting? $7#$b#I'm used to it, at least for now. $7#$e#Is there something on my face? Then why are you staring? $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.2": "I don't miss the past. $19#$b#Because life is so much better now. $22#$e#Had enough of my rambling? $27",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.3": "I feel much better today, at least for now. $22#$e#I hope I don't start losing my hair. $3#$b#That would be so awful. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.4": "The weather is nice outside? $19#$b#But I'd still rather stay indoors. $7#$e#I don't want to get too tan. I wouldn't like that. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day": "Is my personality bad? $3#$b#Maybe sometimes? I can be a little annoying? $24",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.0": "I saw a mouse today, can you believe it? $3#$b#Do you think I'd lie to you? $7#$e#Never mind, let's just sleep. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.1": "Oh, you're back. A little late, don't you think? $7#$b#Next time, why not wait until I'm asleep before sneaking in? $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.2": "Who's there? $21#$b#Oh, it's you. $19#$e#I thought you abandoned me again. $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.3": "I'm not hungry. $3#$b#I'm not planning to eat anything tonight. $3#$e#And don't try to eat me either. $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.4": "What do you want me to say? $26#$b#Happy birthday? How would I know whose birthday it is today? $27#$e#Aren't you getting tired of hearing me talk? $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night": "I'm so sleepy. $27#$b#Please don't pull my hair tonight, alright? $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.0": "I think I'm getting allergic to pollen. $2#$b#Or maybe the sunlight? $3#$e#I can't take it, I'm heading inside soon. $2",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.1": "I'm just standing here for a bit. $19#$b#Is that not allowed? $22",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.2": "What's that? A butterfly? $21#$b#Oh, guess not. I saw it wrong. $7#$e#Shouldn't you be working? $3",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.3": "Alright, I think I have nothing left to complain about. $3",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.4": "What are you staring at? $7#$b#Do I look that good? $3",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor": "The sun is way too bright today. $3#$b#I don't want to get tanned. $2",
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.0": "Why do you like staring at me so much? $3#$e#Did I do something wrong? $3",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.1": "I need to fix my hair again. $1#$b#It's going to get messy otherwise.",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.2": "Stop staring already. $3#$b#Okay? $2",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.3": "My strawberries outside don't need watering, right? $3#$e#Hopefully not. $7",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.4": "What made you fall for me in the first place? $3#$b#Was it my looks? $25#$e#Do you really think there's no one prettier than me? $24",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.5": "Done with work for today? Feels a little early. $3#$b#Oh, I'm just asking. $7",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.6": "Can you stop staring at me? $13#$e#You're still staring... $13",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.7": "Aren't you busy today? $3#$b#Really? $2",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.8": "What do you want? $22#$b#Just here to chat? $26",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.spring.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.9": "Maybe I should change my outfit. $3#$b#Does it... smell? $7#$e#You seem excited about that. $13",
    "ChenXiaoMing.2.MarriageDialogue.spring.1": "Ah, spring is here again. $21#$b#Hope this year won't be too busy. $3",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.2.MarriageDialogue.spring.7": "Are you bored being with me? $2#$b#Well, I don't think so. $3#$e#I think life is much better than before. $26",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.2.MarriageDialogue.spring.8": "I suddenly don't feel like going back today. $3#$b#How about you take care of me forever? $22#$e#No? I think it sounds great. $19",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.2.MarriageDialogue.spring.12": "Tomorrow? $7#$b#Another festival? $3#$e#As long as you're happy. $7",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.2.MarriageDialogue.spring.13": "You're so childish. $17#$b#Still looking for eggs? $7",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.2.MarriageDialogue.spring.23": "I hope you've practiced your dance moves for tomorrow. $3#$b#At least when you're with me. $22#$e#Or are you planning to dance with someone else? $2#$b#Who else would even want to dance with you besides me? $3",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.2.MarriageDialogue.spring.24": "Need a cup of coffee? [(O)395]$19#$b#Hope you've got your dance moves ready for today. $3#$e#At least when you're dancing with me. $7",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.2.MarriageDialogue.spring.28": "Spring is ending tomorrow. $29#$b#Hope this summer won't be as hot as last year. $2#$e#Why are you still staring at me? Is there something on my face? $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.patio": "Can't I come out and take a look? $3#$b#I should've stayed inside, the sun's going to burn me. $7#$e#Okay, I'll head back soon. $3",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.spouseRoom": "I don't even know why I brought so much stuff here. $26#$e#Is today really that busy? $7#$b#Oh, okay then. $17",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.funLeave": "I'm heading back to the bazaar check on something today. $7#$e#Honestly, I don't want to go out in this heat, but I have no choice. $3",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.funReturn": "I brought back a cup of coffee from the shop. [(O)395]$19#$b#Was it delicious?",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.0": "My hair's a mess from last night. $2#$b#Maybe you squished it. $2#$e#Or it's just naturally like this. $3#$b#Never mind, I'll fix it later. $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.1": "Oh no, it's raining again outside. $21#$b#I hope we don't get more bugs in the house.",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.2": "If I were you, I wouldn't go out today. $3#$b#But I'm not you. $7#$e#So, come home early, okay?",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.3": "I think I'm getting old, my hair's turning white. $2#$b#But it's just hair, I feel fine otherwise. $3#$e#Maybe one day I'll faint into your arms? $25",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.4": "Are you okay? $9#$b#You were snoring really loud last night. $29#$e#Well, as long as you're fine. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day": "Hmm? $9#$b#What is it? $2",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.0": "I hope it stops raining tomorrow. $3#$b#If it keeps raining, the laundry will have been for nothing. $2#$e#Did your shoes get wet again? $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.1": "I'm glad you're back. $3#$b#I don't think I could sleep alone. $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.2": "Busy day? You're soaking wet. $20#$b#Isn't that right? #$e#I'll do the laundry tomorrow, it's too late now. $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.3": "Huh. $2#$b#You look drenched. $2#$e#Of course, I noticed. I'm not blind. $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.4": "You're soaking wet. $7#$b#Guess there'll be more laundry tomorrow. $2",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.5": "Is there something on you? $20#$b#Oh, never mind, I was seeing things.",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night": "What are you staring at? $2#$b#Stop looking already, will you? $2",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.0": "Good morning. $19#$b#I've got a cup of coffee here. [(O)395]#$e#Though I already took a sip. $22",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.1": "The weather's nice today, isn't it?#$b#So, do you have any plans? $19#$e#You're even more boring than I thought. $2",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.2": "I love the days we spend here. $19#$b#Because I'm with you. $22#$e#Have you heard enough? $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.3": "Last night was so hot, I woke up drenched in sweat. $3#$b#No, it doesn't smell good, stop sniffing. $7#$e#Fine, do whatever you want. $2",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.4": "It's really hot these days. $2#$b#I wish the house were a little cooler. $3#$e#What are you staring at? Never seen your wife before? $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day": "When I woke up this morning, it felt like I was still asleep. $29#$b#I don't know why either. $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.0": "Oh, you're back?#$b#How was your day? $19#$e#Alright then. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.1": "Good night. $24#$b#What, can't I say good night if I'm not sleeping yet? $25#$e#Think whatever you want. $24",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.2": "What are you looking at? $19#$b#Stop staring and go to bed! $5#$e#Go on, stop wasting time. $2",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.3": "Still not going to bed? $7#$b#At least try to be quiet when you do. $3#$e#You're making me go gray over here. $29",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.4": "Good evening? $19#$b#Was it really that hot today? I thought it was fine. #$e#Can you tidy up before bed? $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night": "It'd be nice if we could see the stars from inside the house. $29#$b#What do you think?",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.0": "Outside? No, it's too sunny. $2#$b#Haven't you noticed my skin doesn't handle sunlight well? $3#$b#I'm starting to wonder if I've got a bit of vampire blood. $2",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.1": "Are those the veggies you planted? $21#$b#They're all edible, right? $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.2": "I hope there's nothing weird out here. $3#$b#You're not raising bugs or anything, are you? $26#$e#Stop staring at me and get to work. $29",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.3": "My skin feels like it's burning. $3#$b#Even my hair's turning white. $29#$e#Just kidding! $25",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.4": "Hmm? $7#$b#What's wrong with you? $2",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor": "Getting some fresh air feels great. $7#$b#At least, that's what I think. $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.0": "There's nothing on my face. $3#$e#And nothing on my clothes either, stop looking. $2",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.1": "Not busy right now?#$b#Then how about cleaning up the house? $2",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.2": "I had a dream last night, about you and me. $3#$b#We died together. Can you believe that? $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.3": "I still feel like having ice cream. $19#$e#Is that a problem? $9",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.4": "Everything's fine at home. #$b#So, what about it? $3#$e#It's nothing, I was just asking. $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.5": "My family called again a couple of days ago. $3#$b#But this time, no arguments. I told them I'm doing great now. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.6": "There shouldn't be any bugs on me, right? $20#$b#I think I scared them all off. $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.7": "Sometimes I wondered if coming back to this town was a mistake. $3#$b#But after meeting you, it feels like all those thoughts were pointless. $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.8": "What's up? $19#$b#Should I take some time to visit Pelican Town? $19#$e#What do you think?",
    "ChenXiaoMing.summer.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.9": "What are you looking at? $7#$b#Stop staring. $17#$e#Uh, you're still looking. $29",
    "ChenXiaoMing.2.MarriageDialogue.summer.1": "Summer's here. $2#$b#Be careful when you're out, alright? I don't want you getting heatstroke. $2",
    "ChenXiaoMing.2.MarriageDialogue.summer.7": "I feel like having ice cream. $3#$b#Preferably coffee-flavored. #$e#Let's talk about it tonight. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.2.MarriageDialogue.summer.8": "I hate Mondays. I always have, and I still do. $7#$b#But since being with you, they don't feel as hectic. $24#$e#Had enough of my rambling? Stop being clingy and get to work. $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.2.MarriageDialogue.summer.12": "Good morning? $19#$b#How about a cup of coffee? [(O)395]#$e#Coffee in summer should be fine, right? $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.2.MarriageDialogue.summer.13": "Cute? I don't think that word describes me. $27#$b#At least, that's how I see it. $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.2.MarriageDialogue.summer.23": "Time flies so fast. $3#$b#It'll be fall soon. $2#$e#Maybe there'll be fewer bugs in fall? $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.2.MarriageDialogue.summer.24": "I've got a cup of coffee here that I already drank from. [(O)395] $19#$b#Just a small sip, though. $22#$e#Does it taste bad? $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.2.MarriageDialogue.summer.28": "Tonight? Are we heading to the beach? $7#$b#If you insist on going, I guess I'll come with you. $3#$e#Or maybe we should just stay in and sleep instead. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.patio": "Fall's here?#$b#Of course, I noticed. $3#$e#I think it's better not to plant anything now. $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.spouseRoom": "Where did it go? $21#$b#I'm sure I left it right here. $18#$e#It's fine, I'll find it myself. $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.funLeave": "Did you come to buy something? $22#$b#I'm heading back to check on things today.",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.funReturn": "I'm so tired. $3#$e#Let's talk about it in bed. $2",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.0": "It feels like this rain started before dawn. $3#$b#And it's still going. $2#$e#Don't ask how I know. $7#$b#I woke up countless times because of the noise. $5",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.1": "The weather's getting colder every day. $3#$b#Maybe it's because of this rain.",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.2": "My back isn't doing great. $28#$b#So I don't like going out. $2#$e#Is that funny to you? $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.3": "What's your problem? $8#$b#Yeah, I'm talking to you, staring like that... $5#$e#Hey! You're the one acting like a robot here. $17",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day.4": "What is it now? $b#I thought you'd gotten into trouble again. $7#$e#Please come home early tonight. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day": "I'm not gone yet, okay? Please don't worry about me. $3#$b#At least I haven't died yet because of you. $24",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.0": "I once said goodbye to my past. $7#$e#Even though it hurt so much. $3#$e#Was it just to meet you? $27",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.1": "I think tonight we should? $13#$b#Go to bed early? $12",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.2": "Good evening? $19#$e#Want something to eat? $26#$b#Wait, did I hear that right? Do I look like I can cook? $27",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.3": "You know, I'm always at home. $3#$b#I've spent countless lonely rainy nights. $3#$e#But now it's different. $25",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.4": "Look at you, drenched like that. $24#$b#How about some new clothes tomorrow? $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night.5": "There wasn't a single ray of sunlight today. $3#$b#And now you're soaked too. $2",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night": "Can you believe it? Before meeting you, I didn't even care if I saw the sun the next day. $19#$b#Now the sun's not out, but I'm not so gloomy anymore. $22",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.0": "How'd you sleep last night? $2#$b#I dreamed about being with you. $2#$e#In bed, of course. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.1": "Sometimes I wonder, is this life even mine? $17#$b#Or maybe my old life was just that bad? $9#$e#You don't think that way too, do you? $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.2": "What are you looking at? Do you think my hair looks better today? $7#$e#Stop staring. Seriously, stop. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.3": "It's definitely getting colder. $19#$b#You'd better have some winter stuff ready. $3#$e#At least pretend you're prepared. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.4": "Good morning. $1#$b#What? Do I seem different today? $e#Maybe this is just the real me. $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day": "I don't feel like talking much today. $3#$b#Were you expecting something? Keep dreaming. $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.0": "Good evening. $19#$b#What, as your wife I can't say good evening? $26#$e#Ridiculous. Go wash up and sleep. $27",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.1": "Look who's finally back. $22#$b#How was your day? $e#Even more boring than I imagined. $25",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.2": "Huh? $7#$b#If you hadn't said anything, I might not have even noticed you. $3#$e#What's so weird about that? You're not exactly a celebrity. $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.3": "Did you hear something outside? $20#$b#Let's hope I'm just imagining it. $e#What time are you planning to sleep tonight? Hmm? $22",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.4": "I really hope I don't wake up three times tonight. $17#$e#One time I barely fell asleep and woke up again. $7#$b#Checked my phone, it was only midnight. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night": "Are you even real? $3#$b#Sometimes I feel like I'm just made up. $2",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.0": "Out for some fresh air? Doesn't seem like a bad idea. $19#$b#What do you think? $e#Oh, right, you're out here every day. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.1": "I guess I still don't fully understand farm life. $7#$b#Maybe I should learn a thing or two from you? $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.2": "Yeah, the farm is beautiful. $b#Is that enough for you? $27#$e#Now get to work instead of just standing around. $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.3": "The outdoors look kind of golden, huh? $21#$b#For a second, I thought... never mind. $e#So, what's your plan for the day? $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.4": "Let me guess, what are you planning to do next? $24#$b#Or should you just tell me outright? $25",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor": "Have you ever looked in a mirror? $3#$b#Oh, me? I can't. I'm too scared to look myself in the eye. $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.0": "What? I can't hear you. $19#$b#How about coming a little closer? $22",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.1": "What's the coolest way to go out these days? $9#$b#How would I know? Is it yelling hallelujah or something? $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.2": "I think being with you is worth it. $24#$b#Growing old together like this? Though, I've already got some gray hairs. $25",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.3": "You and me? $13#$b#Aren't we already together? $12",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.4": "I still think about that night. $3#$b#You and me, walking down the street, and that's when it all began... $13#$e#It was kind of scary. $14",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.5": "I've thought about trying on different clothes. $3#$b#But I thought you liked seeing me in this outfit. $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.6": "Shouldn't you be busy right now? $b#Or are you already done? $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.7": "Hmm? $9#$b#What is it? $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.8": "I'm even starting to get a little interested in cooking. $19#$b#Never mind, I'd probably blow up the kitchen. $26",
    "ChenXiaoMing.fall.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.9": "Cute? No, that's not me. $7#$b#Hey, what are you thinking? $22",
    "ChenXiaoMing.2.MarriageDialogue.fall.1": "The leaves are starting to fall outside. $20#$b#Can you still grow anything this season? $7",
    "ChenXiaoMing.2.MarriageDialogue.fall.8": "At least the weather's still nice and cool, right? $7#$b#It's not freezing just yet. $19#$e#Come back early tonight, okay?",
    "ChenXiaoMing.2.MarriageDialogue.fall.15": "Going back is so tiring. $17#$b#But I still have to check on things. $7#$e#Alright, fine. $17",
    "ChenXiaoMing.2.MarriageDialogue.fall.26": "Winter's just around the corner, isn't it? $28#$b#Want something to drink? [(O)395]#$e#Finish it and get back to work. $2",
    "ChenXiaoMing.2.MarriageDialogue.fall.27": "Tonight? Off to haunt someone? $22#$b#Or dressing up as a ghost could work too. $24",
    "ChenXiaoMing.2.MarriageDialogue.fall.28": "By tomorrow, the ground will look... $17#$b#As white as my hair? $19#$e#Don't you think? $22",
    "ChenXiaoMing.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.patio": "Why am I out here? I don't even know. $7#$b#And why are you out too? Aren't you cold? $17#$e#I almost forgot, without you, we wouldn't have dinner. $19",
    "ChenXiaoMing.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.spouseRoom": "Is my room that bad? $20#$b#No way, really? $26#$e#Well, suit yourself. $27",
    "ChenXiaoMing.winter.2.funLeave": "I don't want to go out in this cold weather. $2#$b#But there's still a ton of stuff to clean at the shop. $3",
    "ChenXiaoMing.winter.2.funReturn": "I'm going to turn into a snow leopard today. $13#$b#I think it's better if I just head back to bed. $13",
    "ChenXiaoMing.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Day": "Why is it raining today? $3#$b#Isn't it winter right now? $2",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Rainy.Night": "I know you're behind this weather. $24#$b#Am I right? $25",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.0": "Good thing we're indoors. $29#$b#Have you seen what it's like out there? $21#$e#Make sure to dress warmly if you're heading out.",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.1": "The snow outside looks a little strange. $20#$b#You know snow isn't supposed to be blue, right? #$e#Never mind, you wouldn't get it. $17",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.2": "I'm used to being alone. $17#$b#Doesn't it seem that way? But being with you feels so much better. $24",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.3": "Everything seems fine for now. #$b#At least nothing dramatic, like setting the house on fire, has happened. $3#$e#Don't ask how I know that. It wasn't me, okay? $7",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day.4": "You're up? $9#$b#Why not sleep a little longer? If I were you, I'd stay in bed every day. $28#$e#What? Got a problem with that? $7",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Day": "Look at me. Are you okay? $7#$b#If you're not feeling well, I can take you to the hospital instead of listening to nonsense here. $3",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.0": "Today wasn't great for me. $7#$b#What about you? #$e#Worse than me, huh? $24",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.1": "I want to sleep. $2#$b#It's so late. Why can't we just sleep? $3#$e#Whatever, do what you want. $3",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.2": "Come here. $3#$b#Are we not doing something fun tonight? $13#$e#Why not? $14",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.3": "Look who's back. $7#$b#Was something off today? #$e#Then why do you look like that? $3",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night.4": "Goodnight. $7#$e#What? Isn't it night right now? $29#$b#So goodnight. Go to bed. $7",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Indoor.Night": "You're not planning to go out again, are you? $3#$b#You'd really leave me here alone? $2",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.0": "The weather outside? Not bad. $28#$b#Or maybe it's not as nice as I thought. #$e#Come back early tonight, okay? $19",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.1": "It's the same out there as always. $17#$b#Actually, it feels even colder. $2",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.2": "You want me to say something? $3#$b#I don't really feel like talking. $7",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.3": "It's colder than I expected. $21#$b#Don't you think so? #$e#Maybe we just experience things differently. $7",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor.4": "I like winter, believe it or not. $22#$b#At least it's not too hot... just a little cold. $24",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Outdoor": "What? I haven't even washed my face yet. $7#$b#Let's talk later. $3",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.0": "Not busy? $19#$b#How about cleaning up a little?",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.1": "I still remember the first time I met you. $24#$b#I don't think I'll ever forget it. $7",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.2": "Everything at home seems fine. #$b#Nothing should go wrong... right? $3",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.3": "Stop staring already. $3",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.4": "You're acting weird today. $7#$b#Did you mess something up again? $7#$e#Not that I haven't done my fair share. $3",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.5": "Got a problem with me? $7#$b#Even if you do, keep it to yourself. $24",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.6": "It's pretty warm in here. $3#$b#When I lived alone, it was barely warmer than the fridge. $2",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.7": "Tell me a story from your past. $9#$b#Or just talk about anything. $7",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.8": "The bed is still the coziest place. $22#$b#But maybe it's a little early for that? $24",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.winter.2.MarriageDialogue.Good.9": "Let me think... $19#$b#You must have nothing to do today, huh?",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.2.MarriageDialogue.winter.1": "Oh no, it's starting to freeze outside. $20#$b#Guess that means winter is really here, huh?",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.2.MarriageDialogue.winter.7": "Is it Sunday? $3#$b#I thought it was Saturday. $7",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.2.MarriageDialogue.winter.8": "I'm not really into festivals. $17#$b#But I'm definitely interested in you. $24",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.2.MarriageDialogue.winter.11": "Why do you keep asking weird questions? $19#$b#Didn't I tell you I don't like fish? $9",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.2.MarriageDialogue.winter.15": "The night market? $29#$b#No, I'm not interested in that. $7#$e You should just go by yourself. $3",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.2.MarriageDialogue.winter.24": "I didn't get any gifts. $3#$b#Didn't you already take care of that for me? $24",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.2.MarriageDialogue.winter.25": "I hope nothing bad happens today. $7#$b#Like what? I have no idea. $19",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.2.MarriageDialogue.winter.26": "Did I drink too much last night? I don't even remember what happened. $27#$b#Is that funny to you? $26#$e#Is it really that funny? $9",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.2.MarriageDialogue.winter.27": "Winter's almost over. $7#$b#Have you thought about what to plant next year? $19",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.2.MarriageDialogue.winter.28": "No, this is terrible. $2#$b#How did the yard get so messy overnight? $3#$e#But hey, we can always plant more strawberries. $19",  
    /************* 路程对话  Strings Dialogue *************/
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Ice.Cream.Stand.1": "Are you here to buy ice cream too? $3",
    "LiQingFeng.summer.Ice.Cream.Stand.2": "Why can't this guy make more flavors of ice cream? $3#$b#Back home, even the smallest grocery store had all kinds of flavors. $1",
    "LiQingFeng.NightMarket.1": "Why are there so many vendors here but none selling food? #$b#I really should have brought some snacks. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.Drinking1": "What's wrong? $14#$e#Alright then. $13",
    "LiQingFeng.DesertFestival.3.1": "This guy makes pretty good food. $17#$b#I just don't get why he acts so weird when he's working. $3",
    "LiQingFeng.DesertFestival.3.2": "What's this animal? An elephant? $17#$b#Is it? $1",
    "LiQingFeng.DesertFestival.3.3": "This person always sells the strangest things. $3#$b#I think I saw her at the Night Market too last year. $17",
    "LiQingFeng.marriage.DesertFestival.3.1": "What is it, dear? $14#$b#Yeah, I really like coming here. The food is great. $13",
    "LiQingFeng.marriage.DesertFestival.3.2": "Are you shopping too, dear? $17#$b#Why do they all use those eggs as currency? I have no idea where to even get them. $18",
    "LiQingFeng.marriage.DesertFestival.3.3": "I think my outfit is already pretty enough. $1#$b#How does Emily come up with so many styling ideas? She's amazing.",
    "LiQingFeng.marriage.DesertFestival.3.4": "Every time I think about someone being amazed by this place, I can't help but laugh. $1#$b#Wait, are you the big shot everyone talks about? The Stardew Valley's Legend? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.marriage.Tue.1": "What's up, dear? $17",
    "LiQingFeng.marriage.Tue.2": "Why did you follow me, dear? $13",
    /************* 山顶对话  SummitEvent.Dialogue *************/
    "LiQingFeng.SummitEvent.Dialogue.01": "Every time I think about the first time we met, I just...$17",
    "LiQingFeng.SummitEvent.Dialogue.02": "I just can't help but...$12",
    "LiQingFeng.SummitEvent.Dialogue.03": "What kind of face is that? Seriously!$11",
    "LiQingFeng.SummitEvent.Dialogue.04": "Hmph, go ahead and enjoy the breeze on your own.$16",

    "ChenXiaoMing.SummitEvent.Dialogue.01": "I can't shake this feeling... $17",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.SummitEvent.Dialogue.02": "That one day, you'll leave me. $7",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.SummitEvent.Dialogue.03": "Maybe right after this. $3",  
    "ChenXiaoMing.SummitEvent.Dialogue.04": "I hope it's just me overthinking. $3",  
    /************* 电影  Movies *************/
    "LiQingFengmoviesInvitation": "Want to watch a movie? Sure! $1#$b#",

    "spring.0.LiQingFeng.Movies.BeforeMovie": "This movie looks like something only kids would enjoy. $17#$b#Do you actually like this kind of thing? $9",
    "spring.0.LiQingFeng.Movies.DuringMovie": "It's not as boring as I thought. $1#$b#I should've been more prepared for this. $7",
    "spring.0.LiQingFeng.Movies.AfterMovie": "That was better than I expected. $17#$b#Do you have any plans for what's next?",
    "spring.1.LiQingFeng.Movies.BeforeMovie": "A documentary? Really? $3#$b#They actually show these in theaters? $3",
    "spring.1.LiQingFeng.Movies.DuringMovie": "Wow, this is so boring. $8",
    "spring.1.LiQingFeng.Movies.AfterMovie": "Did you actually get it? $3#$b#I don't think I understood it at all. $2",
    "summer.0.LiQingFeng.Movies.BeforeMovie": "A western? My favorite is True Grit. $1#$b#Wait, this isn't True Grit? $3#$b#I was hoping to see something by the Coen Brothers. $2",
    "summer.0.LiQingFeng.Movies.DuringMovie": "Why does this guy look so familiar? Doesn't he always say: I have a plan? $3",
    "summer.0.LiQingFeng.Movies.AfterMovie": "Not exactly my favorite, but it was pretty good. $17",
    "summer.1.LiQingFeng.Movies.BeforeMovie": "What kind of movie is this? The people in it look so weird. $17#$b#Sci-fi? Is it one of those with tons of special effects?",
    "summer.1.LiQingFeng.Movies.DuringMovie": "Haha, they're even bigger than me! $1",
    "summer.1.LiQingFeng.Movies.AfterMovie": "Do you really think this is a good movie? $17#$b#I guess it's okay, but it feels like something for kids. $17",
    "fall.0.LiQingFeng.Movies.BeforeMovie": "Why does this poster look so creepy? $18#$b#I think I'll pass, I don't like horror movies. $18",
    "fall.0.LiQingFeng.Movies.DuringMovie": "What... what is that? A black winter root? $18",
    "fall.0.LiQingFeng.Movies.AfterMovie": "Nope, I can't talk right now, I need a moment to recover. $2",
    "fall.1.LiQingFeng.Movies.BeforeMovie": "W-what? Another horror movie? $16#$b#Nope, I just have to get through this somehow. $16",
    "fall.1.LiQingFeng.Movies.DuringMovie": "No, I'm not gonna like this. $3",
    "fall.1.LiQingFeng.Movies.AfterMovie": "Do you actually like these kinds of movies? I don't. $2",
